hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"601","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se - aur unhon ne is hadith ko Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak marfu' kiya - unhon ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs tasweer banayega use hukm diya jayega ke is mein ruh phoonke, aur woh hargiz is mein ruh nahi phoonk sakega; aur jo shakhs jhoota khwab dekhne ka da'wa kare use takleef di jayegi ke jau ke do danon ke darmiyan girah lagaye, aur woh hargiz girah nahi laga sakega; aur jo shakhs logon ki baaten kaan laga kar sune jabke woh us se bhaagte hon, Qayamat ke din uske kaan mein pighla hua sisa undela jayega.'"
"602","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ibn Aban ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se unhon ne farmaya: Allah tabarak wa ta'ala ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se jo shakhs ye jaan le ke mujhe gunahon ko bakhshne ki qudrat hai, main use bakhsh deta hun aur parwah nahi karta, jab tak woh mere saath kisi cheez ko shareek na kare.'"
"603","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne mujhe bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, ke Ibn Abbas ne ek aadmi se kaha: Kya main tumhein ek aisi hadith tohfa na dun jo tumhein khush kar de? Us aadmi ne kaha: Kyun nahi, Ae Abu Abbas, Allah aap par rehem farmaye. Unhon ne kaha: 'Tabarakallazi biyadihil mulk' padho, ise yaad karo, ise apne ghar walon, apni tamam aulad, apne ghar ke bachchon aur apne padosiyon ko sikhao; kyunki ye nijat dilane wali hai aur ye bachao karne wali hai - ye Qayamat ke din apne Rab ke samne apne padhne wale ki taraf se jhagra karegi aur sifarish karegi, aur apne Rab se sawal karegi ke use aag se nijat de agar ye uske dil mein thi. Aur Allah iske zariye iske saathi ko qabr ke azab se bachata hai. Ibrahim ne kaha: mere walid ne kaha: Ikrimah ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Meri khwahish hai ke ye meri ummat ke har fard ke dil mein ho.'"
"604","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab main bachchon ke saath ek ladka tha, hum ek jagah gaye, aur unhon ne mujhe apne saman par bithaya aur mujh se door chale gaye. Main baitha hua tha ke maine dekha do parinde aasman se utar rahe hain; ek mere dayen baitha aur dusra mere bayen. Maine dayen wale ko apne saathi se kehte hue suna: Kya ye wahi hai jiske paas humein bheja gaya hai? Usne kaha: Haan. Main isi halat mein tha ke mere saathi bachche meri taraf aaye; jab unhon ne unhein dekha to dono aasman ki taraf ud gaye.'"
"605","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Musa ke saathi jo samandar paar kar gaye barah qabile the, aur har raste mein barah hazaar afraad the, woh sab Ya'qub Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aulad the.'"
"606","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi apne ek bete ke saath Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, main chahta hun ke aap is atiye par gawah ban jayen jo main apne is bete ko de raha hun. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Kya iske alawa tumhara koi aur beta bhi hai?' Usne kaha: Jee haan. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tumne use bhi waisa hi diya jaisa tumne ise diya hai?' Usne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Phir main gawahi nahi dunga.'"
"607","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne khutbe mein Surah al-Ma'idah aur Surah al-Tawbah ki tilawat ki, phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo kuch Allah ne in mein halal kiya hai use halal qarar do, aur jo kuch Allah ne in mein haram kiya hai use haram qarar do.'"
"608","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muqeem hote hue do namazon ko jama kiya - to kya safar mein main unhein jama na karun?"
"609","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muqeem hote hue bhi aur safar mein bhi do namazon ko jama kiya."
"610","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine ek din Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke woh teen saanson mein pee rahe the. Maine kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, aapne teen saanson mein pani piya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Haan, ye zyada khushgawar, zyada shifa bakhsh aur zyada lazeez hai.'"
"611","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya: Abu al-Ahwas ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mere walid bahut boodhe hain jo Hajj karne se aajiz hain; kya main unki taraf se Hajj kar dun? Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Haan, apne walid ki taraf se Hajj karo.'"
"612","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne mujhe bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef laye jabke woh beemar the, aur Baitullah ka tawaf oont par sawar ho kar kiya, unke paas ek khamdar asa thi; jab bhi Hajr-e-Aswad ke paas se guzarte use usi se chhoote. Jab apna tawaf mukammal kar liya to oont ko bithaya, phir do rak'atein padhin."
"613","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya: Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ajlan se, Husayn se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) suraj dhalne tak rawanah na hote to Zuhr aur Asr ko jama karke padhte; aur jab suraj dhalne se pehle rawanah ho jate to unhein mu'akhkhar kar dete yahan tak ke dono ko Asr ke waqt mein padhte."
"614","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya: Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'idah se, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ash'aar ko misaal ke taur par padha karte the."
"615","Ali ibn Asim ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Ali al-Rahabi se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs Musalmanon mein se kisi yateem ko apni kafalat mein le, use khilaye pilaye yahan tak ke Allah use us se be-niyaz kar de, Allah uske liye Jannat zaroor wajib kar dega - siwaye iske ke woh koi aisa amal kare jo bakhsha na jaye. Aur jiske do mehboob Allah le le, aur woh sabr kare aur sawab ki niyat rakhe, Allah uske liye bhi Jannat zaroor wajib kar dega.' Sahaba ne kaha: Uske do mehboob kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: 'Uski do aankhein. Aur jo shakhs teen betiyon ki parwarish kare, un par kharch kare aur un se husn-e-sulook kare yahan tak ke woh rukhsat ho jayen ya faut ho jayen, Allah uske liye bhi Jannat zaroor wajib kar dega - siwaye iske ke woh koi aisa amal kare jo bakhsha na jaye.' Muhajireen mein se ek dehati aadmi ne aap ko pukara: Ae Allah ke Rasul, aur do? Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur do bhi.' Aur jab Ibn Abbas ye hadith bayan karte to kehte: Allah ki qasam, ye naadir aur qeemti ahadith mein se hai."
"616","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe khabar di: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd aur Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) so gaye yahan tak ke unke kharrate ki awaz sunai di, phir khade hue aur baghair wuzu kiye namaz padhi. Ikrimah ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mehfooz the."
"617","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di: Muhammad ibn Muslim ne humein khabar di, Amr ibn Dinar se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya ke saat haddiyon par sajda karen: peshani par - phir Tawus apna haath is tarah naak par pherte hue kehte - dono hathon, dono ghutnon aur dono qadmon par; aur ye ke na baal sameten aur na kapda."
"618","Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya: Usamah ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Muslim se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne safar mein namaz do rak'atein aur muqeem hone ki halat mein chaar rak'atein muqarrar farmayi. Jaise tum muqeem hone ki halat mein is se pehle aur iske baad namaz padhte ho, waise hi safar mein bhi agar chaho to is se pehle aur iske baad padho."
"619","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya: Ibrahim ibn Isma'il ne hum se bayan kiya: Abd al-Karim ne mujhe khabar di, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, ke woh kaha karte the: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek aurat ke paas se guzre jo apne kajave mein thi, aur usne ek haath se bachche ko uthaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi, kya iske liye Hajj hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Haan, aur tumhare liye ajr hai.'"
"620","Fahd ibn Awf ne mujhe bayan kiya: Abd al-Wahid ibn Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya: al-A'mash ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do qabron ke paas se guzre aur farmaya: 'In dono ko unki qabron mein azab diya ja raha hai, aur kisi bade gunah ki wajah se azab nahi diya ja raha: un mein se ek chughli karta tha, aur dusra peshab se ehtiyat nahi karta tha.' Phir aapne khajoor ki ek tehni li, use do tukdon mein toda, har qabr ke sirhane ek tukda gaad diya, aur farmaya: 'Umeed hai jab tak ye dono khushk na hon in se azab mein takhfeef rahegi.'"
"621","Hamein Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Sulayman se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) raat ko dua kiya karte the: 'Ae Allah, Tere hi liye hamd hai; Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo kuch un mein hai ka Rabb hai. Tere hi liye hamd hai; Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo kuch un mein hai ka Qayyum hai. Tere hi liye hamd hai; Tu aasmanon aur zameen aur jo kuch un mein hai ka Noor hai. Tera kalam haq hai, Tera wada haq hai, Teri mulaqat haq hai, Jannat haq hai, Jahannam haq hai, aur Qayamat haq hai. Ae Allah, maine Tere aage sar jhuka diya, Tujh par iman laya, Tujh par bharosa kiya, Teri taraf ruju kiya, Tere zariye jhagda kiya, aur Tere paas faisla laya. Mujhe bakhsh de jo maine pehle kiya aur chhup kar, jo maine muakhkhar kiya aur zahir kiya. Tu Allah hai; Tere siwa koi mabud nahin.'"
"622","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Uyaynah ne bayan kiya, Amr se, Ata aur Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ihram ki halat mein hijama karwaya."
"623","Hamein Abd al-Majid ibn Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Rawwad ne bayan kiya, Marwan ibn Salim se, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Momin bande ko us ki maut ke baad sab se pehle jo badla diya jata hai woh ye hai ke us ke janaze ke sath chalne wale sab bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"624","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya: hamein Talhah ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Hum, Ambiya ki jamaat, hukm diye gae hain ke apni sehri muakhkhar karein aur namaz mein apne dahne hathon ko apne baen par rakhein.'"
"625","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya: hamein Talhah ne bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Ae logo, ilaj karwao; kyunke Allah, jo aziz aur buland hai, ne koi bimari paida nahin ki magar us ke liye shifa paida ki hai - siwae al-Sam ke; aur al-Sam maut hai.'"
"626","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya: hamein Talhah ne khabar di, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmaya karte the: 'Jab tum mein se koi khana khae jo ungliyon se chaata jata hai, to apna hath na ponchhe hatta ke use chaat le ya chatwa le.'"
"627","Hamein Ya'la ne khabar di: hamein Talhah ne khabar di, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se behtareen woh hain jo tum mein se akhlaq mein behtareen hain.'"
"628","Hamein Sa'id ibn Amir ne khabar di, Hisham ibn Hassan se, Qays ibn Sa'd se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kehte: 'Allah us ki sunta hai jo Us ki hamd karta hai,' to kehte: 'Ae Allah, ae hamare Rabb, Tere hi liye hamd hai aasmanon ko bharne wali, zameen ko bharne wali, aur us ke baad jo kuch Tu chahe use bharne wali.'"
"629","Hamein Abu Asim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Jurayj ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ata ne khabar di ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi khana khae, to apna hath na ponchhe hatta ke use chaat le ya chatwa le; kyunke khane ke aakhri hisse mein barkat hoti hai.'"
"630","Unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe Abu al-Zubayr ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Pyale ko na uthao hatta ke use chaat lo ya chatwa lo; kyunke khane ke aakhri hisse mein barkat hoti hai.'"
"631","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Mubarak ibn Hassan se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasul, hamare sathiyon mein se behtareen kaun hai? Unhon ne farmaya: 'Woh jis ka dekhna tumhein Allah ki yaad dilaye, jis ki guftagu tumhare ilm mein izafa kare, aur jis ka amal tumhein Akhirat ki yaad dilaye.'"
"632","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Abi Layla se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aya aur kaha: Mere walid bahut buddhe hain jinhon ne kabhi Hajj ada nahin kiya; kya main un ki taraf se Hajj karun? Unhon ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhare walid par qarz hota, to kya tum us ki taraf se ada karte?' Us ne kaha: Ji han. Unhon ne farmaya: 'To un ki taraf se Hajj karo.'"
"633","Hamein Musa ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hammam ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Ka'bah mein dakhil hue, jis mein chhe sutun the; har sutun ke paas dua ya istighfar karte hue khade hue, aur namaz nahin padhi."
"634","Mujhe Abu al-Walid ne bayan kiya: hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Ayyub aur Qays se, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ek raat Isha-e-akhirah muakhkhar ki hatta ke log so gae, phir jage, phir soe, phir jage, phir soe, phir jage. Phir Umar aae aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, namaz, namaz. To Aap khade hue aur namaz padhi, aur wuzu ka zikr nahin kiya gaya."
"635","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya: hamein Hushaym ne bayan kiya: hamein Hisham ibn Hassan ne khabar di, Qays ibn Sa'd se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se: Jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ruku se sar uthate to farmate: 'Ae Allah, ae hamare Rabb, Tere hi liye hamd hai aasmanon ko bharne wali, zameen ko bharne wali, aur us ke baad jo kuch Tu chahe use bharne wali; ae hamd aur buzurgi wale, jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahin, jo Tu roke use koi dene wala nahin, aur kisi daulatmand ki daulat Tere muqable mein use kuch faida nahin deti.'"
"636","Hamein Isma'il ibn Abi Uways ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Bakr al-Jud'ani ne bayan kiya, al-Muthanna ibn al-Sabbah se, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Ae Ibn Abbas, Allah ki hifazat kar woh teri hifazat karega; Allah ki hifazat kar tu Use apne samne paega. Khushhali mein Allah ko pehchan woh sakhti mein tujhe pehchanega. Jan le ke jo tujhe pahuncha woh tujh se chootne wala na tha, aur jo tujh se choot gaya woh tujhe pahunchne wala na tha; aur ke agar tamam makhluq jama ho jaen ke tujhe koi cheez dein jo Allah ne tujhe dena na chaha ho, to woh aisa na kar sakein - ya tujh se koi cheez hatayen jo Allah ne tujhe dena chaha ho, to woh aisa na kar sakein. Qalam Qayamat ke din tak jo hone wala hai us par khushk ho chuka hai. Jab tu mange to Allah se mang, aur jab madad chahe to Allah se madad chah; kyunke madad sabr ke sath hai, kushadgi takleef ke sath hai, aur beshak tangi ke sath asani hai.'"
"637","Hamein Abu Nu'aym, Sulayman ibn Dawud, aur Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: 'Meri madad al-Saba (mashriqi hawa) se ki gai, aur Aad al-Dabur (maghribi hawa) se halak kiye gae.'"
"638","Hamein Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya: hamein Isra'il ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Muslim ibn Hurmuz se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Rukn-e-Yamani ko bosa dete the aur apna rukhsar us par rakhte the."
"639","Hamein Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya: hamein al-Hasan ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, Muslim se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chhoti aasteenon aur qadd wali qamees pehna karte the."
"640","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isra'il se, Abu Yahya al-Qattat se, unhon ne kaha: maine Mujahid ko Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek shakhs ke paas se guzre aur us ki ran khuli hui dekhi. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Apni ran dhaanp lo, kyunke mard ki ran us ke satr ka hissa hai.'"
"641","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Isra'il se, Abu Yahya se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs tum mein se raat ko ibadat ke liye qiyam ki taqat na rakhe, maal kharch karne mein bukhl se kaam le, aur dushman se qital par buzdili dikhaye - to use chahiye ke Allah ke zikr ki kasrat kare.'"
"642","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Isra'il se, Abu Yahya se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Qabr ka aksar azab peshab ki wajah se hai; lihaaza peshab se khoob bacho.'"
"643","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya: Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne hamein bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Mujahid aur Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujhe paanch cheezein ata ki gayi hain - aur main yeh fakhr ke taur par nahi kehta: Mujhe surkh o siyah ki taraf mab'us kiya gaya hai; mere liye zameen ko taharat ka zariya aur masjid bana diya gaya hai; mere liye maal-e-ghanimat halal kiya gaya hai halanke mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahi tha; ek maah ki musafat tak ru'b se meri madad ki gayi hai; aur mujhe shafa'at ata ki gayi hai jise maine apni Ummat ke liye Roz-e-Qiyamat tak mahfuz rakha hai - aur woh InshaAllah har us shakhs ko pahunchegi jo Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na kare.'"
"644","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya: Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne hamein bayan kiya, Yazid se, Mujahid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Log Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath haji ban kar aaye to Aap ne unhein hukm diya to unhon ne use Umrah bana diya, phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe pehle woh maloom hota jo ab maloom hua hai to main aisa na karta - lekin Umrah Hajj mein Qiyamat tak dakhil ho chuka hai,' phir Aap ne apni ungliyon ko ek dusre mein daal kar milaya, to sab logon ne ihram khol diya siwaye unke jinke saath qurbani ke janwar the, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath qurbani ke janwar the, Talhah ke saath qurbani ke janwar the, aur Ali Yaman se aaye, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne unse farmaya: 'Tum ne kis niyat se ihram bandha hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Jis niyat se Aap ne ihram bandha hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tumhare saath qurbani ka janwar hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Aap ne farmaya: 'Phir jaise ho waise hi raho, beshak tum mere qurbani ke janwaron mein se ek tihai mein shareek ho,' aur Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke paas sau qurbani ke janwar the."
"645","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Ramadan mein Madinah se das hazar Musalmanon ke saath Makkah ki taraf roze ki halat mein rawana hue aur logon ne roza rakha - yahan tak ke jab Aap al-Kadid par pahunche jo Usfan aur Qudayd ke darmiyan hai to Aap ne roza tod diya aur Musalmanon ne bhi Aap ke saath roza tod diya aur unhon ne Ramadan ke baqiya dinon mein se kuch bhi roza na rakha, al-Zuhri ne kaha: Iftar karna do mu'amalon mein se baad wala tha, al-Zuhri ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke mu'amle se jo baat li jati hai woh baad wali hai phir jo uske baad ho, al-Zuhri ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Makkah subah ke waqt pahunche jab Ramadan ki terah raatein guzar chuki thi."
"646","Uthman ibn Umar ne hamein khabar di: Yunus ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam logon mein sab se zyada sakhi the aur Ramadan mein sab se zyada sakhi hote jab Jibril Alaihis Salam Aap se milte, woh Ramadan mein har raat Aap se milte aur Aap ke saath Qur'an ka daur karte, jab Jibril Alaihis Salam Aap se milte to Aap bheji hui hawa se bhi zyada sakhi hote."
"647","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hamein bayan kiya: Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam har Ramadan mein Kitab Jibril Alaihis Salam ko pesh kiya karte the, jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam us raat ke baad subah karte jis mein Aap ne jo pesh karna tha pesh kiya to Aap bheji hui hawa se bhi zyada sakhi ho kar subah karte aur Aap se jo cheez bhi mangi jati to Aap ata farma dete, jab woh mahina aaya jiske baad Aap wafaat pa gaye to Aap ne use do martaba pesh kiya."
"648","Uthman ibn Umar ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Fatah wale saal Ramadan mein rawana hue aur roza rakha, jab Aap al-Kadid par the to Aap ne roza tod diya, Aap ke mu'amle se jo baat li jati hai woh aakhri hai aur aakhri ne pehle ko mansukh kar diya."
"649","Abu Asim ne hamein bayan kiya, al-Awza'i se, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne doodh piya phir kulli ki aur farmaya: 'Is mein chiknahat hai.'"
"650","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne chaar jandaron ko qatl karne se mana farmaya: cheenti, shehad ki makkhi, hudhud aur shrike."
"651","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Maymunah ki ek mari hui bakri ke paas se guzre aur farmaya: 'Tum ne iski khaal se faida kyun na uthaya?' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, jabke yeh murdar hai to kaise? Aap ne farmaya: 'Sirf iska gosht haram kiya gaya hai.'"
"652","Wahb ibn Jarir ibn Hazim ne hamein khabar di: mere walid ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Yunus ibn Yazid al-Ayli ko al-Zuhri se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Behtareen saathi chaar hain, behtareen dasta chaar sau hai, behtareen lashkar chaar hazar hai; aur barah hazar qalilat ki bina par maghlub nahi honge.'"
"653","Abu Nu'aym ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Ramadan mein bees rak'atein padhte the aur teen witr padhte the."
"654","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hamein bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein bayan kiya, al-Hajjaj ibn Artah se, al-Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne Abdullah ibn Rawahah, Ja'far aur Zayd ibn Harithah ko Shaam ki taraf rawana kiya, Ibn Rawahah peeche reh gaye to Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne unse farmaya: 'Tumhein kis cheez ne rok diya?' Unhon ne kaha: Main apna saman jama kar lun phir rawana houn, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne unse farmaya: 'Allah ke raste mein subah ya shaam ka ek qadam is duniya aur jo kuch ismein hai usse behtar hai,' to Abdullah rawana ho kar chal diye."
"655","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya: Ali ibn Hashim ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Layla se, al-Hakam se, Miqsam se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam aur Aap ke Sahaba sulah ke dauran us mua'hade se pehle jo Aap ke aur unke darmiyan tha aaye jabke mushrikeen Dar al-Nadwah ke darwaze par al-Hijr ki janib the aur unhon ne aapas mein kaha tha ke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam aur Aap ke Sahaba mashaqqat aur laghari mein mubtala hain, jab unhon ne Hajar-e-Aswad ko chhua to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne unse farmaya: 'Unhon ne kaha hai ke tum mashaqqat aur laghari mein mubtala ho lihaaza teen chakron mein ramal karo taake woh dekhein ke tum mein quwwat hai,' jab unhon ne Hajar-e-Aswad ko chhua to unhon ne apne qadam uthaye aur ramal kiya, phir unmein se baaz ne dusron se kaha: Kya tum ne daawa nahi kiya tha ke woh mashaqqat aur laghari mein mubtala hain? Halanke woh chalne par iktifa nahi kar rahe balke daud rahe hain."
"656","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe khabar di: Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne hamein bayan kiya, al-Hajjaj se, al-Hakam se, Miqsam se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne Abdullah ibn Rawahah ko ek dastay par rawana kiya aur uska ittefaq Jumu'ah ke din se hua, unke saathi subah rawana ho gaye lekin Abdullah ne kaha: Main ruk jata hun aur Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke saath Jumu'ah padh kar apne sathiyon se ja milunga, jab Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam namaz padh chuke to Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhein apne sathiyon ke saath subah rawana hone se kis cheez ne roka?' Unhon ne kaha: Maine chaaha ke Aap ke saath Jumu'ah mein hazir houn phir unse ja milun, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya: 'Agar tum zameen par jo kuch hai sab kharch bhi kar do to bhi unke subah ke qadam ke sawab ko na pa sakoge.'"
"657","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di: Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Abu al-Aliyah se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Pareshani ke kalimat yeh hain: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Haleem aur Azim hai; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Haleem aur Kareem hai; Uske siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo saat asmanon ka Rabb aur Arsh-e-Kareem ka Rabb hai.'"
"658","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne hamein bayan kiya: Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hamein bayan kiya, Qatadah se ke Abu al-Aliyah al-Riyahi ne unhein bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam pareshani ke awqat mein in kalimat ke saath dua karte ya inhein kehte: 'Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Azim aur Haleem hai; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Arsh-e-Azim ka Rabb hai; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo saat asmanon ka Rabb aur Arsh-e-Kareem ka Rabb hai.'"
"659","Abu Nu'aym ne hamein bayan kiya: Abd al-Salam ibn Harb ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Khalid al-Wasiti se, Qatadah se, Abu al-Aliyah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko dekha ke Aap ne Fajr ki do rak'atein padhi phir sajde ki halat mein so gaye yahan tak ke Aap kharrate lene lage ya zor se saans lene lage phir namaz ke liye khare hue, maine kaha: Ya Rasulallah, Aap so gaye hain, Aap ne farmaya: 'Wuzu sirf us par wajib hai jo let kar soye; kyunki jab woh aisa karta hai to uske jod dheele pad jate hain.'"
"660","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein bayan kiya, Yusuf ibn Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, Abu al-Aliyah se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: Jab Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko koi cheez ghamgeen karti to Aap farmate: 'Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Haleem aur Azim hai; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Arsh-e-Azim ka Rabb hai; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo Arsh-e-Kareem ka Rabb hai; Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi jo saat asmanon ka Rabb, zameen ka Rabb aur Arsh-e-Kareem ka Rabb hai' - phir Aap dua farmate."
"661","Ibrahim ibn al-Hakam ibn Aban ne hum se bayan kiya: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Abu Harun al-Ghitrif ne un se bayan kiya ke Abu al-Sha'tha ne un se bayan kiya ke Ibn Abbas ne un se bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne un se bayan kiya: Rooh al-Ameen ne un se bayan kiya ke Allah tabarak wa ta'ala ne muqarrar farma diya hai ke bande ke a'maal Qayamat ke din laye jayenge - us ki nekiyan aur us ki buraiyan - aur ba'z ka ba'z se muwazna kiya jayega. Agar us ke liye ek neki bhi baqi reh jaye to Allah us ke liye Jannat me jitna chahega kushaadgi farma dega. Ibrahim ne kaha: mere walid ne kaha: main ne Abu Salamah ibn Yazdad se kaha: Agar neki khatm ho jaye aur kuch baqi na rahe to kya hoga? Unhon ne kaha: 'Yehi woh log hain jin se hum un ke behtareen a'maal qubool karte hain aur un ki buraiyon se darguzar karte hain, ahl-e-Jannat me se - saccha wa'da jo un se kiya jata tha.'"
"662","Wahb ibn Jarir ibn Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya: Hisham ibn Hassan ne humen khabar di, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan safar karte the, Allah azza wa jalla ke siwa kisi se na darte hue, do rak'aten parhte hue hatta ke apne ahl-e-khana ki taraf laut aate."
"663","Mus'ab ibn Miqdam al-Khath'ami ne hum se bayan kiya: Abu Hilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan safar kiya, do rak'aten parhte hue, Allah azza wa jalla ke siwa kisi se khauf - ya darr - khaye baghair."
"664","Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Yusuf ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jab Allah azza wa jalla ne Fir'aun ko gharq kiya to us ne kaha: Main iman laya ke us ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin jis par Bani Isra'il iman laye. To Jibril ne kaha: Ay Muhammad, kash aap dekhte ke main samandar ki keechad le kar us ke munh me thoons raha tha, is darr se ke use rehmat pahunch jaye.'"
"665","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujh se bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Yusuf ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Koi banda aisa nahin magar ke woh khata karta hai ya khata ka irada karta hai - siwaye Yahya ibn Zakariyya alayhis salam ke. Aur kisi bande ko na kehna chahiye: Main Yunus ibn Matta se behtar hun.'"
"666","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Yusuf ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jibril alayhis salam ne mujh se kaha: Namaz aap ke liye mehboob banayi gayi hai, pas us me se jitna chaho le lo.'"
"667","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Yusuf ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas - sone wale ke khwab me - do farishte aaye; ek un ke qadmon ki taraf baitha aur dusra un ke sar ki taraf. Qadmon wale ne sar wale se kaha: Is shakhs aur us ki Ummat ke liye ek misaal bayan karo. Us ne kaha: 'Un ki aur un ki Ummat ki misaal musafir logon ki si hai jo ek jungle ke kinare pahunche, jin ke paas na jungle paar karne ka saman tha aur na wapas lautne ka. Jab woh is haal me the, ek sanwra hua shakhs umdah Yamani chadar me un ke paas aaya aur bola: Agar main tumhen hare bhare charagahon aur bhare hue hauzon tak pahuncha dun to kya tum meri pairwi karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Pas woh unhen le kar chala aur unhen hari bhari charagahon aur bhare hue hauzon tak le aaya, aur unhon ne khaya, piya aur mote ho gaye. Us ne un se kaha: Kya main ne tumhen us haal me nahin paya tha, aur tum ne mujh se wa'da kiya tha ke agar main tumhen hari bhari charagahon aur bhare hue hauzon tak pahuncha dun to tum meri pairwi karoge? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Tumhare aage is se zyada hari charagahen aur in se zyada bhare hue hauz hain, pas meri pairwi karo. Ek giroh ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha hai; Allah ki qasam, hum zaroor us ki pairwi karenge. Aur ek giroh ne kaha: Hum isi par raazi hain; hum yahin thehrenge.'"
"668","Uthman ibn Umar ne humen khabar di: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne humen khabar di, Sa'id ibn Khalid se, Isma'il ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Dhu'ayb se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam hamare paas tashreef laye aur farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen sab se umdah martabe wale shakhs ki khabar na dun? Woh mard jo Allah ki rah me apne ghode ki lagam pakde hue ho hatta ke woh mar jaye ya qatl kar diya jaye. Kya main tumhen us ke ba'd wale ki khabar na dun? Woh mard jo in ghatiyon me se kisi ghati me ho jo namaz qaim karta ho, zakat deta ho, aur logon ke shar se door rehta ho. Kya main tumhen sab se bure martabe wale shakhs ki khabar na dun? Woh jis se Allah ke naam par manga jaye phir woh us ki khatir na de.'"
"669","Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di: Shu'bah ne humen khabar di, Hajib ibn Umar se, al-Hakam ibn al-A'raj se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: 'Ashura nawin tarikh hai.' Main ne kaha: Kya Muhammad sallallahu alayhi wa sallam is tarah us ka roza rakhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"670","Wahb ibn Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya: Hajib ibn Umar ne humen khabar di, al-Hakam ibn al-A'raj se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas aaya jabke woh Zamzam ke ihaate se peeth lagaye hue the, aur main ne kaha: Mujhe Ashura ke bare me khabar dijiye. Unhon ne kaha: Us ke kis pehlu ke bare me puchte ho? Main ne kaha: Us ke roze ke bare me. Unhon ne kaha: 'Jab tum Muharram ka hilal dekho to nau gin lo, phir subah rozadar utho.' Main ne kaha: Kya Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam is tarah us ka roza rakhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"671","Yazid ibn Harun ne humen khabar di: Ibn Abi Dhi'b ne humen khabar di, al-Qasim ibn Abbas se, Abdullah ibn Umayr se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Agar main aainda saal tak zinda raha, in sha Allah, to main zaroor nawin tarikh ka roza rakhunga' - ya'ni Ashura."
"672","Husayn ibn Ali al-Ju'fi ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'idah se, Husayn se, Habib ibn Abi Thabit se, Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Abdullah ibn Abbas se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sath tha; aap khade hue, wuzu kiya, miswak ki, aur is ayat ki tilawat ki hatta ke use mukammal kiya: 'Beshak aasmanon aur zameen ki takhleeq me aur raat aur din ke badalne me aqal walon ke liye nishaniyan hain' - hatta ke unhon ne in aayaton ki tilawat surat ke aakhir tak ki. Phir aap ne do rak'aten parhin, phir laute aur so gaye hatta ke main ne aap ke saans ki awaz suni. Phir aap khade hue, wuzu kiya, miswak ki, do rak'aten parhin, phir teen ke sath Witr parha."
"673","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya: Salim ibn Ubayd ne humen khabar di, Abu Abdullah se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Layla se, ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Zameen par koi shakhs aisa nahin jo marta ho aur us ke dil me rai ke dane barabar takabbur ho magar ke Allah use Aag me dalega.' Jab Abdullah ibn Qays al-Ansari ne ye suna to woh ro pade. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Ay Abdullah ibn Qays, tum kyun rote ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Aap ki baat ki wajah se. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Khush ho jao, beshak tum Jannat me ho.' Phir Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek lashkar bheja, aur woh us me nikal kar lade aur shaheed ho gaye. Unhon ne use teen martaba dohraya. Phir Ansar me se ek mard ne kaha: Ay Allah ke Nabi, main chahta hun ke apni talwar ke tasme se, apne kapdon ko mail se dho kar, aur umdah tasmon aur jootiyon se zeenat ikhtiyar karun. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Meri murad ye nahin. Takabbur to sirf haq ko haqeer jan'na aur logon ko haqeer jan'na hai.' Us ne kaha: Ay Allah ke Nabi, haq ko haqeer jan'na aur logon ko haqeer jan'na kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Haq ko haqeer jan'na ye hai ke tumhara ek mard par maal wajib ho, aur woh inkar kar de, da'wa kare ke us par kuch wajib nahin; phir ek mard use Allah azza wa jalla se darne ka hukm de, kehte hue: Allah se daro - to woh kahe: Agar main Allah se us waqt tak na dara jab tak tum ne mujhe hukm diya, to main halak ho gaya. Yehi woh hai jo haq ko haqeer janta hai.' Aur us ne un se logon ko haqeer jan'ne ke bare me pucha. Aap ne farmaya: 'Ye woh hai jo apni naak unchi kiye aata hai; jab woh logon me se kamzor aur gareebon ko dekhta hai to na unhen salam karta hai aur na un ke sath baithta hai, unhen haqeer jante hue. Yehi woh hai jo logon ko haqeer janta hai.' Tab Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jis ne apna kapda upar uthaya, apni jooti gandhi, gadhe par sawari ki, ghulam ki ayadat ki jab woh bimar ho, aur bakri ka doodh doha, us ne takabbur se apne aap ko azaad kar liya.'"
"674","Yazid ne humen khabar di: Abdullah ibn Dukayn ne humen khabar di: Qays al-Masir ne hum se bayan kiya: Dawud al-Basri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Har momin ka ek gunah hota hai jis ki taraf woh baar baar lautta hai, ya ek gunah hota hai jise woh nahin chhorta hatta ke woh mar jaye ya us par Qayamat aa jaye. Momin gunahgar, bahut aazmaya jane wala, bahut khata karne wala, bhoolne wala paida kiya gaya hai; jab use yaad dilaya jata hai to woh yaad kar leta hai.'"
"675","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne mujh se bayan kiya: Hisham ibn Ziyad ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ka'b al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz rahimahullah ko janta tha jab woh Madinah me hamare governor the - ek jawan, bhare jism aur pure badan wale. Jab woh khalifa bane aur woh mehnat aur fikr bardasht ki jo unhon ne bardasht ki, un ki haalat badal gayi, aur main un ko dekhta rehta, apni nazar un se mushkil se hatata. Unhon ne kaha: Ay Ibn Ka'b, tum mujhe aisi nazar se dekhte ho jaisi nazar se tum ne mujhe pehle kabhi nahin dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Mujhe ta'ajjub hota hai. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhen kis par ta'ajjub hai? Unhon ne kaha: Tumhara rang jo badal gaya hai, tumhare baal jo gir gaye hain, aur tumhara jism jo dubla ho gaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Tumhara kya haal hoga agar tum mujhe teen din ba'd dekho, jab meri aankhen mere rukhsaron par beh jayengi, aur mere nathne aur munh peep aur keedon ke sath beh rahe honge - tum use aur bhi ajnabi paoge. Mujhe woh hadith dohraye jo tum ne ek martaba mujh se Ibn Abbas se bayan ki thi. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujh se bayan kiya - aur unhon ne use Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam tak marfu' kiya - unhon ne farmaya: 'Har cheez ki ek sharafat hai, aur majlison me sab se shareef woh hai jo qible ki taraf rukh ki hui ho. Sohbat sirf amanat ke sath hai. Na sone wale ke peeche namaz parho aur na baat karne wale ke peeche. Saanp aur bichchu ko qatl karo agarche tum namaz me ho. Dewaron ko kapdon se na dhanko. Jo apne bhai ki kitab me us ki ijazat ke baghair dekhe, goya woh Aag me dekhta hai. Jo chahe ke logon me sab se shareef ho, use Allah se darna chahiye; jo chahe ke logon me sab se taqatwar ho, use Allah par tawakkul karna chahiye; jo chahe ke logon me sab se ghani ho, use jo Allah ke hath me hai us par us se zyada bharosa karna chahiye jo us ke apne hath me hai. Kya main tumhen tum me se badtareen ki khabar na dun?' Unhon ne kaha: Haan zaroor, Ay Allah ke Rasool. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh jo akele rehta ho, apni madad rokta ho, aur apne ghulam ko marta ho.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen is se bhi badtar ki khabar na dun?' Unhon ne kaha: Haan zaroor, Ay Allah ke Rasool. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh jo logon se nafrat karta ho aur log us se nafrat karte hon.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen is se bhi badtar ki khabar na dun?' Unhon ne kaha: Haan zaroor, Ay Allah ke Rasool. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh jo thokar ko muaf na karta ho, na uzr qubool karta ho, na gunah bakhshta ho.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen is se bhi badtar ki khabar na dun?' Unhon ne kaha: Haan zaroor, Ay Allah ke Rasool. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh jis ki bhalayi ki ummeed na ho aur jis ke shar se aman na ho. Beshak Isa ibn Maryam apni qaum me khade hue aur farmaya: Ay Bani Isra'il, hikmat jahil ke samne bayan na karo, warna us par zulm karoge; aur use us ke ahl se na roko, warna un par zulm karoge; zulm na karo, aur zalim ko zulm ka badla na do, warna tumhara sawab tumhare Rabb ke huzur zaya ho jayega. Ay Bani Isra'il, muamlaat teen hain: ek muamla jis ki durusti wazeh ho, pas us ki pairwi karo; ek muamla jis ki ghalti wazeh ho, pas us se bacho; aur ek muamla jis me ikhtilaf ho, pas use us ke aalim ki taraf lauta do.'"
"676","Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya: Sufyan al-Thawri ne humen khabar di, Abdullah ibn Abi Najih se, Abdullah ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu al-Minhal se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam tashreef laye jabke woh phalon me saalon aage ke liye salaf kar rahe the. A"
"677","Humein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di: Sufyan ibn Husayn ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abu Sinan se, Ibn Abbas se, ke al-Aqra' ibn Habis ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se pucha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, kya Hajj har saal hai ya ek martaba? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahi, balke ek martaba; jo is se zyada kare to woh nafl hai.'"
"678","Humein Husayn al-Ju'fi ne bayan kiya, Za'idah se, Aban se, Shahr se, Ibn Abbas se - ise Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam tak marfu' karte hue - unhone farmaya: 'Kitab ki Fatiha Qur'an ke do tihai ke barabar hai.'"
"679","Mujhe Yusuf ibn Buhlul ne bayan kiya: Abdullah ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Isma'il ibn Umayyah se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jab Uhud mein tumhare saathi maare gaye to Allah ne un ki roohon ko sabz parindon ke peton mein rakh diya jo Jannat ki nehron par aate jate hain, us ke phalon mein se khate hain, aur Arsh ke saaye mein sone ke qandilon mein panah lete hain. Jab unhone apne peene, khane aur qiyam gaah ki lizzat ko pa liya to unhone kaha: Kaash hamare bhai jaan lete ke Allah ne hamare liye kya kiya hai, taake woh jihad se bezar na hon aur jang se peeche na haten. Allah azza wa jalla ne farmaya: Main tumhari taraf se ye baat un tak pahuncha dunga. Pas Allah azza wa jalla ne nazil farmaya: 'Aur un logon ko jo Allah ki raah mein qatl kiye gaye hain murda guman na karo' - hatta ke shuhada ka zikr mukammal hua.'"
"680","Humein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isra'il ibn Yunus se, Yahya al-Jabir se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, unhone kaha: Ibn Abbas se us shakhs ke baare mein pucha gaya jo jaan bujh kar kisi momin ko qatl kar de. Unhone kaha: 'Us ka badla Jahannam hai, us mein hamesha rehne wala, aur Allah us par ghazabnak hai' - ye ayat. Un se kaha gaya: Agar woh tauba kar le, iman le aaye, nek a'mal kare, phir hidayat pa jaye to kya hoga? Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Woh kaise hidayat pa sakta hai? Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Us ki maan use kho baithe - jo shakhs jaan bujh kar kisi momin ko qatl karega woh Qiyamat ke din apna sar apne ek haath mein uthaye hue aayega, dusre haath se apne saathi (maqtool) ko pakde hue, us ki shah rag se khoon Arsh-e-Rahman azza wa jalla ke saamne beh raha hoga, kehte hue: Is se puchiye is ne mujhe kis baat par qatl kiya. Qasam hai us Zaat ki jis ke Haath mein meri jaan hai, ye ayat nazil hui aur kisi ayat ne use mansookh nahi kiya hatta ke tumhare Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam wafaat pa gaye, aur us ke baad koi daleel nazil nahi hui.'"
"681","Zayd ibn Hubab ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Mu'min ibn Khalid al-Hanafi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Najdah ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas se Allah azza wa jalla ke is farman ke baare mein sawal kiya: 'Agar tum na nikloge to woh tumhein dardnaak azaab dega.' Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Arab ke qabail mein se ek qabile ko nikalne ki dawat di, lekin woh aap ke sath na nikle, pas un se baarish rok li gayi - aur wahi un ka azaab tha: 'Agar tum na nikloge to woh tumhein dardnaak azaab dega.'"
"682","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di: Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Mera Rabb raat ko mere paas behtareen surat mein aaya - mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: khwab mein - aur mujh se kaha: Ai Muhammad, kya tum jante ho mala-e-a'la kis baat mein jhagad raha hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi. To Us ne apna dast-e-qudrat mere kandhon ke darmiyan rakha hatta ke main ne us ki thandak apne seene ke darmiyan - ya meri gardan mein - mehsoos ki aur main ne jo kuch aasmanon aur zameen mein hai jaan liya. Us ne mujh se kaha: Ai Muhammad, kya tum jante ho mala-e-a'la kis baat mein jhagad raha hai? Main ne kaha: Jee haan - kaffaron ke baare mein. Aur kaffare ye hain: namazon ke baad masajid mein thehre rehna, jamaaton ki taraf paidal chal kar jana, aur sakhti mein wuzu ko kamil karna. Jo ye karega achhi zindagi guzarega, achhi maut marega, aur gunahon se aisa paak ho jayega jaise us din tha jis din us ki maa ne use jana tha. Aur ai Muhammad, jab tum namaz padho to kaho: Ai Allah, main Tujh se nek a'mal, buraiyon ko tark karne, aur masakeen se mohabbat ka sawal karta hun; aur jab Tu apne bandon ko fitne mein dalne ka irada kare to mujhe baghair fitne ke apne paas utha le. Aur buland darajat ye hain: salam ko aam karna, khana khilana, aur raat ko namaz padhna jab log so rahe hon.'"
"683","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Ali ibn Husayn se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Ansar ke sahaba ki ek jamaat mein baithe hue the ke ek sitara toda gaya aur chamak utha. Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab aisa zamana-e-jahiliyat mein hota tha to tum kya kehte the?' Unhon ne kaha: Hum kehte the: Koi bada paida hua hai, ya koi bada faut hua hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Ye na kisi ki maut ke liye toda jata hai aur na kisi ki zindagi ke liye. Lekin jab hamara Rabb tabarak wa ta'ala aasman mein kisi amr ka faisla farmata hai to hamilin-e-arsh Us ki tasbeeh karte hain, phir aasman wale tasbeeh karte hain, aur har aasman wale tasbeeh karte hain, yahan tak ke tasbeeh is aasman tak pahunch jati hai. Aasman wale hamilin-e-arsh se puchte hain: Tumhare Rabb ne kya farmaya? Woh unhein batate hain. Har aasman wale dusre aasman walon se puchte hain, yahan tak ke khabar is aasman tak pahunch jati hai, aur jinn uchak lete hain aur mare jate hain. Jo woh le aate hain woh haq hota hai, lekin woh us mein jhoot milate hain aur izafa kar dete hain.' Main ne al-Zuhri se kaha: Kya zamana-e-jahiliyat mein unhein mara jata tha? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: To Allah ke is farman ka kya matlab hai: 'Aur hum us mein sunne ke liye baithne ki jaghon par baitha karte the' - ye ayat? Unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mab'us hue to is mein sakhti kar di gayi aur is ka muamla shadid kar diya gaya."
"684","Shaddad ibn Hakim aur Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne hamein bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne hamein bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Sa'id ibn Abi Hind se, un ke walid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Do ne'matein aisi hain jin mein bahut se log dhoke mein rehte hain: sehat aur faraghat.'"
"685","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Shihab ne hamein bayan kiya, Layth se, Abu Fazarah se, Yazid ibn al-Asamm se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Teen khaslatein hain: jo in se paak ho, Allah ta'ala us ke siwa jo chahe jise chahe bakhsh dega: jo is haal mein mare ke Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho, aur jadugar na ho jo jadugaron ke peeche chalta ho, aur apne bhai ke liye dil mein keena na rakhta ho."
"686","Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hamein bayan kiya, Haywah ibn Shurayh ne hamein bayan kiya, Malik ibn Khayr al-Ziyadi se, ke Malik ibn Sa'd al-Tujibi ne un se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jibril mere paas aaye aur kaha: Ai Muhammad, beshak Allah ta'ala ne sharaab par, us ke nichodne wale par, jis ke liye nichodi jaye us par, us ke peene wale par, us ke uthane wale par, jis ke liye uthayi jaye us par, us ke bechne wale par, us ke kharidne wale par, us ke pilane wale par, aur jis ke liye pilayi jaye us par lanat farmayi hai."
"687","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dono Eidon mein pehli rakat mein Fatihatul Kitab aur 'Sabbihisma Rabbikal A'la' aur dusri rakat mein Fatihatul Kitab aur 'Hal Ataka Hadithul Ghashiyah' tilawat farmate the."
"688","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere liye Allah se al-Wasilah ka sawal karo; is duniya mein koi momin mere liye Allah se sawal nahi karega magar ye ke main qayamat ke din us ke liye gawah ya sifarishi, ya gawahi dene wala sifarishi banunga."
"689","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, al-Thawri ne hamein khabar di, Mansur se, Salim ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Kurayb se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas aane ka irada kare to kahe: 'Allah ke naam se, ai Allah, mujhe shaitan se door rakh aur shaitan ko us cheez se door rakh jo Tu hamein ata kare', aur un ke darmiyan bachcha muqaddar kar diya jaye to shaitan use kabhi nuqsan nahi pahunchayega."
"690","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Ibn Abi Mulaykah se aur Amr ibn Dinar se, Sa'id ibn al-Huwayrith se, Ibn Abbas se: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam qaza-e-hajat se bahar tashreef laye, phir aap ne khana khane ka irada kiya, aur kaha gaya: Kya aap wuzu nahi karenge? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe sirf namaz ke liye wuzu ka hukm diya gaya hai."
"691","Ja'far ibn Awn ne hamein khabar di, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hamein khabar di, Abu Raja al-Utaridi se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main ne jahannam mein jhanka to us ke aksar rehne wale auratein thi, aur main ne jannat mein jhanka to us ke aksar rehne wale fuqara the."
"692","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Tawus se, Ikrimah ibn Khalid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main Maymunah ke ghar mein tha, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam raat ko namaz ke liye khade hue, to main aap ke bayen taraf khada hua, to aap ne mera hath pakad kar mujhe apne dayen taraf kar diya, phir aap ne terah rakatein padhi jin mein Fajr ki do rakatein bhi shamil thi, aur main ne har rakat mein aap ke qiyam ka andaza 'Ya Ayyuhal Muzzammil' ki miqdar ke barabar lagaya."
"693","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, al-Thawri ne hamein khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Hayyah se, al-Dahhak ibn Muzahim se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shaks itna maal rakhta ho jo use Hajj tak pahuncha sake aur Hajj na kare, ya itna maal rakhta ho jis mein zakat wajib ho aur us ki zakat ada na kare, woh maut ke waqt wapas lautaye jane ki tamanna karega. Logon ne kaha: Ai Ibn Abbas, hum to samajhte the ke ye sirf kafir ke liye hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare samne is bare mein Quran padhta hun, phir unhon ne tilawat ki: 'Ai iman walo, tumhare maal aur tumhari aulad tumhein Allah ke zikr se ghafil na kar dein', yahan tak ke 'phir woh sadqa deta aur nek logon mein se ho jata' tak."
"694","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, al-Thawri ne hamein khabar di, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bashir se, Abdullah ibn Musawir se: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko Ibn al-Zubayr ka zikr karte aur un ki bakhili ka tazkira karte hue suna, phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Momin woh nahi jo pet bhar kar khaye jab ke us ka padosi us ke pehlu mein bhuka ho."
"695","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hamein bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main pehla shaks hun jis ke liye zameen phategi, aur main ye fakhr ke taur par nahi keh raha."
"696","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne mujh se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Safar ko Sa'id ibn Shufay se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat karte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab bhi apne ghar ya apne ahl se nikalte, wapas lautne tak musalsal do rakatein padhte rehte the."
"697","Yazid ibn Abi Hakim ne hamein bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Najih se, un ke walid se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kabhi kisi qaum se jang nahi ki yahan tak ke aap ne unhein dawat de di ho."
"698","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hamein bayan kiya, Imran ibn Zayd ne hamein bayan kiya, al-Hajjaj ibn Tamim ne hamein bayan kiya, Maymun ibn Mihran se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aakhiri zamane mein ek qaum hogi jinka laqab al-Rafidah hoga; woh Islam ko radd kar denge aur use chhod denge; unhein qatl karo, kyunki woh mushrik hain."
"699","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hamein bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murrah se, Abu al-Bakhtari se: Main ne Ibn Abbas se khajur ke darakhton ki farokht ke baare mein pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khajur ke darakhton ko bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us mein se kuch khaya jaye, ya yahan tak ke us ka wazan kiya jaye. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un ke paas baithe hue logon se kaha: Wazan se kya murad hai? Unhon ne kaha: Andaza lagana."
"700","Abu Nu'aym ne hamein bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, Imran al-Sulami se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Quraysh ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kaha: Apne Rabb se hamare liye dua kijiye ke hamare liye al-Safa ko sona bana de; agar woh hamare liye sona ban gaya to hum aap par iman le aayenge. To aap ne apne Rabb se dua ki, aur Jibril alaihis salam aap ke paas aaye aur kaha: Aap ka Rabb aap ko salam kehta hai aur farmata hai: Agar tum chaho to woh un ke liye sona ban jayega, lekin un mein se jo kufr karega main use aisa azaab dunga jaisa duniya jahan mein kisi ko nahi diya; aur agar tum chaho to main un ke liye tauba aur rehmat ka darwaza khol dunga. Aap ne farmaya: Ai Rabb, tauba aur rehmat ka darwaza."
"701","Hamen Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Sufyan se, Mansur se, Zirr se, Abdullah ibn Shaddad se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main apne dil me waswase ki koi cheez pata hun, main ise bayan karne ke bajaye koyla bana diya jana zyada pasand karunga. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah sab se bara hai, Allah sab se bara hai, tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne us ke muamle ko mehaz waswase tak mehdood kar diya."
"702","Hamen Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Sufyan se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Kya main tumhen Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke wuzu ki khabar na dun, phir unhon ne pani mangwaya aur wuzu kiya har uzw ko ek ek martaba dho kar."
"703","Hamen Qabisah ne bayan kiya, hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Ayyash ibn Abi Rabiah se, Hakim ibn Hakim ibn Abbad se, Nafi ibn Jubayr ibn Mutim se, Ibn Abbas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jibril ne mujhe Baitullah ke paas do martaba namaz parhayi, unhon ne mujhe Zuhr parhayi jab suraj dhal gaya tha jab woh tasma e naal ke andaze ke barabar tha, phir unhon ne mujhe Asr parhayi jab har cheez ka saya us ke barabar ho gaya, aur unhon ne mujhe Maghrib parhayi jab rozedar iftar karta hai, aur unhon ne mujhe Isha parhayi jab shafaq ghaib ho gayi, aur unhon ne mujhe Fajr parhayi jab rozedar par khana peena haram ho jata hai, phir unhon ne mujhe Zuhr parhayi jab har cheez ka saya us ke barabar ho gaya pichle din ke Asr ke waqt par, aur unhon ne Asr parhayi jab har cheez ka saya do guna ho gaya, aur unhon ne mujhe Maghrib parhayi jab rozedar iftar karta hai, aur unhon ne mujhe Isha parhayi jab raat ka pehla tihayi hissa guzar gaya, aur unhon ne mujhe Fajr parhayi jab roshni phail gayi, phir woh meri taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha: Ai Muhammad, yeh aap se pehle ambiya ka waqt hai, namaz ka waqt in do waqton ke darmiyan hai."
"704","Hamen Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne bayan kiya, hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman se jo khandan e Talhah ke azad karda ghulam hain, Kurayb se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Juwayriyah ka naam Barrah tha to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un ka naam Juwayriyah rakha. Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Fajr ki namaz parhi phir Fajr parhne ke baad unhen chhor kar tashreef le gaye aur nisf al-nahar tak baithe rahe phir woh tashreef laye jabke woh apni jaye namaz par thin. Unhon ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, main aap ke baad se musalsal ibadat me mashghool rahi hun. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhare baad aise kalimat kahe hain jo agar tumhare kahe hue ke muqabil me taule jayen to un se bhari hon, Allah ki tasbeeh us ki makhluq ki tadad ke barabar, Allah ki tasbeeh us ki zaat ki khushnudi ke barabar, Allah ki tasbeeh us ke Arsh ke wazan ke barabar, Allah ki tasbeeh us ke kalimat ki siyahi ke barabar, teen martaba."
"705","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Mandal ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Amr ibn Dinar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jise logon ki maujudgi me koi tohfa diya jaye to woh log us me us ke shareek hain."
"706","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Zuhayr ibn Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Uthman ibn Hakim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Said ibn Yasar ne khabar di, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fajr ki do rakaton me aksar jo tilawat farmate the woh pehli rakat me yeh ayat thi: Ham Allah par aur us par jo hamari taraf nazil kiya gaya iman laye, aur dusri rakat me: Ham Allah par iman laye aur gawah raho ke ham Musalman hain."
"707","Mujhe Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Bara ibn Abdullah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Nadrah ne bayan kiya ke Ibn Abbas Jumuah ke din Basrah ke mimbar par the aur unhon ne apne khutbe me kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni namaz ke aakhir me chaar cheezon se panah manga karte the farmate hue: Main qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mangta hun, aur main Jahannam ke azab se Allah ki panah mangta hun, aur main fitnon se un me se zahir aur poshida se Allah ki panah mangta hun, aur main kane kazzab se Allah ki panah mangta hun."
"708","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Hasan ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe bataya gaya ke Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs sharab ka aadi ho kar marega woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se buton ke pujari ki tarah milega."
"709","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Dawud ibn Qays ne bayan kiya, Salih se jo al-Tawamah ke azad karda ghulam hain, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Zuhr aur Asr ko aur Maghrib aur Isha ko baghair safar aur barish ke jama kiya. Logon ne kaha: Ai Abu Abbas, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne is se kya irada kiya ya unhon ne aisa kyun kiya, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne apni ummat ke liye aasani ka irada kiya."
"710","Hamen al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Ammar ibn Abi Ammar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko khwab me dopahar ke waqt paraganada aur gard aalud dekha un ke paas ek shishi thi jis me khoon tha. Maine kaha: Ai Allah ke Nabi, yeh kya hai, unhon ne farmaya: Yeh al-Husayn aur un ke sathiyon ka khoon hai, main aaj se ise jama karta raha hun. Unhon ne kaha: Us din ka hisab lagaya gaya to malum hua ke woh usi din shaheed kiye gaye the."
"711","Hamen al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Thabit al-Bunani se, Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jahannam walon me sab se halke azab wala Abu Talib hai, us ke pairon me aag ki do jutiyan hongi jin se us ka dimagh ubalega."
"712","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Ammar ibn Abi Ammar se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Main apne walid ke sath Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas tha aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam goya mere walid se eiraz farma rahe the. Jab ham khare hue to mere walid ne mujh se kaha: Ai mere bete, kya tum ne na dekha ke tumhare chacha zad bhai goya mujh se eiraz farma rahe the, maine kaha: Ai abba jaan, un ke paas ek shakhs tha jo un se sargoshi kar raha tha. Al-Abbas wapas gaye aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, maine Abdullah se aisa aisa kaha aur us ka dawa hai ke aap ke paas ek shakhs tha jo aap se sargoshi kar raha tha, kya aap ke paas koi tha, unhon ne farmaya: Ai Abdullah, kya tum ne use dekha tha, unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Unhon ne farmaya: Woh Jibril alaihis salam the."
"713","Hamen Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Harith ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamen Ubaydullah ibn al-Akhnas ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Mulaykah se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Goya main ek siyah tedhi tangon wale shakhs ko dekh raha hun jo use pathar pathar kar ke ukhad raha hai, yani Kabah ko."
"714","Hamen Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Harith ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamen Ubaydullah ibn al-Akhnas ne bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Abdullah se, Yusuf ibn Mahak se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jis ne sitarton ke ilm me se koi shaakh seekhi us ne jadu me se ek shaakh seekhi."
"715","Hamen Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne bayan kiya, hamen Said ibn Muhammad al-Thaqafi ne bayan kiya, hamen Salih ibn Hassan al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Kab al-Qurazi se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum Allah se mango to us se apni hatheliyon se mango aur us se un ki pusht se na mango aur un se apne chehron par masah karo."
"716","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne khabar di, hamen Jafar ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Jad Abu Uthman ne bayan kiya, Abu Raja se, Ibn Abbas se, Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se us hadees me jo woh apne Rabb se riwayat karte hain. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhara Rabb Raheem hai, jo shakhs neki ka irada kare us ke karne se pehle us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai aur agar woh use kar le to us ke liye das se saat sau tak balke kai guna zyada tak likhi jati hai, aur jo shakhs burai ka irada kare aur use na kare to us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai aur agar woh use kar le to us ke khilaf ek likhi jati hai ya is tarah ki koi baat, aur Allah ke han halak hone wala hi halak hota hai."
"717","Hamen Umar ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Amr ibn Murrah se, Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, Talq ibn Qays se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam yeh dua farmaya karte the: Ai mere Rabb meri madad farma aur mere khilaf madad na farma, mujhe ghalba ata farma aur mere khilaf ghalba na dila, mere haq me tadbeer farma aur mere khilaf tadbeer na farma, mujhe hidayat de aur mere liye hidayat aasan farma, aur jo mujh par zyadati kare us ke khilaf meri madad farma. Ai mere Rabb mujhe apna shukr guzar apna zikr karne wala apna khauf rakhne wala apna farmabardar apne huzur aajizi karne wala kasrat se ruju karne wala apni taraf lautne wala bana de. Ai mere Rabb meri tauba qubul farma mera gunah dho de meri dua qubul farma meri daleel mazbut farma meri zaban ko sachcha bana mere dil ko hidayat de aur mere seene ka keena nikal de."
"718","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamen Abd al-Rahim ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn al-Minhal se, Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi aise mareez ki iyadat kare jis ki maut ka waqt na aaya ho aur kahe: Main azmat wale Allah se azmat wale Arsh ke Rabb se sawal karta hun ke woh tumhen shifa ata farmaye, saat martaba, to use shifa di jayegi."
"719","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Amr se, Abu Hadir al-Azdi se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamane me qurbani ke ount na-yab ho gaye to unhon ne logon ko gaaye bail istemal karne ka hukm diya."
"720","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Abu Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Amr se, Mihran Abu Safwan se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se jo shakhs Hajj ka irada kare use jaldi karni chahiye."
"721","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaibah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah ibn Numair ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhone Haris ibn Fudail se, unhone Mahmud ibn Labid se, unhone Ibn Abbas se riwayat kiya, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed Bariq par hain, jo Jannat ke darwaze par ek neher hai, ek sabz gumbad mein; unka rizq subah o shaam Jannat se unke paas aata hai."
"722","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, hamein Sufyan ibn Husain ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs koi ghulam kharide jiske paas maal ho to uska maal bechne wale ka hoga illa ye ke kharidar shart laga le; aur jo shakhs gabha ki hui khajoor ke darakht kharide to unka phal bechne wale ka hoga illa ye ke kharidar shart laga le."
"723","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Umar par ek safed qamees dekhi aur farmaya: Kya ye tumhari qamees nai hai ya dhuli hui hai? Unhone kaha: Balke dhuli hui hai. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne unse farmaya: Naya pehno, qabil-e tareef zindagi guzaro aur shaheed ho kar maro."
"724","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log sau oonton ki tarah hain jinme aadmi mushkil hi se koi sawari ke qabil oont paata hai."
"725","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat hai: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka guzar Ansar ke ek aadmi ke paas se hua jo apne bhai ko haya ke baare mein naseehat kar raha tha, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Use chhod do, be-shak haya iman ka hissa hai."
"726","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko ye kehte hue suna: Labbaik Allahumma Labbaik, Labbaik la shareeka laka Labbaik, innal hamda wan ni'mata laka wal mulk, la shareeka lak. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Aur maine izafa kiya: Labbaik Labbaik, Labbaik wa sa'daik, wal khairu bi-yadaik, war raghbau ilaika wal amal."
"727","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Kisi Musalman aadmi ke liye ye jaiz nahi ke us par teen raatein guzar jayen magar ye ke uski wasiyat uske paas likhi hui ho. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Mujh par kabhi teen raatein nahi guzreen magar ye ke meri wasiyat mere paas thi."
"728","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat hai: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab Jumuah ki namaz padhte to apne ghar mein dakhil hote aur do rak'atein padhte."
"729","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hasad sirf do aadmiyon par hai: ek wo aadmi jise Allah ne Quran diya aur wo raat aur din ki ghaDiyon mein uske saath qiyam karta hai, aur dusra wo aadmi jise Allah ne maal diya aur wo raat aur din ki ghaDiyon mein usme se kharch karta hai."
"730","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab aadmi mar jaata hai to uska thikana subah o shaam us par pesh kiya jaata hai: agar wo ahl-e Jannat mein se hai to Jannat, aur agar wo ahl-e Jahannam mein se hai to Jahannam. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kaha jaata hai: Ye tumhara thikana hai jahan tum Qayamat ke din uthaye jaoge."
"731","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Khalid ibn Walid ko bheja, mera khayal hai Banu Jadhimah ki taraf, aur unhone unhein Islam ki dawat di, lekin wo sahi taur par keh na sake aur kehne lage: Saba'na Saba'na. Aur Khalid unhein qatl aur qaid karne lage. Unhone kaha: Phir unhone hum mein se har shakhs ke hawale ek qaidi kar diya, hatta ke ek subah unhone hamein hukm diya aur kaha: Tum mein se har shakhs apne qaidi ko qatl kar de. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Maine kaha: Allah ki qasam, main apne qaidi ko qatl nahi karunga, aur na mere sathiyon mein se koi apne qaidi ko qatl karega. Unhone kaha: Phir hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur Khalid ne jo kiya tha wo Aap se zikr kiya gaya. Unhone kaha: To Aap ne apne haath uthaye aur farmaya: Aye Allah, main Tere huzoor Khalid ke kiye se bari hun - do ya teen martaba."
"732","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se das rak'atein yaad rakheen jinhein Aap raat din padha karte the: Zuhr se pehle do rak'atein aur uske baad do, Jumuah ke baad do, Maghrib ke baad do, aur Isha ke baad do. Unhone kaha: Aur Hafsah ne mujhe bataya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Fajr se pehle do rak'atein padha karte the."
"733","Mujhe Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sa'd Zuhri ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhone Zuhri se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se riwayat kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: Ghaib ki kunjiyan paanch hain: Be-shak Allah hi ke paas Qayamat ka ilm hai, aur Wahi baarish nazil karta hai, aur jaanta hai jo rehmon mein hai, aur koi jaan nahi jaanti ke wo kal kya kamayegi, aur koi jaan nahi jaanti ke wo kis zameen mein maregi; be-shak Allah sab kuch janne wala, poori khabar rakhne wala hai."
"734","Mujhe Ahmad ibn Yunus ne khabar di, hamein Lais ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bilal raat mein azan deta hai, pas khao aur piyo hatta ke tum Ibn Umm Maktum ki azan sun lo."
"735","Hamein Abu Nu'aim ne bayan kiya, hamein Zam'ah ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhone Salim ibn Abdullah se, unhone apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ek hi surakh se do martaba nahi dasa jaata."
"736","Hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, hamein Shu'bah ne khabar di, Jabir se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam safar mein do rak'aton se zyada nahi padhte the siwaye raat ko tahajjud ke; aur Ibn Umar bhi do rak'aton se zyada nahi padhte the. Jabir ne kaha: Maine Salim se kaha: Kya dono witr padhte the? Unhone kaha: Haan."
"737","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, Salim ibn Abdullah se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat kiya, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne phal ko uski durusti zahir hone se pehle bechne se mana farmaya."
"738","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne bayan kiya, hamein Ubaidullah ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Salim se, unhone apne walid se, unhone apne dada se riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs mujh par jhoot bole uske liye Jahannam mein ek ghar banaya jaata hai."
"739","Hamein Abu Asim ne bayan kiya, Umar ibn Muhammad se, unhone Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Be-shak fitna yahan se, mashriq se uthta hai, jahan se shaitan ke do seengh namudar hote hain."
"740","Hamein Salm ibn Qutaibah ne bayan kiya, hamein Asim ibn Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, Salim se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat kiya: Umar ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se Umrah ke liye ijazat maangi to Aap ne unhein ijazat de di aur unse farmaya: Aye mere bhai, apni dua mein hamein na bhoolna. Umar ne kaha: Ye baat mere liye duniya se bhi zyada mehboob hai."
"741","Hamein Ubaidullah bin Musa ne khabar di, Sufyan se, Musa bin Uqbah se, Salim se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki qasam jis se aap qasam khaya karte thay ye thi: Nahi, dilon ko pherne wale ki qasam."
"742","Mujh se Ibn Abi Shaibah ne riwayat ki, hamein Abu Usamah ne bayan kiya, Umar bin Hamzah se, Salim bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abdullah bin Umar ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Qayamat ke din aasmanon ko lapetega, phir unhein Apne dayein haath mein lega, phir farmayega: Main Badshah hun, jabbar kahan hain, mutakabbir kahan hain? Phir zameenon ko lapetega, phir unhein Apne bayein haath mein lega, phir farmayega: Main Badshah hun, jabbar kahan hain, mutakabbir kahan hain?"
"743","Hamein Ya'la ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko suna jab aap ne sadqah-e-fitr farz kiya farmate hue: Khajooron ka ek sa' ya jau ka ek sa'. Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar sirf khajoorein diya karte thay, lekin ek saal un ki khajoorein khatm ho gayin, to unhon ne khajooron ki jagah jau ka ek sa' diya."
"744","Hamein Ya'la ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Safar mein jab kabhi barsaat wali raat hoti to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hamein Maghrib ki namaz parhate, phir hum apni sawariyon ki taraf laut jate; aur jab aap ke munadi ne Isha-e-aakhirah ki azaan di to apni azaan ke aakhir mein farigh ho kar pukarta: Ae logo, jama'at nahi hai, pas apni sawariyon mein namaz parho."
"745","Hamein Ya'la ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek nigraan hai aur tum mein se har ek apne rewar ke bare mein zimmedar hai: mard apne ghar walon par hakim hai, aurat apne ghar par nigraan hai, ghulam apne aaqa ke maal par nigraan hai, aur imam logon par nigraan hai; pas tum mein se har ek nigraan hai aur tum mein se har ek apne rewar ke bare mein zimmedar hai."
"746","Hamein Ya'la aur Muhammad bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hamein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne gharar wali bai' se mana farmaya; aur ye is liye ke jahiliyyat wale us bai' mein mubtala thay: ek shakhs buddhi oontni ke badle oont ke pet mein jo hai us ke pet ke bachche ko khareedta, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us se mana farmaya."
"747","Aur unhi ki sanad se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Jumu'ah ke din apni baithne ki jagah mein oonghne lage to use dusri jagah muntaqil ho jana chahiye."
"748","Hamein Ya'la aur Muhammad bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hamein Muhammad bin Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, unhon ne kaha: Jab safar Ibn Umar par dabao dalta to wo Maghrib ko muakhkhar karte yahan tak ke shafaq ghaib ho jati, phir utarte aur use Isha-e-aakhirah ke sath jama karte, kehte hue: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko isi tarah karte dekha jab safar aap par dabao dalta."
"749","Hamein Yazid bin Harun ne khabar di, hamein Hajjaj bin Artah ne khabar di, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs jaan boojh kar Asr ko chhore yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho jaye to goya us ke ahl o maal loot liye gaye."
"750","Hamein Abdur Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Ubaidullah bin Umar ne khabar di, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Umar ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se pucha: Kya hum mein se koi halat-e-janabat mein soyega? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur use namaz wale wuzu ki tarah wuzu karna chahiye siwaye apne pairon ke. Unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi Ibn Umar halat-e-janabat mein sona ya khana chahte to apni sharmgah, apni hatheliyan, apna chehra aur apne haath dhote."
"751","Hamein Yazid bin Harun ne khabar di, hamein Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin al-Mujabbar ne khabar di, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khubsurat chehron walon ke paas bhalai talash karo."
"752","Hamein Muhammad bin Bishr al-Abdi ne khabar di, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman mard par sunna aur ita'at karna lazim hai us cheez mein jise wo pasand kare aur napasand kare, jab tak use nafarmani ka hukm na diya jaye; jise nafarmani ka hukm diya gaya us ke liye na sunna hai na ita'at."
"753","Hamein Muhammad bin Bishr al-Abdi ne khabar di, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare samne ek Hauz hai jis ki wus'at Jarba ya Harba aur Azruh ke darmiyan fasle ke barabar hai."
"754","Hamein Muhammad bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya, hamein Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah Qayamat ke din awwalin o aakhirin ko jama karega to har ghadar ke liye ek jhanda buland kiya jayega, aur kaha jayega: Ye falan bin falan ki ghadari hai."
"755","Hamein Muhammad bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya, hamein Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ramazan mein wisal ke roze rakhe, aur aap ke sahaba ne bhi isi tarah kiya, to aap ne unhein mana farmaya. Aap se kaha gaya: Aap to wisal ke roze rakhte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhari tarah nahi hun; mujhe khilaya aur pilaya jata hai."
"756","Hamein Muhammad bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya, hamein Ubaidullah ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje, aur na apne bhai ki bai' par bai' kare, magar us ki ijazat se."
"757","Hamein Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr al-Jad'ani ne bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Umar bin Hafs se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, meri ummat ke liye us ki subah ke awwal hisse mein barkat ata farma."
"758","Hamein Abdul Malik bin Amr ne bayan kiya, hamein Nafi bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Nu'aim ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, aap ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne haq ko Umar ki zaban aur us ke dil par rakh diya hai."
"759","Hamein Abdul Malik bin Amr ne bayan kiya, hamein Kharijah bin Abdullah al-Ansari ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Allah, in do aadmiyon mein se jo Tujhe zyada mehboob ho us se Islam ko taqwiyat de: Umar bin al-Khattab ya Abu Jahl bin Hisham. Unhon ne kaha: Dono mein se Allah ke nazdeek zyada mehboob Umar thay."
"760","Hamein Ya'la ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad bin Aun al-Khurasani ne bayan kiya, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Hajar-e-Aswad ki taraf mutawajjih hue aur use chhua, phir der tak rote hue apne honth us par rakhe. Maine mud kar dekha to Umar ro rahe thay, to aap ne farmaya: Ae Umar, yahan aansu bahaye jate hain."
"761","Mujhe Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Sad al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhone apne walid se, woh Salih ibn Kaysan se: hamein Nafi ne Abdullah se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala jannat walon ko jannat mein dakhil farmayega aur jahannam walon ko jahannam mein dakhil farmayega, phir unke darmiyan ek pukarne wala khada hoga aur kahega: Ae jannat walo, ab maut nahi; aur ae jahannam walo, ab maut nahi; har shakhs hamesha usi haal mein rahega jis mein hai."
"762","Mujhe Yaqub ibn Ibrahim al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujhe mere walid ne bayan kiya, woh Salih ibn Kaysan se, unhone kaha: hamein Nafi ne bayan kiya ke Abdullah ne unhein khabar di, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Badr ke kunwen walon par ittila ki, phir unhein pukara aur farmaya: Ae kunwen walo, kya tum ne apne Rabb ke wade ko sachcha paya? Aap ke baaz sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya aap murdon ko pukar rahe hain? Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo kuchh main keh raha hun tum unse zyada achhi tarah nahi sun rahe."
"763","Mujhe Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne Salih ibn Kaysan se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: hamein Nafi ne bayan kiya ke Abdullah ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Log Qayamat ke Din Rabb al-Alamin ke samne khade honge yahan tak ke un mein se koi apne paseene mein apne kanon ke darmiyan tak dhans jayega."
"764","Hamein Said ibn Amir ne bayan kiya, woh Abdullah ibn Umar al-Umari se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi aadmi ko uthakar phir uski jagah na baithe; balke jagah kushada karo aur wus'at paida karo. Aur jab koi aadmi Ibn Umar ke liye apni jagah se uthta to woh usmein na baithete."
"765","Hamein Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Muqri ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ibn Ayyub ne bayan kiya, woh Zayd ibn Jubayrah se, woh Dawud ibn Husayn se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne saat jagahon mein namaz padhne se mana farmaya: kura karkat ki jagah, zabahgah, qabristan, raste ke beech, hammam, unton ke baithne ki jagah, aur Allah Ta'ala ke Ghar ki chhat ke upar."
"766","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Quran ko sath lekar safar na karo, kyunki main uske liye dushman se mehfooz rehne ka itminan nahi karta."
"767","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, woh Sufyan se, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se: Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne barish wali sardi aur hawa wali raat mein safar ke dauran apne muazzin ko hukm diya ke elan kare: Apni sawariyon par namaz padh lo."
"768","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah ibn Umar ibn Hafs ibn Asim ibn Umar ibn al-Khattab ne bayan kiya, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Quran ko lekar dushman ki zameen ki taraf safar na karo, kyunki mujhe dar hai ke kahin woh usmein se kuchh haasil na kar lein."
"769","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Talhah ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, woh Nafi se, unhone kaha: Ek aadmi Ibn Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya aap ne in aankhon se Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko dekha hai? Unhone kaha: Haan. Usne kaha: Aur aap ne in zabanon se unse baat ki aur in hathon se unki bai'at ki? Unhone kaha: Haan. Us aadmi ne kaha: Aap ko khushkhabri ho. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Kya main tumhein woh baat na bataun jo maine Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna? Usne kaha: Haan. Unhone kaha: Maine unhein farmate hue suna: Khushkhabri hai uske liye jisne mujhe dekha aur mujh par iman laya, do martaba; aur khushkhabri hai uske liye jisne mujhe nahi dekha aur mujh par iman laya, teen martaba."
"770","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, hamein Malik ne bayan kiya, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs is duniya mein sharab piye phir usse tauba na kare to use aakhirat mein usse mehroom kar diya jayega aur use woh pilayi nahi jayegi."
"771","Hamein Ubaydullah ne khabar di, woh Mubarak ibn Hassan se, woh Nafi se, unhone kaha: Ibn Umar ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Ae Ibn Adam, do cheezein kabhi teri na thin, unmein se ek: maine tere maal mein se tere liye ek hissa banaya hai jab main tujhe halaq tak le aun, taake main uske zariye tujhe paak aur saaf kar dun, aur teri muddat khatam hone ke baad mere bandon ka tujh par namaz padhna."
"772","Mujhe Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, hamein Zuhayr ne bayan kiya, hamein Musa ibn Uqbah ne bayan kiya, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Hajjat al-Wada mein apna sar mundwaya."
"773","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari aur tum se pehle do kitabon walon ki misaal us aadmi ki si hai jisne mazdoor ujrat par liye aur kaha: Kaun subah se dopahar tak ek qirat par kaam karega? To Yahudiyon ne kaam kiya. Phir usne kaha: Kaun dopahar se Asr ki namaz tak ek qirat par mere liye kaam karega? To Isaiyon ne kaam kiya. Phir usne kaha: Kaun Asr ki namaz se suraj ghuroob hone tak do qirat par mere liye kaam karega? To tumne kaam kiya. Yahudi aur Isai ghusse hue aur kehne lage: Hamara kaam zyada aur ajr kam kyun? Usne kaha: Kya maine tumhare haq mein se kuchh kam kiya hai? Unhone kaha: Nahi. Usne kaha: Yeh mera fazl hai; main jise chahta hun deta hun."
"774","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne muzabanah se mana farmaya. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Muzabanah yeh hai ke aadmi apni zameen ka phal nape hue andaze se beche: agar zyada ho to uska, aur agar kam ho to usi par hai."
"775","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: mujhe Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Maine Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai; upar wala hath dene wala hai, aur neeche wala hath mangne wala hai."
"776","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) Fatah ke Din tashreef laye aur Ka'bah ke sahan mein utre, aur Uthman ibn Talhah ko bulwa bheja, woh chabi lekar aaye. Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) Uthman ibn Talhah, Usamah aur Bilal ke sath Baitullah mein dakhil hue. Jab woh bahar nikle to log unki taraf jaldi se badhe, to maine Bilal se kaha: Kya Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Ghar ke andar namaz padhi? Unhone kaha: Haan. Maine kaha: Kahan? Unhone kaha: Agle do sutunon ke darmiyan, uske samne wale hisse ki taraf rukh karke."
"777","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhein dawat di jaye to dawat qubool karo."
"778","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, woh Ayyub se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehli ummaton ki muddaton ke darmiyan tumhari muddat sirf Asr ki namaz se suraj ghuroob hone tak ke waqt ke barabar hai."
"779","Hamein Yaqub ibn Ishaq al-Hadrami ne khabar di, hamein Sakhr ibn Juwayriyah aur Wuhayb ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs qasam khaye aur kahe: In sha Allah, to usne istisna kar liya."
"780","Mujhe Yahya ibn Yahya ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Khaythamah ne bayan kiya, woh Musa ibn Uqbah se, woh Nafi se, woh Ibn Umar se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne hukm diya ke Zakat al-Fitr logon ke namaz ke liye nikalne se pehle ada ki jaye."
"781","Shababab ibn Sawwar ne hum se riwayat ki, Ibn Abi Dhib ne hum se riwayat ki, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke Aap Maghrib ke baad ki do rakatein aur Jumuah ke baad ki do rakatein apne ahl-e-khana ke darmiyan ke siwa ada na farmate the."
"782","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se riwayat ki, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se riwayat ki, Ayyub se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ne Fajr tulu hone se pehle azan de di, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein hukm diya ke wapas jayein aur elan karein: Beshak banda so gaya tha. To woh wapas gaye aur elan kiya: Beshak banda so gaya tha, beshak banda so gaya tha."
"783","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Shihab ne hum se riwayat ki, Hamzah al-Jazari se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ki misal sitaron ki si hai, jin se hidayat talab ki jati hai; tum un mein se jis kisi se us ka qaul lo ge, hidayat pao ge."
"784","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Numayr ne hum se riwayat ki, Fudayl ibn Ghazwan se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Fatimah ke pas tashrif laye aur un ke darwaze par ek parda paya, to Aap un ke pas andar tashrif na laye. Unhon ne kaha: Aap kam hi un ki ijazat ke baghair dakhil hote the. Ali aaye aur unhein ghamgin dekha, aur kaha: Tumhein kya hua. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere pas tashrif laye aur mere pas andar tashrif na laye. Ali Aap ke pas gaye aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Fatimah ne is baat ko bura jana ke Aap un ke pas tashrif laye aur un ke pas andar tashrif na laye. Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe duniya se kya wasta, aur mujhe naqsh-o-nigar wale kapron se kya wasta. Unhon ne kaha: Woh Fatimah ke pas gaye aur unhein Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke farman se agah kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kahiye: Aap mujhe kya hukm farmate hain. Aap ne farmaya: Un se kaho: Woh ise falan ke beton ko bhej dein."
"785","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne hum se riwayat ki, Ubaydullah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamane mein hum chalte hue khate the aur khare hokar pite the."
"786","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Numayr ne hum se riwayat ki, Malik ibn Mighwal se, Muhammad ibn Suqah se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke liye ek majlis mein shumar karte the: Mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de aur mujh par tawajjoh farma, beshak Tu hi bahut tauba qabool farmane wala, bakhshne wala hai, sau martaba."
"787","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Bukayr ne mujh se riwayat ki, Zuhayr ibn Muhammad se, Musa ibn Jubayr se, Nafi se, Abdullah ibn Umar ke azad karda ghulam se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, ke unhon ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab Allah ne Adam ko zamin ki taraf utara, to farishton ne kaha: Ae Rab, kya Tu is mein aise ko rakhega jo is mein fasad karega aur khoon bahayega, jabke hum Teri hamd ke sath tasbih karte hain aur Teri taqdis karte hain. Allah ne farmaya: Main woh janta hun jo tum nahin jante. Unhon ne kaha: Ae hamare Rab, hum Bani Adam se zyada Tere farmabardar hain. Allah ne farishton se farmaya: Farishton mein se do farishte pesh karo taake Hum unhein zamin ki taraf utarein. Unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuharah un ke samne insanon mein se nihayat khubsurat aurat ki surat mein zahir hui, aur woh un ke pas aayi, to unhon ne us se us ke nafs ka mutaliba kiya. Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, yahan tak ke tum shirk ka ye kalima kaho. Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, hum kabhi Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko sharik na thahrayenge. Woh un ke pas se chali gayi, phir ek shir-khwar ladka uthaye hue wapas aayi, to unhon ne us se us ke nafs ka mutaliba kiya. Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, yahan tak ke tum is ladke ko qatl karo. Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, hum use kabhi qatl na karenge. Woh chali gayi, phir sharab ka ek pyala uthaye hue wapas aayi, to unhon ne us se us ke nafs ka mutaliba kiya. Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, yahan tak ke tum ye sharab piyo. Unhon ne pi aur madhosh ho gaye, aur us par pare aur ladke ko qatl kar diya. Jab woh bedar hue, to aurat ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum ne koi cheez nahin chhori jis se tum ne mujhe inkar kiya tha magar ye ke jab tum madhosh hue to tum ne use kar liya. Phir unhein duniya ke azab aur akhirat ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya gaya, to unhon ne duniya ke azab ko ikhtiyar kiya."
"788","Abd al-Razzaq ne humhein khabar di, Mamar se, Ayyub se, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Ek ka khana do ko kafi hai, do ka khana char ko kafi hai, aur char ka khana aath ko kafi hai."
"789","Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne humhein khabar di, al-Hakam ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se riwayat ki, Malik ne humhein khabar di, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ek aurat aag mein dakhil hui ek billi ki wajah se. Kaha gaya: Na tune use khilaya aur na tune use pilaya, aur na tune use chhora ke woh zamin ke hasharat se khaye."
"790","Yazid ibn Harun ne humhein khabar di, Yahya ibn Said al-Ansari ne humhein khabar di, ke Abdullah ibn Dinar ne unhein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Umar se: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Quba sawari par aur paidal tashrif laya karte the."
"791","Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr al-Zubayri Abu Ahmad ne humhein khabar di, Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Paanch hain jinhein Allah Buzurg-o-Bartar ke siwa koi nahin janta: Qayamat ko Allah ke siwa koi nahin janta, barish kab barasti hai Allah ke siwa koi nahin janta, rahamon mein jo hai use Allah ke siwa koi nahin janta, koi jan nahin janti ke woh kal kya kamayegi magar Allah, aur koi jan nahin janti ke woh kis zamin mein maregi magar Allah."
"792","Umar ibn Sad ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan se, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Darakhton mein ek darakht hai jis ke patte nahin jharte, aur woh Musalman mard ki tarah hai. Unhon ne kaha: Log sehraon ke darakhton mein par gaye, aur main logon mein sab se chhoton mein se tha, aur mere dil mein khayal aaya ke woh khajoor ka darakht hai. Unhon ne kaha: Maine is ka zikr apne walid se kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Agar tum ise kehte, to ye mujhe falan falan cheez se zyada mehboob hota."
"793","Said ibn Amir ne hum se riwayat ki, Shubah se, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Use talash karo, ya unhon ne farmaya: Jo use talash kare, use sattayiswin raat mein talash kare."
"794","Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Muqri ne hum se riwayat ki, Haywah ibn Shurayh ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Uthman al-Walid ibn Abi al-Walid ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Nekiyon mein sab se bari neki ye hai ke aadmi apne walid ke mehboobon se silat-e-rehmi qayam rakhe."
"795","Abu Asim ne humhein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah al-Rabadhi se, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Fatah ke din apni sawari par tawaf farmaya, arkan ko apne asa se chhute the; aur jab Aap bahar tashrif laye to utarne ki koi jagah na payi, to Aap logon ke hathon par utre. Phir Aap khare hue aur unhein khutba diya, Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan karte hue, aur farmaya: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne tum se jahiliyat ka takabbur aur aaba-o-ajdad par fakhar door kar diya. Log do aadmi hain: ek nek, muttaqi, Allah Buzurg-o-Bartar ke nazdik izzat wala, aur ek badkar, badbakht, Allah Buzurg-o-Bartar ke nazdik zaleel. Phir Aap ne tilawat farmayi: Ae logo, beshak Hum ne tumhein mard aur aurat se paida kiya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Main ye kehta hun aur apne liye aur tumhare liye Allah se bakhshish talab karta hun."
"796","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abd al-Malik ibn Qudamah al-Jumahi ne hum se riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kutton ke qatl ka hukm farmaya, to woh qatl kiye gaye, yahan tak ke woh al-Aqabah par ek aurat tak pahunche aur ek kutte ko qatl karna chaha. Us ne kaha: Main is jagah par hun aur ye mujhe uns deta hai. Unhon ne us par rehem khaya, to woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas wapas gaye aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, aur Aap ne unhein use qatl karne ka hukm farmaya, to unhon ne use qatl kar diya."
"797","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne humhein khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah se, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Musalmanon mein ke fuqara ne apne aghniya ko un par di gayi fazilat ki shikayat ki. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare ye bhai iman laye jaisa hum iman laye, namaz parhi jaisi hum ne namaz parhi, aur roze rakhe jaise hum ne roze rakhe; unhein maal mein hum par fazilat hasil hai: woh sadqa dete hain aur silat-e-rehmi karte hain, jabke hum faqir hain aur ye nahin kar sakte. Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein aisi cheez na bataun ke agar tum use karo, to tum un ke martabe jaisa pa lo ge. Har namaz ke baad kaho: Allahu Akbar gyarah martaba, Alhamdulillah gyarah martaba, SubhanAllah gyarah martaba, aur La ilaha illallah wahdahu la sharika lah gyarah martaba, aur SubhanAllah gyarah martaba, aur La ilaha illallah wahdahu la sharika lah gyarah martaba, tum un ke martabe jaisa pa lo ge. Ye baat aghniya tak pahunchi, aur unhon ne bhi waisa hi kaha jaisa Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein hukm farmaya tha. Woh Aap ke pas aaye aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare bhai waisa hi kehte hain jaisa hum kehte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Ye Allah ka fazl hai; Woh use jise chahta hai ata farmata hai. Kya main tumhein khushkhabri na dun, ae fuqara ki jamaat: Mominon mein se fuqara apne aghniya se aadhe din, paanch sau saal pehle Jannat mein dakhil honge."
"798","Umar ibn Sad ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan ne hum se riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Dinar se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Jab log Tabuk ki muhim mein al-Hijr mein utre, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: In azab diye gaye logon ke pas dakhil na ho, yaani Salih ki qaum, magar rote hue; aur agar tum rote hue na ho, to dakhil na ho, kahin tumhein wohi na pahunche jo unhein pahuncha."
"799","Dawud ibn Muhabbar ne mujh se riwayat ki, Sukayn ibn Abi Siraj ne hum se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abdullah ibn Dinar ko kehte hue suna: Maine Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Bura akhlaq aamal ko kharab karta hai jaise sirka shehed ko kharab karta hai."
"800","Abd al-Razzaq ne humhein khabar di, al-Thawri ne humhein khabar di, Abd al-Karim al-Jazari se, Said ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Umar ko al-Safa aur al-Marwah ke darmiyan chalte hue dekha, phir unhon ne kaha: Agar main chala, to maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko chalte hue dekha, aur agar maine tez raftari ki, to maine Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko tez raftari farmate hue dekha."
"801","Yamar ibn Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Qays ibn al-Rabi' ne humein khabar di, Abu Hashim se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Mera guman hai ke ye Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se marwi hai, jinhon ne farmaya: 'Aurat ke liye us ke hamal se le kar waza'-e-hamal aur doodh chhurane tak Allah ki rah mein jihad karne wale ke ajr jaisa ajr hai, aur agar is 'arse mein us ka inteqal ho jaye to us ke liye shahid ka ajr hai.'"
"802","Uthman ibn Umar ne humein khabar di, Marzuq Abu Bakr ne humein khabar di, Sulayman al-Ahwal se, Tawus se, Ibn Umar se: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se kaha gaya: 'Kaun se log sab se achchi qirat karte hain?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo shakhs ke jab tum us ki qirat suno to tum dekho ke wo Allah 'azza wa jalla se darta hai.'"
"803","Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hanzalah se, Tawus se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Paimana ahl-e-Madina ka paimana hai, aur wazan ahl-e-Makkah ka wazan hai.'"
"804","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Abu Shu'ayb se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Tawus ko kehte huye suna: Ibn Umar se Maghrib se pehle ki do rak'aton ke bare mein pucha gaya to unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein kisi ko inhein padhte huye nahi dekha.'"
"805","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne humein khabar di, Sufyan se, Ibrahim ibn Muhajir se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Apni 'auraton ko raat ke waqt masajid ki taraf jane ki ijazat diya karo.'"
"806","Amr ibn Awn ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne humein khabar di, al-A'mash se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ke naam par tum se panah mange use panah do; jo Allah ke naam par tum se sawal kare use do; jo tumhein da'wat de us ki da'wat qabool karo; aur jo tumhare saath ehsan kare use badla do, aur agar tumhein badle ke liye kuch na mile to us ke liye du'a karo yahan tak ke tum jan lo ke tum ne use badla de diya hai.'"
"807","Amr ibn Awn ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne humein khabar di, Yazid ibn Abi Ziyad se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Allah ke nazdeek in dino se, ya'ni Dhu al-Hijjah ke das dino se - ya unhon ne kaha: das din - se bade aur in mein kiye jane wale 'amal se zyada mehboob koi din nahi, pas in mein kasrat se tasbih, tahlil, takbir aur tahmid karo.'"
"808","Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, Imran ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yahya al-Qattat ne mujhe bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ko farmate huye suna: 'Ahl-e-Jahannam ko itna bada kar diya jayega yahan tak ke un mein se ek shakhs ke kan ki law aur kandhe ke darmiyan saat sau baras ka safar hoga, us ki khal ki motai chalis hath hogi, aur us ki dadh Mount Uhud se bhi badi hogi.'"
"809","Malik ibn Isma'il al-Nahdi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Mu'awiyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Un se pucha gaya ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne kitne 'umrah kiye to unhon ne kaha: 'Do martaba.' Phir 'Aisha ne kaha: 'Ibn Umar jante the ke Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne Wada' ke Hajj ke saath milaye huye 'umrah ke 'ilawah teen 'umrah kiye the.'"
"810","Malik ibn Isma'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke paas baitha tha aur main ne Aap ko farmate huye suna: 'Main Allah se sau martaba istighfar karta hun: Ay Allah, mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par rahem farma, aur meri tawbah qabool farma; beshak Tu bahut tawbah qabool karne wala, bahut bakhshne wala hai - ya: beshak Tu Tawwab hai, Ghafoor hai - ye shak Zuhayr ki taraf se hai.'"
"811","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne humein khabar di, Sa'id al-Sammak ne humein khabar di, 'Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Ek din Bilal adhan kehne mein der se aaye to ek aadmi ne adhan keh di; phir jab Bilal aaye aur iqamah kehna chaha to Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Iqamah wahi kahe jo adhan kahe.'"
"812","Abu Ishaq Ahmad ibn Ishaq al-Hadrami ne humein khabar di, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Ali ibn al-Hakam se, 'Ata ibn Abi Rabah se: Ek aadmi ne Ibn Umar ke samne ek aadmi ki ta'rif ki to Ibn Umar us ke munh ki taraf mitti phenkne lage aur kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jab tum hadd se zyada ta'rif karne walon ko dekho to un ke munhon mein mitti phenk do - ya unhon ne kaha: kuch mitti.'"
"813","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Mu'awiyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Qutbah se, Layth se, 'Ata se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Ek 'aurat Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke paas aayi aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah, biwi par shawhar ka kya haq hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo apne aap ko us se na roke agarche wo oont ke kajave ki peeth par hi kyon na ho.' Us ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah, biwi par shawhar ka kya haq hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo us ke ghar se kisi cheez ka sadqah us ki ijazat ke baghair na de; agar wo aisa kare to sawab us (shawhar) ko milega aur gunah us ('aurat) par hoga.' Us ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah, biwi par shawhar ka kya haq hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo us ki ijazat ke baghair ek din bhi rozah na rakhe; agar wo aisa kare to gunahgar hogi aur use koi sawab nahi milega.' Us ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah, biwi par shawhar ka kya haq hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo us ki ijazat ke baghair us ke ghar se na nikle; agar wo aisa kare to Allah ke farishte, rahmat ke farishte aur 'azab ke farishte us par la'nat karte hain yahan tak ke wo wapas laut aaye.'"
"814","Husayn al-Ju'fi ne hum se bayan kiya, Za'idah se, 'Ata ibn al-Sa'ib se, Muharib ibn Dithar se, 'Abdullah ibn Umar se, Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se, jinhon ne farmaya: 'Ay logo, zulm se bacho, kyunke wo Qiyamat ke din andhere honge.'"
"815","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, Hammam ibn Yahya ne humein khabar di, Qatadah se, Abu al-Siddiq al-Naji se, Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jab tum apne murdon ko qabr mein rakho to kaho: Allah ke naam par aur Rasulullah ke din par.' 'Abd ibn Humayd ne kaha: Yazid ne kaha: 'Is hadith ko marfu'an sirf Hammam hi ne riwayat kiya hai.'"
"816","Yazid ibn Harun ne humein khabar di, Abu al-'Atuf al-Jarrah ibn Minhal al-Jazari ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, ek aadmi se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke saath nikla yahan tak ke Aap Ansar ke ek bagh mein dakhil huye aur khajoorein tod kar khane lage. Aap ne mujh se farmaya: 'Ay Ibn Umar, tum kyon nahi khate?' Main ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah, mujhe is ki raghbat nahi.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Lekin mujhe is ki khwahish hai, aur ye chauthi subah hai jab main ne khana nahi chakha aur na paya hai. Agar main chahta to apne Rab se du'a karta aur Wo mujhe Kisra aur Qaysar ki saltanat jaisa 'ata farma deta. Ay Ibn Umar, tumhara kya haal hoga jab tum aise logon mein reh jaoge jo saal bhar ka zakhira jama karte hain jabke un ka yaqeen kamzor pad chuka hoga. Allah ki qasam, hum wahan se hile bhi nahi the aur ruksat bhi nahi huye the ke ye ayat nazil huyi: Aur kitne hi jandar aise hain jo apna rizq uthaye nahi phirte; Allah hi unhein aur tumhein rizq deta hai, aur Wo khoob sunne wala, khoob janne wala hai. Phir Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah 'azza wa jalla ne mujhe duniya jama karne ka hukm nahi diya, na khwahishat ke peeche chalne ka. Jo duniya ka maal jama kare is irade se ke us se hamesha ki zindagi hasil kare to zindagi to Allah ke haath mein hai. Beshak main na ek dinar jama karta hun na dirham, aur na kal ke liye rizq zakhira karta hun.'"
"817","Abu Usamah ne humein khabar di, al-Walid ibn Kathir al-Madani se, Muhammad ibn Ja'far ibn al-Zubayr se, 'Abdullah ibn 'Abdullah ibn Umar se, un ke walid se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se aise pani ke bare mein pucha gaya jahan jangli janwar aur darinde aate hon, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab pani do qullah ho jaye to wo napaki nahi uthata.' Abu Usamah ne kaha: 'Ek qullah bade mashkize ke qadr hota hai.'"
"818","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Asim ibn al-Mundhir se, jinhon ne kaha: Main apne ek bagh ke ibtida'i hisse mein 'Ubayd ibn 'Abdullah ibn Umar ke saath dakhil hua, aur us mein ek hawz tha, aur hawz oont ki khal ka bana hua tha, to unhon ne wuzu kiya. Main ne kaha: 'Aap wuzu kar rahe hain jabke is mein oont ki khal hai?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab pani do qullah, ya teen qullah ko pahunch jaye to wo napak nahi hota.'"
"819","Shababah ibn Sawwar ne mujhe khabar di, Isra'il ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Thuwayr ibn Abi Fakhitah se, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko kehte huye suna: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Jannat walon mein sab se kam darje wala wo hoga jo apne baghat, apni biwiyon, apni ne'maton, apne khadimon aur apne takhton ko ek hazar saal ki musafat tak dekhega; aur Allah 'azza wa jalla ke nazdeek sab se zyada mu'azzaz wo hoga jo subah o sham Us ke chehre ki ziyarat karega.' Phir Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne ye ayat tilawat farmayi: Us din kai chehre tar-o-taza honge, apne Rab ki taraf dekh rahe honge."
"820","Umar ibn Yunus al-Yamami Abu Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn Aslam ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: 'Hamare liye do murdar aur do khoon halal kiye gaye hain: rahe do murdar to machhli aur tidda; aur rahe do khoon to kaleja aur tilli.'"
"821","Abdullah ibn Yazid al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hani se, Abbas al-Hajari se, Ibn Umar se: Ek shakhs Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, mera khadim badsuluki karta hai aur zulm karta hai; kya main use marun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, use har roz sattar martaba muaf karo."
"822","Yala ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Muslim ibn Yannaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke sath Makkah ki ek masjid mein tha jab ek naujawan apna tehband latkata hua guzra, to unhon ne kaha: Ae naujawan, tum kin mein se ho? Us ne kaha: Banu Bakr mein se. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum nahin chahte ke Allah Qayamat ke din tumhari taraf dekhe? Us ne kaha: Subhan Allah, haan beshak. Unhon ne kaha: To apna kapra upar uthao, kyunke main ne Abu al-Qasim sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apne in dono kaanon se suna - aur unhon ne apni ungliyon se apne kaanon ki taraf ishara kiya - farmate hue: Jo shakhs takabbur ke liye apna kapra ghasite, Allah Qayamat ke din us ki taraf nahin dekhega."
"823","Yala ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Salamah ibn Kuhayl se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Islam paanch cheezon par qayam hai: is baat ki gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain, namaz qayam karna, zakat dena, Baitullah ka hajj karna, aur Ramazan ke roze rakhna."
"824","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim ibn Muhammad al-Umari ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Agar log jante ke tanhai mein kya hai, to koi shakhs raat mein kabhi akela safar na karta."
"825","Yala ne hum se bayan kiya, Fudayl ibn Ghazwan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Dihqanah se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas kuch log the, aur Aap ne Bilal ko un ke paas jo khajooren thin un ke liye bulaya, to woh aisi khajooren laye jinhen Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne napasand farmaya. Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kaisi khajooren hain? Unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas jo khajooren thin, hum ne do sa ke badle ek sa tabdeel kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Hamen hamari khajooren wapas karo."
"826","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Yusuf ibn Suhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd al-Ammi se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs chahta hai ke us ki dua qubul ho aur us ki pareshani door ho, to use chahiye ke woh tangdast ki mushkil aasan kare."
"827","Abd ibn Humayd ne hamen khabar di, apne ek shaykh se, unhon ne kaha: Jafar ibn Burqan ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Isa ibn Hafs ibn Asim ibn Umar ne hamen khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek safar mein Ibn Umar ke sath tha, aur unhon ne hamen do rakat namaz padhai, phir rawana hue aur apne kajave ki gaddi tak aaye aur us par tek lagayi, aur unhon ne logon ko apne peeche khare dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh log kya kar rahe hain? Main ne kaha: Woh nafl namazen padh rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Agar main nafl padhne wala hota to apni namaz mukammal karta; ae mere bhai ke bete, main Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath raha yahan tak ke Allah ne Unhe utha liya, aur Unhon ne kabhi do rakat, do rakat se zyada nahin padhi; phir main Abu Bakr ke sath raha aur unhon ne kabhi do rakat, do rakat se zyada nahin padhi; phir main Umar ke sath raha aur unhon ne kabhi do rakat, do rakat se zyada nahin padhi; phir main Uthman ke sath raha aur unhon ne kabhi do rakat, do rakat se zyada nahin padhi. Phir unhon ne tilawat ki: Beshak tumhare liye Allah ke Rasul mein behtareen namuna hai."
"828","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Mamar ne hamen khabar di, Abdullah ibn Muslim se jo al-Zuhri ke bhai hain, Hamzah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi mangta rahega yahan tak ke woh Allah azza wa jalla se is haal mein milega ke us ke chehre par gosht ka ek tukra bhi nahin hoga."
"829","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Mamar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, Mawraq al-Ijli se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar se safar mein namaz ke bare mein pucha gaya, to unhon ne kaha: Do rakat, do rakat; jo Sunnat ki mukhalifat kare us ne kufr kiya."
"830","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Mamar ne hamen khabar di, Asim ibn Sulayman se, al-Muttalib se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne ek dehati ko apne khane par bulaya, aur woh qurbani ke din ke baad ka din tha, to dehati ne kaha: Main roze se hun. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko in teen dinon mein roza rakhne se mana farmate hue suna, yaani ayyam-e-Tashriq."
"831","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Mamar aur al-Thawri ne hamen khabar di, Ata ibn al-Saib se, Abdullah ibn Ubayd ibn Umayr se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: Hujr-e-Aswad aur Rukn-e-Yamani ka bheer mein masah karna gunahon ko mukammal taur par mita deta hai."
"832","Umar ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas se, Ata ibn al-Saib se, Ibn Ubayd ibn Umayr se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko Rukn aur Rukn-e-Yamani par is tarah bheer karte dekha jaisa main ne Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke Sahaba mein se kisi ko karte nahin dekha, to main ne un se is ka zikr kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: In dono ko chhuna gunahon ka kaffara hai. Aur main ne Unhe farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs Baitullah ka saat martaba tawaf kare aur use mukammal kare, to woh ek ghulam azad karne ke barabar hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Unhe farmate hue suna: Haj karne wala ek qadam nahin uthata aur na dusra rakhta hai magar us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai, us se ek gunah mitaya jata hai, aur us ke liye ek darja buland kiya jata hai."
"833","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Ali ibn Abdullah al-Bariqi se, Ibn Umar se: Jab Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam safar karte aur apni untni par sawar hote, to teen martaba Allahu Akbar kehte, phir kehte: Paak hai Woh Zaat jis ne is ko hamare liye musakhkhar kiya halanke hum use qaboo mein lane wale na the, aur beshak hum apne Rab ki taraf lautne wale hain. Phir kehte: Ae Allah, main Tujh se apne is safar mein neki aur taqwa ka aur aamal mein se us ka sawal karta hun jo Tujhe pasand ho. Ae Allah, hamare liye safar aasan farma aur hamare liye zameen ki musafat lapet de. Ae Allah, Tu safar mein Sathi hai aur ghar walon par Nigran hai. Ae Allah, hamare is safar mein hamare sath reh aur hamare ghar walon ki hamare liye nigehbani farma. Aur jab woh wapas aate, to kehte: Lautne wale hain, agar Allah ne chaha, ibadat karne wale, tauba karne wale, apne Rab ki hamd karne wale."
"834","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Ismail ibn Jarir se, Qazah se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne mujhe kisi kaam par bheja aur mera hath pakra, aur kaha: Aao, main tumhen usi tarah rukhsat karun jis tarah Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujhe rukhsat kiya jab Unhon ne mujhe apne ek kaam par bheja. Unhon ne farmaya: Main tumhara deen, tumhari amanaten aur tumhare aamal ke anjaam Allah ke supurd karta hun."
"835","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhib ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Harith ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Hamzah ibn Abdullah ibn Umar se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Meri ek biwi thi jis se main mohabbat karta tha, aur mere walid use napasand karte the, to unhon ne mujhe use talaq dene ka hukm diya lekin main ne inkar kiya. To woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas gaye aur Un se is ka zikr kiya, to Unhon ne mujhe bulwaya aur farmaya: Ae Abdullah, apni biwi ko talaq de do. To main ne use talaq de di."
"836","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhib ne hum se bayan kiya, Uthman ibn Abdullah ibn Suraqah se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne phalon ko aafat door hone se pehle bechne se mana farmaya. Ibn Suraqah ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se pucha ke is ka kya matlab hai, to unhon ne kaha: Surayya sitare ka tulu hona."
"837","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubadah ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jubayr ibn Abi Sulayman ibn Jubayr ibn Mutim ne mujh se bayan kiya ke woh Ibn Umar ke paas baithe the, aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko subah aur shaam ki apni dua mein farmate hue suna, use kabhi tark na kiya yahan tak ke Unhon ne is duniya ko chhora aur wafat pai: Ae Allah, main Tujh se duniya aur akhirat mein aafiyat ka sawal karta hun. Ae Allah, main Tujh se apne deen, apni duniyawi zindagi, apne ghar walon aur apne maal mein muafi aur aafiyat ka sawal karta hun. Ae Allah, meri khamiyon par parda daal aur mere khauf ko aman de. Ae Allah, meri hifazat farma mere aage se, mere peeche se, mere dayen se, mere bayen se, aur mere upar se, aur main Teri azmat ki panah mangta hun is se ke mujhe neeche se nigal liya jaye. Jubayr ne kaha: Is se murad zameen mein dhansa diya jana hai. Ubadah ne kaha: Main nahin janta ke yeh Nabi ka qaul hai ya Jubayr ka qaul hai."
"838","Abu Nuaym ne hamen khabar di, Aban ibn Abdullah al-Bajali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Hafs ibn Umar ibn Sad ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ibn Umar ke sath Adha ya Fitr ke din nikle, aur woh paidal chalte rahe yahan tak ke Eidgah aaye, phir baithe rahe yahan tak ke imam aaya, phir namaz padhi aur rawana hue. Phir Ibn Umar rawana hue aur us se pehle na koi namaz padhi na us ke baad. Main ne kaha: Ae Ibn Umar, na us se pehle koi namaz hai na us ke baad? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko isi tarah karte dekha hai."
"839","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ibn Umar ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Said ibn Yasar se, Ibn Umar se: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apni untni par witr ki namaz padhte the."
"840","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ibn Umar se, ke woh zard rang ko pasand karte the hatta ke amame mein bhi, aur dawa karte the ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam zard rang ko pasand karte the."
"841","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Tumah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Main Ibn Umar ke saath tha jab ek shakhs un ke paas aaya aur kehne laga: Ae Abu Abd al-Rahman, main safar mein roza rakhne ki taqat rakhta hun. Ibn Umar ne us se kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs Allah ki rukhsat ko qubul nahi karta us par Arafah ke pahadon ke barabar gunah hoga."
"842","Al-Walid ibn al-Qasim ibn al-Walid al-Hamdani ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Sabbah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud al-Subayi se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Arafah ke din jis ke dil mein rai ke dane ke barabar bhi iman hoga woh bakhsha jayega, koi baqi nahi rahega magar bakhsha jayega. Ek shakhs ne kaha: Kya ye sirf ahl-e-Arafah ke liye hai, ae Allah ke Rasul, ya tamam logon ke liye hai? Aap ne farmaya: Balke tamam logon ke liye hai."
"843","Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abu Shubah al-Hanafi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: al-Rabi ya Abu al-Rabi al-Hanzali ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ke saath namaz padhi aur un se kaha: Kabhi aap humein namaz padhate hain aur jab aap salam pherte hain to main apne saathi ka chehra pehchan nahi pata, aur kabhi aap namaz padhate hain aur jab aap salam pherte hain to main dekhta hun ke suraj tulu ho chuka hai. Unhone kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko isi tarah namaz padhte hue dekha hai, aur main pasand karta hun ke main waise hi namaz padhun jaise main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko namaz padhte hue dekha hai."
"844","Abu Ali al-Hanafi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Ibn Abi Dhib ne mujh se bayan kiya, Uthman ibn Abdullah ibn Suraqah se: Hafs ibn Asim ne unhein safar mein nawafil padhte hue dekha, aur us safar mein un ke saath Abdullah ibn Umar bhi the. Hafs ne kaha: Tumhara ek bhai is se mana karta hai, murad Ibn Umar hain. To main ne Ibn Umar se pucha, to unhone kaha: Main ne Nabi Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko safar mein aisa karte hue nahi dekha; aap safar mein farz namaz se pehle aur na us ke baad nafl nahi padhte the. Unhone kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya main raat mein namaz padhun? Unhone kaha: Haan, raat mein apni sawari par jitni chaho namaz padho, jidhar bhi woh tumhein le kar mude."
"845","Said ibn Sallam ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zakariya ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd al-Araj se, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Abdullah ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko mimbar par logon se khitab karte hue farmate hue suna: Tum Qayamat ke din Allah ke paas apni namaz se behtar koi cheez le kar nahi aaoge. Beshak raat ki namaz do do rakat hai; phir jab tumhein fajr ka khauf ho to ek rakat padh lo."
"846","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammam ibn Yahya ne mujh se bayan kiya, Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Safwan ibn Muhriz al-Mazini se, unhone kaha: Main Ibn Umar ka haath pakde hue tha jab ek shakhs un ke paas aaya aur kehne laga: Aap ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko Qayamat ke din ki sargoshi ke baare mein kya farmate hue suna hai? Unhone kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah azza wa jall momin ko qareeb karega yahan tak ke us par apna parda daal dega aur use logon se chhupa lega. Woh farmayega: Kya tu falan gunah ko pehchanta hai? Woh kahega: Haan, ae mere Rab. Woh farmayega: Kya tu falan gunah ko pehchanta hai? Woh kahega: Haan, ae mere Rab. Woh farmayega: Kya tu falan gunah ko pehchanta hai? Woh kahega: Haan, ae mere Rab. Yahan tak ke jab Allah use us ke gunahon ka iqrar kara lega aur woh apne dil mein samjhega ke woh halak ho gaya, to Allah farmayega: Aaj main ne tere liye unhein maaf kar diya hai. Phir use us ka nama-e-aamal diya jayega. Rahe kafir aur munafiq, to gawah kahenge: Ye woh log hain jinhone apne Rab par jhooth bandha; sun lo, zalimon par Allah ki lanat hai."
"847","Sulayman ibn Dawud aur Musa ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Thabit ibn Thawban se, un ke walid se, Makhul se, Jubayr ibn Nufayr se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jall bande ki tauba us waqt tak qubul karta hai jab tak us ki jaan halaq tak na pahunche aur gharghara shuru na ho."
"848","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Thabit ibn Thawban se, unhone kaha: Hassan ibn Atiyah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Munib al-Jurashi se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Qayamat se pehle talwar ke saath bheja gaya hai, mera rizq mere neze ke saye mein rakh diya gaya hai, aur zillat aur ruswai us par rakh di gayi hai jo mere hukm ki mukhalafat kare. Jo kisi qaum ki mushabahat kare woh unhi mein se hai."
"849","Al-Aswad ibn Amir ne humein khabar di, Baqiyyah al-Himsi ne hum se bayan kiya, Uthman ibn Zufar se, Hashim se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Jo shakhs das dirham ka kapda kharide jis mein ek dirham haram ka ho, jab tak woh kapda us par rahega us ki koi namaz qubul nahi hogi. Phir unhone apni do ungliyan apne kaanon mein daalin aur kaha: Agar main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko ye farmate hue na suna ho to ye dono kaan behre ho jayen."
"850","Umar ibn Sad al-Hafari ne hum se bayan kiya, Badr ibn Uthman se, Ubaydullah ibn Marwan se, Abu Aishah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ek subah bahar tashrif laaye aur farmaya: Fajr ki namaz se pehle main ne dekha jaise mujhe chabiyan aur tarazu diye gaye hain. Chabiyan to ye chabiyan hain, aur tarazu woh hai jis se wazan kiya jata hai. Mujhe ek palde mein rakha gaya aur meri ummat ko dusre palde mein rakha gaya to main un par bhaari raha. Phir Abu Bakr ko laya gaya aur wazan kiya gaya to woh un par bhaari rahe. Phir Umar ko laya gaya aur wazan kiya gaya to woh un par bhaari rahe. Phir Uthman ko laya gaya aur wazan kiya gaya to woh un par bhaari rahe. Phir main bedar hua aur woh utha liya gaya."
"851","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Shihab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Khalid ibn Dinar al-Nili ne mujhe khabar di, Hammad ibn Jafar se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Kya main tumhein ahl-e-jannat mein sab se kam darje wale ke baare mein na bataun? Logon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhone kaha: Ek shakhs jo jannat ke darwaze se dakhil hoga aur us ke khadim us se milenge aur us se kahenge: Khush amdeed, ae hamare sardar; ab aap ke lautne ka waqt aa gaya hai. Unhone kaha: Us ke liye chalees saal tak farsh bichhaye jayenge, phir woh apne dayen aur bayen dekhega aur baghat dekhega aur kahega: Ye sab kis ka hai? Kaha jayega: Aap hi ka hai. Yahan tak ke jab woh farigh hoga to us ke liye ek surkh yaqut ya sabz zamurrud buland kiya jayega jis ki sattar shakhen hongi, har shakh mein sattar kamre, har kamre mein sattar darwaze. Us se kaha jayega: Padho aur chadho. To woh chadhta jayega yahan tak ke jab woh apni saltanat ke takht tak pahunchega to us par tek lagayega, jis ka phailao ek meel ba ek meel hoga aur us se zyada bhi. Us ke paas sone ki sattar hazar rakaibiyan layi jayengi, un mein se kisi rakaibi mein dusri jaisa khana nahi hoga; woh aakhiri khane mein wahi lazzat payega jo pehle khane mein payega. Phir us ke paas mukhtalif mashrubat laye jayenge aur woh jo chahega piyega. Phir khadim kahenge: Use us ki biwiyon ke saath chhod do. Abu Shihab ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai ke unhone kaha: To woh khadimon se alag hoga aur dekhega ke ek hur-e-ayn apni saltanat ke takht par baithi hai; woh us ki pindliyon ka gooda gosht aur khoon ki shaffafiyat ke peeche se dekhega. Woh us se kahega: Tum kaun ho? Woh kahegi: Main tumhare liye mehfooz hur-e-ayn mein se ek hun. Woh chalees saal tak use dekhta rahega, us se nazar nahi hatayega. Phir woh apne upar ke balakhanon ki taraf nazar uthayega aur us se zyada haseen dusri ko dekhega, aur woh kahegi: Kya hamare liye aap mein se hissa pane ka waqt nahi aaya? To woh us ki taraf jayega aur chalees saal tak use dekhta rahega, us se nazar nahi pherega. Yahan tak ke jab har tarah ki neamat unhein pahunch chuki hogi aur woh samjhenge ke is se behtar koi neamat nahi, to Rab tabaraka wa taala un par tajalli farmayega aur woh Rahman azza wa jall ke Chehre ki ziyarat karenge aur Rahman azza wa jall ke Chehre ko dekh kar har neamat ko bhool jayenge jo unhone dekhi thi. Allah farmayega: Ae ahl-e-jannat, meri wahdaniyat ka iqrar karo. To woh tauheed ka jawab denge. Allah farmayega: Ae Dawud, khade ho aur meri tamjeed karo jaise tum duniya mein meri tamjeed karte the. To Dawud apne Rab azza wa jall ki tamjeed karenge. Ahmad ibn Yunus ne kaha: Main ne Abu Shihab se kaha: Khalid ibn Dinar ki jannat ke zikr wali hadith, kya unhone use marfu bayan kiya hai? Unhone kaha: Haan."
"852","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Qays ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ibn Abi Thabit se, Tamim ibn Iyad se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam sehri kar rahe the, jab aap apne khane se farigh hue to Alqamah ibn Ulathah aaye to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne unhein gosht wale sir ki dawat di. Jab woh kha rahe the to Bilal Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko namaz ki ittila dene aaye to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Bilal, aahista karo, yahan tak ke Alqamah apna khana mukammal kar le."
"853","Malik ibn Ismail al-Nahdi ne mujh se bayan kiya, Mindal ibn Ali al-Anazi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Marwan ne hum se bayan kiya, Nimah se, un ke walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman ki shaadi ke walime mein hazir ho, goya us ne Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakha, aur ek din saat sau din ke barabar hai. Jo kisi Musalman ke janaze mein hazir ho, goya us ne Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakha, aur ek din saat sau din ke barabar hai. Jo kisi mariz ki iyadat kare, goya us ne Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakha, aur ek din saat sau din ke barabar hai. Jo janaze par namaz padhe, goya us ne Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakha, aur ek din saat sau din ke barabar hai. Aur jo Jume ke din ghusl kare, goya us ne Allah ke raste mein ek din roza rakha, aur ek din saat sau din ke barabar hai."
"854","Malik ibn Ismail ne mujh se bayan kiya, Mindal ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, Jafar ibn Abi Jafar al-Ashjai se, un ke walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne safar mein apne sahaba ko fajr ki namaz padhayi aur Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun aur Qul huwallahu ahad ki qiraat ki. Aur farmaya: Main ne tumhare liye Quran ka ek tihai aur ek chauthai padh diya hai."
"855","Qabisah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Nahshal al-Dabbi se, Abu Ghalib se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Luqman al-Hakim kaha karte the: Jab koi cheez Allah azza wa jall ke supurd ki jaye to woh us ki hifazat farmata hai."
"856","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Kunasah al-Asadi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ishaq ibn Said ibn Amr se, un ke walid se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banda apne deen ki wusat mein rehta hai jab tak woh nahaq khoon na bahaye."
"857","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah se, Thabit al-Bunani se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek shakhs se farmaya: Kya tune falan kaam kiya hai? Us ne kaha: Nahi, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabud nahi. Phir Jibril aap ke paas aaye aur kaha: Haan, us ne woh kaam kiya hai, lekin us ke La ilaha illallah kehne ki wajah se use bakhsh diya gaya hai."
"858","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Hubab al-Ukli ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ubaydah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Sadaqah ibn Yasar ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Umar se: Ye surat Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam par Mina mein ayyam-e-Tashriq ke darmiyan Hajjat al-Wida ke mauqe par nazil hui: Iza jaa nasrullahi wal fath, aakhir tak. Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam samajh gaye ke is mein wida ka paigham hai, to aap ne apni untni al-Qaswa ka hukm diya aur us par kaathi rakhi gayi; aap sawar hue aur al-Aqabah par logon ke samne khade hue, aur log aap ke gird jama ho gaye. Aap ne Allah ki hamd aur us ki shan ke mutabiq sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Ae logon, jahiliyyat ka har khoon maaf hai, aur tumhare khoonon mein se pehla khoon jise main maaf karta hun woh Iyas ibn Rabiah ibn al-Harith ka khoon hai, jo Banu Layth mein dudh piya karta tha aur use Hudhayl ne qatl kar diya tha. Jahiliyyat ka pehla sud jo maaf hai woh al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib ka sud hai; woh tumhare liye maaf hai: tumhare liye tumhare asl maal hain, na tum zulm karoge aur na tum par zulm kiya jayega. Ae logon, zamana ghoom kar aaj usi halat par aa gaya hai jaise us din tha jab Allah ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya tha. Beshak Allah ke nazdeek maheenon ki ginti Kitabullah mein barah maheene hai, un mein se chaar hurmat wale hain: Rajab-e-Mudar jo Jumada aur Shaban ke darmiyan hai, Dhu al-Qadah, Dhu al-Hijjah, aur al-Muharram. Hurmat wale maheenon ko aage peeche karna kufr mein izafa hai jis se kafir gumrah kiye jate hain; woh ek saal use halal qarar dete hain aur ek saal haram qarar dete hain taake Allah ne jin ki hurmat rakhi hai un ki ginti puri kar len. Is ki wajah ye hai ke woh ek saal Safar ko haram qarar dete the aur ek saal halal qarar dete the, aur ek saal al-Muharram ko halal qarar dete the aur ek saal haram qarar dete the, aur ye nasi shaitan ki taraf se hai. Ae logon, shaitan tumhari is zameen mein aakhir zamane mein is baat se mayus ho gaya hai ke us ki ibadat ki jaye, lekin tumhare haqeer amalon par raazi hai, to apne deen mein us se daro. Ae logon, jis ke paas kisi ki amanat ho to use us ke maalik ko wapas kare. Ae logon, aurtein tumhare paas qaid hain; tum ne unhein Allah ki amanat se liya hai aur Allah ke kalme se un ki sharmgahon ko halal kiya hai. Tumhara un par haq hai aur un ka tum par haq hai. Tumhara haq ye hai ke woh tumhare bichhaunon ko kisi aur se na rundwayen aur na maruf mein tumhari nafarmani karen. Agar woh aisa karen to un ke liye maqul andaaz mein khana aur kapda hai. Agar tum maro to sakhti ke baghair maro. Ae logon, main tumhare darmiyan woh cheez chhod kar ja raha hun jise agar tum mazbuti se thaam loge to kabhi gumrah nahi hoge: Kitabullah. Ae logon, ye kaunsa din hai? Unhone kaha: Hurmat wala din. Farmaya: Ye kaunsa maheena hai? Unhone kaha: Hurmat wala maheena. Farmaya: Ye kaunsi zameen hai? Unhone kaha: Hurmat wali zameen. Farmaya: Allah azza wa jall ne tumhare khoon, tumhare maal, aur tumhari izzat ko is din aur is maheene ki hurmat ki tarah hurmat wala qarar diya hai. Mere baad koi nabi nahi, aur tumhare baad koi ummat nahi. Tum mein se hazir ghayeb tak baat pahuncha de. Phir aap ne apne haath buland kiye aur farmaya: Ae Allah, gawah rehna ke main ne pahuncha diya - teen martaba."
"859","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdah ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ifriqi se, Abu Ghutayf se, Ibn Umar se: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo shakhs taharat par hote hue wudu kare us ke liye das nekiyan likhi jati hain."
"860","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hashim ibn al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Aqil ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Fadl ibn Yazid al-Thumali se, Abu Ajlan al-Muharibi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Kafir Qayamat ke din apni zaban ko apne peeche do farsakh tak ghasitega, log us par pair rakh kar chalenge."
"861","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Abu Ishaq se, al-Agharr Abu Muslim se, Abu Hurairah aur Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Koi qaum Allah azza wa jalla ke zikr ke liye jama nahi hoti magar farishte un ko gher lete hain, rehmat unhein dhaanp leti hai, sakeenat un par nazil hoti hai, aur Allah un ka zikr un mein karta hai jo Us ke paas hain. Aur unhon ne farmaya: Allah azza wa jalla mohlat deta hai hatta ke jab raat ka aakhri tihaai hissa hota hai to is aasman ki taraf nuzool farmata hai aur nida deta hai: Kya koi gunahgar tauba karne wala hai? Kya koi maghfirat talab karne wala hai? Kya koi dua karne wala hai? Kya koi sawal karne wala hai? Hatta ke fajar tulu ho jati hai."
"862","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Sulaiman ibn Ali al-Rabai ne hamein khabar di, Abu al-Mutawakkil al-Naji ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sona sone ke badle, misl ba misl, dast ba dast; gehon gehon ke badle, misl ba misl, dast ba dast; chandi chandi ke badle, misl ba misl, dast ba dast; khajoor khajoor ke badle, misl ba misl, dast ba dast; jau jau ke badle, misl ba misl, dast ba dast; namak namak ke badle, misl ba misl, dast ba dast. Jo zyada de ya zyada talab kare us ne sood ka irtikab kiya; lene wala aur dene wala barabar hain."
"863","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Abu Masud al-Jurairi ne hamein khabar di, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag wale jin ko Allah nikalne ka irada nahi rakhta na us mein marte hain na jeete hain. Rahe Aag wale jin ko Allah nikalne ka irada rakhta hai, to Woh un par us mein maut taari karta hai hatta ke woh us mein koyla ho jate hain, phir woh giroh dar giroh nikalte hain aur Jannat ki nehron par daale jate hain; Jannat ki nehron ka pani un par chhidka jata hai hatta ke woh aise ugte hain jaise sailab ki keechad mein dana ugta hai. Jannat wale unhein Jahannami kehte hain. Phir woh Allah se sawal karte hain ke Woh un se yeh naam door kar de, to Woh un se us ko door kar deta hai."
"864","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hamein khabar di, Ali ibn Zaid se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Asr ke baad hum se khutba diya hatta ke suraj ghuroob hone ke qareeb ho gaya. Hum mein se jis ne yaad rakha us ne yaad rakha, aur jo bhool gaya woh bhool gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Beshak duniya sabz aur meethi hai, aur Allah tumhein us mein khalifa banane wala hai aur dekhega ke tum kaise amal karte ho. Duniya se bacho aur aurton se bacho. Bani Adam mukhtalif darjon par paida kiye gaye hain: un mein se koi momin paida hota hai, momin jeeta hai aur momin marta hai; un mein se koi momin paida hota hai, momin jeeta hai aur kafir marta hai; un mein se koi kafir paida hota hai, kafir jeeta hai aur kafir marta hai; aur un mein se koi kafir paida hota hai, kafir jeeta hai aur momin marta hai. Gussa ek sulagta hua angara hai jo ibn Adam ke dil mein bhadkaya jata hai; kya tum us ki aankhon ki surkhi aur us ki shah ragon ke phoolne ko nahi dekhte? Jo is mein se kuch paye to zameen se chipat jaye. Behtareen aadmi woh hai jo gusse mein dheema aur rujoo mein tez ho; agar woh gusse mein tez aur rujoo mein tez ho to barabar ho jata hai. Badtareen aadmi woh hai jo gusse mein tez aur rujoo mein sust ho; agar woh gusse mein tez aur rujoo mein tez ho to barabar ho jata hai. Behtareen saudagar woh hai jo taqaze mein acha aur adayi mein acha ho; badtareen saudagar woh hai jo taqaze mein bura aur adayi mein bura ho; agar woh taqaze mein acha aur adayi mein bura ho, ya taqaze mein bura aur adayi mein acha ho, to barabar ho jata hai. Har dhokebaz ke liye ek jhanda hoga jis se woh Qayamat ke din pehchana jayega. Aam riaya par hakim ke uzr se bada koi uzr nahi. Behtareen jihad zalim hakim ke samne insaf ki baat hai. Logon ka khauf tum mein se kisi ko haq baat kehne se na roke jab woh us ka mushahida kare ya us ko janta ho. Hatta ke jab suraj ghuroob hone ke qareeb hua to unhon ne farmaya: Duniya mein se jo baqi reh gaya hai us ke muqable mein jo guzar chuka hai woh sirf is suraj mein se jo baqi hai us ki tarah hai hatta ke woh ghuroob ho jaye."
"865","Safwan ibn Isa ne hamein khabar di, Sulaiman al-Taimi se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Rahe Aag wale jo us ke hamesha rehne wale baashinde hain, to woh na us mein jeete hain na marte hain, ya: na us mein marte hain na jeete hain. Rahe woh log jin ke liye Allah azza wa jalla rehmat ka irada rakhta hai, to Aag unhein maut deti hai, phir sifarish karne wale un ke paas aate hain aur un ke dher utha lete hain aur unhein Jannat mein ek nehar par bikhair dete hain, ek nehar jis ko Nehar e Hayat kaha jata hai, ya Nehar e Haya, ya Nehar e Hayawan. Woh aise ugte hain jaise sailab ki keechad mein beej ugta hai. Kya tum ne darakht nahi dekha, kabhi sabz, phir zard, ya zard, phir sabz? Logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Goya Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sehra mein the."
"866","Yala ibn Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Jafar ibn Iyas se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein tees aadmiyon ka dastah bana kar bheja. Hum raat ko ek qaum ke paas utre aur unhon ne hamari mezbani se inkar kar diya, to hum ek taraf utar gaye. Un ke sardar ko dank mara gaya, to woh hamare paas aaye aur bole: Kya tum mein koi dam karne wala hai? Hum ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Saath chalo. Hum ne kaha: Nahi jab tak tum hamein ujrat na do, kyunke tum ne hamari mezbani se inkar kiya tha. To unhon ne hamein tees bakriyan deen. Main un ke saath gaya aur Surah Fatiha padh kar dank wali jagah par haath pherne laga hatta ke woh theek ho gaya, to unhon ne hamein bakriyan de deen. Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hum inhein nahi khayenge hatta ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se un ke bare mein sawal karein, kyunke main nahi janta ke dam kya hai aur na main dam karne mein mahir hun. Jab hum aaye to hum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas gaye aur unhein khabar di. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur tumhein kaise maloom hua ke woh dam hai, aur tumhein kaise maloom hua ke woh dam hai? Haan, unhein khao, aur apne saath mere liye bhi hissa rakho."
"867","al-Nadr ibn Shumail ne hamein khabar di, Shubah ne hamein khabar di, Abu Maslamah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Nadrah ko kehte suna: Abu Said ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya sabz aur meethi hai, aur Allah tumhein us mein khalifa bana raha hai aur dekh raha hai ke tum kaise amal karte ho. To duniya ki fitne se bacho aur aurton ke fitne se bacho. Bani Israil ka pehla fitna aurton ke bare mein tha."
"868","al-Nadr ibn Shumail ne hamein khabar di, Shubah ne hamein khabar di, Abu Maslamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Nadrah ko suna, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag wale jo us ke hamesha rehne wale baashinde hain na us mein marte hain na jeete hain. Lekin woh un ke gunahon ya un ki khataon ki wajah se qaumon ko lapet mein leti hai; jab woh koyla ho jate hain to shafaat ki ijazat di jati hai, to unhein dher dar dher laya jata hai aur Jannat ki nehron par bikhaira jata hai. Ek pukarne wala pukaarta hai: Ai Jannat walo, un par pani dalo. To woh aise ugte hain jaise sailab ki keechad mein beej ugta hai."
"869","al-Nadr ibn Shumail ne hamein khabar di, Shubah ne hamein khabar di, Abu Maslamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Nadrah ko suna, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko logon ka khauf haq baat kehne se na roke jab woh us ko dekhe ya us ko janta ho. Abu Said ne kaha: Is ne mujhe Muawiyah ki taraf sawari par jane aur us ke kaan bharne par aamadah kiya, phir main wapas aaya."
"870","Abdur Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, Said al-Jurairi se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mezbani ka haq teen din hai; jo is se zyada ho woh sadqa hai."
"871","Rauh ibn Ubadah ne hamein khabar di, Auf ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sad ibn Muadh ki maut par Arsh hil gaya."
"872","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak marfooan, unhon ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni namaz mein uljhan ka shikar ho aur na jane ke us ne izafa kiya ya kami ki, to baitha hua do sajde kare."
"873","Ali ibn Asim ne hamein khabar di, al-Jurairi se, Abu Nadrah al-Abdi se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said al-Khudri ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam khajoor ke tane se tek lagakar jumuah ka khutba dete the. Logon ne un se kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, log badh gaye hain, yani Musalman, aur woh aap ko dekhna pasand karte hain; kaash aap ek mimbar le lein jis par khade hokar log aap ko dekh sakein. Unhon ne farmaya: Haan. Hamare liye yeh mimbar kaun banayega? Ek aadmi un ke samne khada hua aur bola: Main banaunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum banaoge? Us ne kaha: Haan, aur us ne yeh na kaha: Agar Allah ne chaha. Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Fulan. Unhon ne farmaya: Baith jao. To woh baith gaya. Phir unhon ne dohraya: Hamare liye yeh mimbar kaun banayega? Ek aadmi un ke samne khada hua aur bola: Main banaunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum banaoge? Us ne kaha: Haan, aur us ne yeh na kaha: Agar Allah ne chaha. Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Fulan. Unhon ne farmaya: Baith jao. Phir unhon ne dohraya: Hamare liye yeh mimbar kaun banayega? Ek aadmi un ke samne khada hua aur bola: Main banaunga. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum banaoge? Us ne kaha: Haan, agar Allah ne chaha. Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara naam kya hai? Us ne kaha: Ibrahim. Unhon ne farmaya: Banao. Jab Jumuah aaya to log Masjid ke aakhri hisse mein Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye jama hue. Jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mimbar par chadhe aur us par mustaqir hue to khajoor ka tana cheekha hatta ke us ne mujhe suna diya, halanke main masjid ke aakhri hisse mein tha. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam mimbar se utre aur us se lipat gaye, aur musalsal us se lage rahe hatta ke woh sukoon mein aagaya. Phir woh mimbar par wapas aaye, Allah ki hamd aur sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Yeh khajoor ka tana sirf Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke shauq mein cheekha jab unhon ne us ko chhod diya. Allah ki qasam, agar main us ki taraf na utarta aur us se na lipta to woh Qayamat ke din tak sukoon na pata."
"874","Abu Nuaim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ashhab ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne sahaba mein peeche reh jana dekha to farmaya: Aage badho aur mere saath namaz mukammal karo, aur jo tumhare baad hon woh tumhari pairwi karein. Log musalsal peeche hatte rahenge hatta ke Allah azza wa jalla unhein peeche kar dega."
"875","al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Said al-Jurairi se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag walon mein azab mein sab se halka woh aadmi hai jis ke pairon mein aag ke do jute honge jin se us ka dimagh khaulta hoga; un mein se koi Aag mein takhnon tak hoga sath azaab ke dard ke; un mein se koi Aag mein ghutnon tak hoga sath azaab ke dard ke; un mein se koi Aag mein kamar tak hoga sath azaab ke dard ke; un mein se koi Aag mein seene tak hoga sath azaab ke dard ke; aur un mein se koi Aag mein dooba hua hoga."
"876","Rauh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Jurairi se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ibn Said se Jannat ki mitti ke bare mein pucha, to us ne kaha: Bareek safed aata, khalis mushk. Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ne sach kaha."
"877","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Qasim ibn Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke ek charwaha apni bakriyan chara raha tha, ek bhediya aaya aur un mein se ek bakri le li, to charwaha us ke aur bakri ke darmiyan haail hua. Bhediya apni dum par baith gaya aur bola: Ai charwahe, Allah se dar; tu mere aur us rizq ke darmiyan haail hota hai jo Allah ne mujhe diya hai. Charwahe ne kaha: Ajeeb baat hai, ek bhediya apni dum par baitha mujh se insani zuban mein baat karta hai. Bhediye ne kaha: Kya main tumhein is se zyada ajeeb baat na bataun? Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam al-Harrah mein logon ko guzri hui cheezon ki khabrein suna rahe hain. To charwahe ne apni bakriyan haankin hatta ke Madinah aaya aur unhein ek taraf band kiya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas aaya aur unhein bayan kiya. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha. Phir unhon ne farmaya: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke darinde insanon se baat karenge. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, Qayamat nahi aayegi hatta ke aadmi ke kode ka dastah us se baat karega, aur us ke jute ka tasma, aur us ki raan us ko khabar degi ke us ke ghar walon ne kya kiya."
"878","Abu al-Walid ne hamein khabar di, Hammam ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab teen jama hon to un mein se ek un ki imamat kare, aur imamat ka sab se zyada haqdar un mein sab se behtar qirat karne wala hai."
"879","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qatadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Hamare Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamein Surah Fatiha aur jo aasan ho padhne ka hukm diya."
"880","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Naamah al-Sadi se, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne sahaba ke saath namaz padh rahe the, unhon ne apne jutay utare aur unhein apne bayein taraf rakh diya. Jab Musalmanon ne yeh dekha to unhon ne apne jutay utar phenke. Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apni namaz mukammal ki to farmaya: Tumhein apne jutay utar phenkne par kis ne aamadah kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne aap ko utarte dekha to hum ne utar diye. Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibril alaihis salam mere paas aaye aur mujhe khabar di ke un mein gandagi ya takleef deh cheez thi. Jab tum mein se koi masjid aaye to dekhe; agar woh apne jute mein gandagi dekhe to us ko ponchh de, phir us mein namaz padhe."
"881","Mujhe Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Shihab ne Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, unhon ne Abu Nadrah se, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam bimar hue to Jibril alayhis salam ne un par ruqyah kiya aur kaha: Allah ke naam se main tum par ruqyah karta hun, har us cheez se jo tumhein takleef deti hai, har hasid aur nazar-e-bad se; Allah tumhein shifa ata farmaye."
"882","Hamen Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne bayan kiya, hamen Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne Said al-Jurayri se, unhon ne Abu Nadrah se, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam naya libas pehente to us ka naam le kar us ka zikr farmate - qamis, amamah ya chadar - ye kehte hue: Aye Allah, tamam tareef tere hi liye hai; Tu hi ne mujhe ye pehnaya hai. Main Tujh se is ki bhalai aur is maqsad ki bhalai ka sawal karta hun jis ke liye ye banaya gaya hai, aur main Teri panah mangta hun is ke shar se aur is maqsad ke shar se jis ke liye ye banaya gaya hai."
"883","Hamen Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamen Mamar ne Ismail ibn Umayyah se, unhon ne Abu Salamah se, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne masjid mein etikaf farmaya aur logon ko tilawat mein awazen buland karte hue suna jabke Aap apne qubbe mein the. To Aap ne parda uthaya aur farmaya: Tum mein se har shakhs apne Rab azza wa jalla se sargoshi kar raha hai, to tum mein se koi dusre ko takleef na pahunchaye, aur na koi Quran mein - ya farmaya: namaz mein - dusre par apni awaz buland kare."
"884","Hamen Abu Bakr al-Hanafi ne bayan kiya, hamen Ibn Abi Dhib ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Said ibn Khalid al-Qarazi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Quba mein Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman ke paas gaya, aur Abu Salamah ne Banu Amr ibn Awf ki ek khatun se nikah kiya hua tha. Unhon ne mere samne makkhan pesh kiya, to makkhan mein ek makkhi gir gayi, to Abu Salamah apni chhoti ungli se use nikalne lage. Maine kaha: Allah aap ko bakhsh de, aye chacha. Abu Salamah ne kaha: Maine Abu Said ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab makkhi khane mein gir jaye to use pura dubo do, kyunke us ke ek par mein zahar hai aur dusre mein shifa hai; woh zahar ko aage karti hai aur shifa ko peeche rakhti hai."
"885","Hamen Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, hamen Khalid ibn Ilyas ne Yahya ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne bhai ki sharmgah dekhe phir use chhupa le to use Jannat mein dakhil kiya jayega."
"886","Hamen Rawh ibn Ubadah ne bayan kiya, hamen Ibn Uyaynah ne Mutarrif se, unhon ne Atiyah ibn Sad al-Awfi se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main kaise rahat pa sakta hun jabke Sur wale ne Sur ko pakad rakha hai, apni peshani jhuka rakhi hai aur apne kaan ko lagaye hue hai, is intezar mein ke kab use hukm diya jaye? Musalmanon ne kaha: Hum kya kahen? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Hasbunallah wa nimal wakeel, alayhi tawakkalna - Allah hamen kafi hai aur woh behtareen karsaz hai, usi par hum tawakkul karte hain."
"887","Hamen Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamen Ismail ibn Abi Khalid aur Salim al-Muradi ne Atiyah al-Awfi se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Buland darajat walon ko un se neeche wale aise dekhenge jaise tum aasman ke ufuq par sitare ko dekhte ho. Abu Bakr aur Umar unhi mein se hain, aur kya hi khoob hain. Salim ne kaha: Aap ke qaul 'aur kya hi khoob' se murad hai ke woh buland martaba hain. Atiyah Shi'iat ki taraf ma'il shakhs tha."
"888","Hamen Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Amash ne Atiyah se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maaldar halak ho gaye. Sahaba ne kaha: Siwaye kis ke? Aap ne farmaya: Maaldar halak ho gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Siwaye kis ke? Sahaba ne kaha: Hatta ke hamen khauf hua ke ye baat lazim ho gayi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Siwaye us ke jo yun aur yun kharch kare, aur aise log bahut kam hain."
"889","Hamen Jafar ibn Awn ne khabar di, hamen al-Hajjaj ibn Artah ne Atiyah se khabar di, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se qital kare to chehre se bache."
"890","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Zakariya ibn Abi Zaidah ne Atiyah se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs is haal mein mare ke woh Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek nahi karta tha, woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"891","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Fudayl ibn Marzuq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Atiyah ne bayan kiya, mujhe Abu Said ne bayan kiya: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam chasht ki namaz is tarah padhte ke hum samajhte ke Aap use kabhi nahi chhodenge, aur use is tarah chhod dete ke hum samajhte ke Aap use kabhi nahi padhenge."
"892","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Fudayl ibn Marzuq ne Atiyah se, hamen Abu Said ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi shakhs Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga magar Allah ki rehmat se. Hum ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, kya aap bhi nahi? Aap ne farmaya: Main bhi nahi, hatta ke Allah mujhe - aur unhon ne apna haath apne sar par rakha - mera khayal hai farmaya: apni rehmat se dhaanp le."
"893","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Ubaydullah ibn al-Walid al-Wassafi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Atiyah ne Abu Said al-Khudri se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ek janaze mein hazir tha jis mein Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam tashreef farma the. Jab janazah rakha gaya to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne pucha: Kya is par qarz hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jee han. To Aap hum se ek taraf ho gaye aur farmaya: Apne sathi ki namaz-e-janazah padh lo. Jab Ali ne Aap ko ek taraf hote dekha to kaha: Aye Allah ke Nabi, ye apne gunah se bari hai; jo kuch is par hai us ka zimmah main leta hun. To Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam aage badhe aur us ki namaz-e-janazah padhai, phir tashreef le gaye aur farmaya: Aye Ali, Allah aur Islam tumhein jaza-e-khair de; Allah Qayamat ke din tumhari zamanat ko is tarah khatam farmaye jaise tum ne apne musalman bhai ki zamanat khatam ki. Koi banda aisa nahi jo apne bhai ka qarz ada kare magar Allah Qayamat ke din us ki zamanat ko khatam farmata hai. Ansar ka ek mard khada hua aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, kya ye fazilat Ali ke liye khaas hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke tamam Musalmanon ke liye aam hai."
"894","Hamen Abdullah ibn Musa ne Ibn Abi Layla se khabar di, unhon ne Atiyah se, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo logon ka shukr ada nahi karta, woh Allah ka shukr bhi ada nahi karta."
"895","Hamen Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, hamen Ibn Abi Layla ne Atiyah se khabar di, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maaldar ke liye sadqah halal nahi siwaye Allah azza wa jalla ke raaste mein, ya musafir ke liye, ya jab us ka koi faqir padosi ho jise sadqah diya jaye phir woh us mein se use tohfa de de."
"896","Hamen Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, hamen Ibn Abi Layla ne Atiyah se khabar di, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din Aag se ek gardan niklegi aur kahegi: Aaj mujhe har sarkash jabbar aur har us shakhs par muqarrar kiya gaya hai jis ne Allah ke saath dusra mabud banaya. Phir woh unhein lapet kar Jahannam ki gehrai mein phenk degi."
"897","Hamen Hajjaj ibn Minhal ne bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Hajjaj ne Atiyah se, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi nabi aisa nahi guzra magar us ne apni ummat ko Dajjal se khabardar kiya, aur main tumhein us se khabardar karta hun. Woh kana hai, ubhri hui putli wala, ghair mushtabah, deewar ke pehlu par thook ki tarah hai; us ki baayin aankh chamakte hue sitare ki tarah hai. Us ke saath Jannat ki misaal aur Aag ki misaal hogi; us ki jannat dhuein se atalud hai, aur us ki aag hara bhara bagh hai. Us se pehle do aadmi shehron walon ko khabardar karenge; jab bhi woh kisi sheher se nikalte hain to un ka harawal us mein dakhil ho jata hai. Use ek aadmi par ikhtiyar diya jayega, us ke siwa kisi aur par nahi, to woh use zibah karega, phir use laathi se marega, phir kahega: Khada ho ja, to woh khada ho jayega. Woh apne sathiyon se kahega: Tumhara kya khayal hai? To woh us ke haq mein shirk ki gawahi denge. Zibah kiya hua aadmi kahega: Aye logon, ye wahi jhoota Masih Dajjal hai jis se hamein Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne khabardar kiya tha; is ne mere liye tumhare baare mein baseerat mein izafa hi kiya hai. Phir woh laut kar use zibah karega, apni laathi se maar kar kahega: Khada ho ja, to woh khada ho jayega. Kahega: Tumhara kya khayal hai? To woh us ke haq mein shirk ki gawahi denge. Zibah kiya hua aadmi kahega: Aye logon, ye wahi jhoota Masih Dajjal hai jis se hamein Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne khabardar kiya tha; is ne mere liye tumhare baare mein baseerat mein izafa hi kiya hai. Phir woh laut kar use zibah karega, apni laathi se maar kar use kahega: Khada ho ja, to woh khada ho jayega. Woh apne sathiyon se kahega: Tumhara kya khayal hai? To woh us ke haq mein shirk ki gawahi denge. Zibah kiya hua aadmi kahega: Aye logon, ye wahi Masih hai jis se hamein Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne khabardar kiya tha; is ne mere liye tumhare baare mein baseerat mein izafa hi kiya hai. Phir chauthi baar woh use zibah karne lautega, to Allah us ki gardan par taanbe ka ek patra rakh dega, to woh use zibah karna chahega lekin nahi kar sakega. Abu Said ne kaha: Main nahi janta tha ke taanba kya hota hai hatta ke us din malum hua. Hum samajhte the ke woh aadmi Umar ibn al-Khattab hai, hatta ke Umar ibn al-Khattab wafaat pa gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Aur us ke baad log kheti baari aur kasht karenge."
"898","Hamen Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ibn Salamah ne al-Hajjaj se, unhon ne Atiyah se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Oont walon aur bakri walon ne Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke samne fakhr kiya, to Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sukoon aur waqar bakri walon mein hai, aur fakhr aur takabbur oont walon mein hai. Aur Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musa apne ghar walon ki bakriyan charate hue mab'ooth hue. Aap ne farmaya: Aur main Ajyad par apne ghar walon ki bakriyan charate hue mab'ooth hua."
"899","Hamen Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamen Hammad ibn Salamah ne al-Hajjaj se, unhon ne Atiyah ibn Sad se, unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se sawal kiya - ya ek aadmi ne Aap se sawal kiya - kehte hue: Aye Allah ke Rasul, ek bhediye ne meri ek bhed ki dum kaat li hai; kya main use qurbani kar sakta hun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan."
"900","Hamen Ibrahim ibn al-Ashath ne bayan kiya, hamen al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne Sulayman se, unhon ne Atiyah se, unhon ne Abu Said se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se qital kare to chehre se bache, kyunke Allah tabarak wa ta'ala ne Adam ko apni surat par paida farmaya."
"901","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, humein Ali ibn Hashim ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Layla se, Atiyah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs taharat hasil kare aur taharat ko mukammal kare, phir laghw aur jahalat ke baghair Jumuah mein aaye to ye us ke liye is Jumuah aur agle Jumuah ke darmiyan ka kaffara hai, paanch namazen un ke darmiyan ka kaffara hain, aur Jumuah mein ek ghari hai jis mein koi Musalman banda Allah Azza wa Jalla se bhalai mangte hue muwafiq nahi hota magar Woh use use ata farmata hai."
"902","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, humein Waki ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Layla se, Atiyah se, Abu Said se, Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) se, Allah ke is farman Azza wa Jalla ke bare mein: Jis din tumhare Rab ki kuch nishaniyan aa jayengi kisi jaan ko us ka iman faida nahi dega, Aap ne farmaya: Suraj ka apne maghrib se tulu hona."
"903","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, humein Muhammad ibn Bishr ne bayan kiya, humein Zakariya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Atiyah al-Awfi ne bayan kiya ke Abu Said al-Khudri ne un se bayan kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Har nabi ko ek poori hone wali ata di gayi hai, aur maine apni ata ko apni ummat ke liye shafaat ke taur par bacha rakha hai."
"904","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, humein Muhammad ibn Bishr ne bayan kiya, humein Zakariya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Atiyah al-Awfi ne bayan kiya ke Abu Said al-Khudri ne un se bayan kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Mera ek Hawz hai jis ki lambai Kabah aur Bayt al-Maqdis ke darmiyan ke fasle ke barabar hai, doodh ki tarah safed, aur Qayamat ke din ambiya mein mere pairukar sab se zyada honge."
"905","Humein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isa ibn Musa se, Atiyah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ek qawm ko Aag se nikalega jab ke un mein se un ke chehron ke siwa kuch baqi nahi rahega, phir unhein Jannat mein dakhil farmayega."
"906","Humein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, humein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Raja se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Eid ke din sab se pehle mimbar nikalne wala Marwan tha, aur us ne namaz se pehle khutbe se aaghaz kiya, to ek aadmi us ke samne khada hua aur kaha: Aye Marwan, tum ne Sunnat ki mukhalifat ki, tum ne mimbar nikala halanke wo kabhi nahi nikala jata tha, aur tum ne namaz se pehle khutbe se aaghaz kiya, Abu Said ne kaha: Ye kaun hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye falan bin falan hai, unhon ne kaha: Raha ye shakhs to us ne jo us par tha ada kar diya, maine Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko farmate hue suna: Tum mein se jo koi burai dekhe to agar wo use apne hath se badal sakta ho, agar na kar sake to apni zaban se, agar na kar sake to apne dil se, aur ye iman ka sab se kamzor darja hai."
"907","Humein Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, humein al-Hajjaj ibn Artah ne khabar di, Riyah ibn Ubaydah se, ek aadmi se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) khate ya peete to farmate: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne humein khilaya aur humein pilaya aur humein Musalman banaya."
"908","Humein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, humein Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Ata ibn al-Saib se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se ke Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Jannat aur Aag ne fakhr kiya, Aag ne kaha: Aye mere Rab, mujh mein jabir, mutakabbir, badshah aur muazziz log dakhil honge, Jannat ne kaha: Aye mere Rab, mujh mein kamzor, faqir aur mohtaj log dakhil honge, to Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya: Tum Meri saza ho, Main tumhare zariye jis ko chahunga pakdunga, aur Jannat se farmaya: Tum Meri rahmat ho jo har cheez ko ghere hue hai, har ek ko us ka bharpur hissa milega, Aag walon ko Aag mein dala jayega aur wo kahegi: Kya kuch aur hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur unhein us mein dala jayega aur wo kahegi: Kya kuch aur hai, yahan tak ke Tabarak wa Taala us ke pas aayega aur us par Apna qadam rakhega to wo simat jayegi aur kahegi: Bas bas, rahi Jannat to us mein se jo Allah chahega baqi rahega to Allah us ke liye jaisa chahega ek makhlooq paida farmayega."
"909","Humein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, humein Mamar ne khabar di, Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, Abu Said al-Khudri ke ek bete se, apne walid se, Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) se ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to use chahiye ke apna hath apne munh par rakhe, kyunke shaytan jamahi ke sath dakhil hota hai."
"910","Humein Abd al-Malik ne bayan kiya, humein Kathir ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Rubayh ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Said al-Khudri se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Us ka wuzu nahi jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ka naam na le."
"911","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, humein Hushaym ne bayan kiya, humein Mujalid ibn Said ne khabar di, Abu al-Waddak se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, hadith ko marfuan bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Teen hain jin se Allah Azza wa Jalla khush hokar hansta hai: wo mard jab wo raat mein khada hokar namaz padhta hai, wo log jab wo namaz mein saf bandhte hain, aur wo log jab wo dushman ke muqabile mein saf bandhte hain."
"912","Mujhe Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne bayan kiya, humein Yahya ibn Abi Zaidah ne bayan kiya, Mujalid se, Abu al-Waddak se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) hamare darmiyan khade hue aur humein wo bayan farmaya jo Qayamat ke din tak hone wala hai."
"913","Humein Jafar ibn Awn ne khabar di, humein Sulayman al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Nuh ko pukara jayega aur kaha jayega: Kya tum ne pahunchaya, wo kahenge: Ji han, phir un ki qawm ko pukara jayega aur kaha jayega: Kya us ne tumhein pahunchaya, wo kahenge: Hamare pas koi daranewala nahi aaya aur hamare pas koi nahi aaya, phir Wo farmayega: Tumhare gawah kaun hain, wo kahenge: Muhammad (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) aur un ki ummat, phir tumhein laya jayega aur tum gawahi doge ke us ne pahunchaya, aur yahi Allah Taala ka farman hai: Aur isi tarah Hum ne tumhein adl wali darmiyani ummat banaya, aur al-Wasat se murad adl wala hai, taake tum logon par gawah ho aur Rasool tum par gawah ho."
"914","Humein Yala ne khabar di, humein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Jab Jannat wale Jannat mein aur Jahannam wale Jahannam mein dakhil honge to maut ko laya jayega goya wo siyah o safed mendha ho, phir ek pukarne wala pukarega: Aye Jahannam walo, kya tum ise pehchante ho, to wo gardenen utha kar dekhenge aur un sab ne use dekha hoga, wo kahenge: Ji han, ye maut hai, phir ek pukarne wala pukarega: Aye Jannat walo, kya tum ise pehchante ho, to wo gardenen utha kar dekhenge aur un sab ne use dekha hoga, wo kahenge: Ji han, ye maut hai, phir use pakda jayega aur zibah kar diya jayega, phir kaha jayega: Aye Jannat walo, hamesha rehna hai koi maut nahi, aur aye Jahannam walo, hamesha rehna hai koi maut nahi, aur yahi Us ka farman Taala hai: Aur unhein Hasrat ke Din se darao jab muamla faisal kar diya jayega jabke wo ghaflat mein hain, unhon ne kaha: Duniya wale ghaflat mein hain."
"915","Humein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, humein Mamar ne khabar di, al-Amash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar ka ek giroh jama hua aur kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne hum par dusron ko tarjeeh di hai, ye baat Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko pahunchi to Aap ne unhein jama kiya aur un se khitab farmaya, phir farmaya: Aye Ansar ki jamaat, kya tum zaleel na the phir Allah ne tumhein izzat di, unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sach farmaya, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gumrah na the phir Allah ne mere zariye tumhein hidayat di, unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sach farmaya, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum faqir na the phir Allah ne mere zariye tumhein ghani kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ne sach farmaya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jawab nahi doge, kya tum nahi kahoge: Aap hamare pas dhutkare hue aaye aur hum ne Aap ko panah di, aur Aap hamare pas khaufzada aaye aur hum ne Aap ko aman diya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is par razi nahi ke log bakriyan aur oont lekar jayen jabke tum Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ko lekar jao unhein apne gharon mein late hue, agar tum ek wadi ya ghati mein chalo aur log dusri wadi ya ghati mein chalen to main tumhari wadi ya tumhari ghati mein chalunga, agar Hijrat na hoti to main Ansar mein se ek hota, mere baad tum khudgharz tarjeeh dekhoge to sabr karna yahan tak ke tum mujh se milo."
"916","Humein Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, humein Israil ibn Yunus ne khabar di, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Asbahani se, Abu Salih se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) se ke ek aurat ne Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) se kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, apni taraf se hamare liye ek din muqarrar farma den, Aap ne farmaya: Haan, falan din falan jagah, to Aap un ke pas aaye aur unhein Sunnat sikhayi, aur farmaya: Koi aurat nahi jo apne aage teen bachche bhej de magar wo us ke liye Aag se bachao honge, ek aurat ne kaha: Ya do, aye Allah ke Rasool, Aap khamosh rahe, phir us ne kaha: Ya do, aye Allah ke Rasool, Aap khamosh rahe, phir Aap ne farmaya: Ya do."
"917","Mujhe Muhadir ibn al-Muwarra ne bayan kiya, humein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Said se, apne mushahide ke mutabiq, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Allah Taala Qayamat ke din farmayega: Aye Adam, wo kahenge: Labbayk wa sadayk aur tamam bhalai Aap ke hathon mein hai, Wo farmayega: Jahannam ka hissa nikal do, wo kahenge: Aye Rab, Jahannam ka hissa kya hai, Wo farmayega: Har hazar mein se nau sau ninyanwe, us waqt navmawlud budha ho jayega aur har hamila apna bojh gira degi aur tum logon ko masti mein dek hoge halanke wo mast nahi honge lekin Allah ka azab sakht hai, unhon ne kaha: Ye Nabi (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ke Sahaba par bhari guzri to unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, hum mein se wo ek kaun hoga, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek mard aur Yajuj aur Majuj mein se ek hazar, Us Zat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein meri jaan hai, mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka chauthai hoge, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne Allahu Akbar kaha, phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein meri jaan hai, mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka tihai hoge, unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne Allahu Akbar kaha, phir Aap ne farmaya: Us Zat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein meri jaan hai, mujhe ummeed hai ke tum Jannat walon ka nisf hoge, phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum logon mein sirf aise ho jaise kale bail ki khal par safed baal, ya safed bail ki khal par kala baal."
"918","Mujhe Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, humein Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne khabar di, al-Amash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Mere Sahaba ko bura na kaho, Mere Sahaba ko mere liye chhod do, kyunke agar tum mein se koi Uhud ke barabar sona kharch kare to wo un mein se ek ke mudd ko nahi pahunch sakta."
"919","Humein Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, humein Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Allah ki rahmat aur salamti ho Aap par) ne farmaya: Zanakar zina nahi karta jabke wo momin ho, chor chori nahi karta jabke wo momin ho, aur wo sharab nahi peeta jabke wo momin ho, phir bhi tawba khuli rehti hai."
"920","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, humein Abd Allah ibn Idris ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Abu Salih se, Abu Said se: Hum ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya hum apne Rab ko dekhenge, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum dopahar ke waqt suraj ko dekhne mein koi takleef uthate ho jab badal na hon, hum ne kaha: Nahi, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum chandvi raat ke chand ko dekhne mein koi takleef uthate ho jab badal na hon, hum ne kaha: Nahi, Aap ne farmaya: Phir tum Use dekhne mein koi takleef nahi uthaoge magar aise hi jaise tum unhein dekhne mein takleef nahi uthate."
"921","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Fudayl ne hamein khabar di, Abu Sinan se, Abu Salih se, Abu Hurayrah aur Abu Said al-Khudri se, un dono ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Roza Mere liye hai aur Main hi is ka badla dunga. Rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain: jab woh iftar karta hai to khush hota hai, aur jab woh Allah Azza wa Jall se mulaqat karega to khush hoga. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke Haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, rozedar ke munh ki badli hui boo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada pakeezah hai."
"922","Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne hamein bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Shurayh ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hani al-Tujibi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Ali al-Tujibi ko suna ke unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte huye suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein sau darje hain; har do darjon ke darmiyan itna fasla hai jitna aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan hai, ya is se bhi zyada. Maine arz kiya: Mere maa baap aap par qurban hon, ye kin ke liye hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ke raste mein jihad karne walon ke liye."
"923","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Abd Allah ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj se, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum kisi aadmi ko masjid mein ba-kasrat aate jaate dekho to us ke liye iman ki gawahi do, kyunke Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Allah ki masjidon ko sirf wohi aabad karte hain jo Allah aur Yawm-e-Akhirat par iman rakhte hain."
"924","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj Abu al-Samh ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said se, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Wayl ek wadi hai jis mein kafir chalis kharif tak girta rahega yahan tak ke us ki teh tak pahunche, aur al-Saud Jahannam ki aag ka ek pahad hai jis par woh sattar kharif tak chadhega, phir usi tarah hamesha us se niche girta rahega."
"925","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj Abu al-Samh ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ka kasrat se zikr karo, yahan tak ke kaha jaye ke woh majnoon hai."
"926","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj Abu al-Samh ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said se, Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jannat ke darwaze ke do paton ke darmiyan fasla chalis saal ki musafat hai."
"927","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj Abu al-Samh ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Sab se sacche khwab woh hain jo raat ke aakhiri hisse mein fajr se pehle dekhe jayen."
"928","Abd Allah ibn Yazid ne hamein bayan kiya, Haywah ibn Shurayh ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salim ibn Ghaylan ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Darraj Abu al-Samh ko Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat karte huye suna, ke unhon ne Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko farmate huye suna: Jab Allah kisi bande se raazi hota hai to us ki taarif mein saat qism ki bhalaaiyan bayan karta hai jo us ne nahi ki hotin, aur jab kisi bande se naraz hota hai to us ki mazammat mein saat qism ki buraiyan bayan karta hai jo us ne nahi ki hotin."
"929","Abd Allah ne hamein bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Ayyub ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Darraj ko kehte huye suna: Maine Abu al-Haytham ko kehte huye suna: Maine Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte huye suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Kafir par us ki qabr mein ninyanwe azdaha musallat kiye jayenge, jo use Qiyamat qayam hone tak kaat-te aur daste rahenge; agar un mein se ek zameen par phoonk mare to zameen kabhi bhi sabza na ugaye."
"930","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hamein bayan kiya, Rishdin ibn Sad se, unhon ne kaha: Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu al-Samh se, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said se, Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se, Allah ke is farman Azza wa Jall ke baare mein: Pighle huye dhaat jaise pani ke saath: Aap ne farmaya: Tel ki talchhat ki tarah; jab use us ke qareeb laya jayega to us ke chehre ki khaal us mein jhad kar gir jayegi."
"931","Abd Allah ibn Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Haywah ibn Shurayh ne mujh se bayan kiya, Salim ibn Ghaylan se, ke unhon ne Darraj Abu al-Samh ko kehte huye suna: Unhon ne Abu al-Haytham ko kehte huye suna: Unhon ne Abu Said ko kehte huye suna: Maine Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ko farmate huye suna: Main kufr aur qarz se Allah ki panah mangta hun. Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya aap kufr ko qarz ke barabar qarar dete hain? Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Haan."
"932","Yahya ibn Ishaq ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj se, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Iblis ne kaha: Ae mere Rab, main Aulad-e-Adam ko gumrah karta rahunga jab tak un ki roohein un ke jismon mein hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir Rab Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mujhe Meri Izzat aur Jalal ki qasam, Main unhein bakhshta rahunga jab tak woh Mujh se bakhshish talab karte rahenge."
"933","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne hamein bayan kiya, Layth ibn Sad ne hamein bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Said se, un ke walid se, ke unhon ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte huye suna: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Jab janazah rakha jata hai aur aadmi use apni gardano par uthate hain, to agar woh nek tha to kehta hai: Mujhe aage le chalo, aur agar nek na tha to kehta hai: Haye afsos us par, use kahan le ja rahe ho? Insan ke siwa har cheez us ki awaz sunti hai, aur agar insan use sun le to behosh ho jaye."
"934","Yahya ibn Ishaq ne hamein bayan kiya, Ibn Lahiah ne hamein bayan kiya, Darraj se, Abu al-Haytham se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Agar log jaan lete ke azan mein kya sawab hai to woh us ke liye talwaron se ek dusre se ladte."
"935","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hamein bayan kiya, Shayban ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Nahwi ne hamein bayan kiya, Qatadah se: Abu al-Mutawakkil al-Naji ne hamein bayan kiya, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Momin Jahannam ki aag se najaat payenge aur Jannat aur Jahannam ke darmiyan ek pul par rok liye jayenge, jahan un mein se baaz se baaz ke liye un mazalim ka badla liya jayega jo duniya mein un ke darmiyan the, yahan tak ke jab woh paak saaf kar diye jayenge to unhein Jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat di jayegi. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke Haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, un mein se har ek apne Jannat ke ghar ka rasta is duniya mein apne ghar ke raste se zyada behtar janega. Unhon ne kaha: Aur un mein se baaz ne kaha: Woh Jumuah ke logon ke siwa kisi se mushabeh nahi jab woh apni Jumuah ki namaz se muntashir hote hain. Ae Allah, hamein un logon mein se bana jinhein Jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat di jayegi, Ae Nihayat Meherban, Ae Nihayat Rahem karne Wale."
"936","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne hamein bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Arubah se, Sulayman al-Naji se, Abu al-Mutawakkil se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi aaya jabke Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam namaz padh chuke the, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Kaun is aadmi ke saath nafa-bakhsh tijarat karega? To ek aadmi khada hua aur us ke saath namaz padhi."
"937","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Usamah ne hamein bayan kiya, Ali ibn Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu al-Mutawakkil al-Naji ko kehte huye suna: Abu Said al-Khudri ne kaha: Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman aisa nahi jo aisi dua kare jis mein na gunah ho aur na qata-e-rahmi ho, magar Allah use teen cheezon mein se ek zaroor ata karta hai: ya to us ki dua jald qubool kar li jati hai, ya us ke liye Aakhirat mein zakheera kar di jati hai, ya us se utni hi burai door kar di jati hai. Sahaba ne arz kiya: Tab to hum kasrat se dua karenge. Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall zyada dene wala aur zyada sakhi hai."
"938","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein bayan kiya, Shubah se, Qatadah se, Abu al-Mutawakkil al-Naji se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, mere bhai ko dast lage huye hain. Aap ne farmaya: Use shahad pilao. To us ne use pilaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, maine use pilaya to us ke dast aur badh gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Use shahad pilao. To us ne use pilaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, maine use pilaya to us ke dast aur badh gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Use shahad pilao. To us ne use pilaya, teesri ya chauthi martaba par, mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha, phir woh theek ho gaya. Phir Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sach farmaya aur tumhare bhai ke pet ne jhoot bola."
"939","Qabisah ne hamein bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hamein bayan kiya, Aban ibn Abi Ayyash se, Abu al-Siddiq al-Naji se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam se pucha aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah, baccha aankhon ki thandak aur khushi ki takmeel hai, to kya Ahl-e-Jannat ke han aulad hogi? Aap ne farmaya: Jab koi aadmi khwahish karega, ya chahega, to ek hi ghadi mein us ke liye hamal, waz-e-hamal aur jawan hona jo woh chahega ho jayega."
"940","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hamein bayan kiya, Mansur se, Abu Bishr al-Hujaymi se, Abu al-Siddiq se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ke Zuhr aur Asr mein qiyam ka andaza lagate the; hum Zuhr ki pehli do rak'aton mein Aap ke qiyam ka andaza taqreeban tees aayaton ke barabar lagate the, aur aakhiri do rak'aton mein us se aadha andaza lagate the, aur Asr ki pehli do rak'aton mein Zuhr ki aakhiri do rak'aton ke barabar andaza lagate the, aur Asr ki aakhiri do rak'aton mein us se aadha andaza lagate the."
"941","Hamen Rawh ibn Ubadah ne bayan kiya, hamen Said ibn Abi Arubah ne bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yajuj aur Majuj ke khuruj ke baad bhi log Hajj aur Umrah karte rahenge aur khajur ke darakht lagate rahenge."
"942","Hamen Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, al-Thawri se: hamen Abu Ishaq ne khabar di ke unhen al-Agharr ne bayan kiya, Abu Said al-Khudri aur Abu Hurayrah se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ek pukarne wala pukarega: Tumhare liye hai ke tum zinda raho aur kabhi na maro, aur tumhare liye hai ke tum sehatmand raho aur kabhi bimar na ho, aur tumhare liye hai ke tum jawan raho aur kabhi buddhe na ho, aur tumhare liye hai ke tum naimat se lutf andoz ho aur kabhi badbakht na ho. Yehi Us ka farman hai, Azza wa Jalla: Aur unhen nida di jayegi: Yehi Jannat hai jis ke tum waris banaye gaye ho us ke badle jo tum amal karte the."
"943","Hamen Husayn ibn Ali al-Jufi ne bayan kiya, Hamzah al-Zayyat se, Abu Ishaq se, al-Agharr Abu Muslim se, ke us ne Abu Hurayrah aur Abu Said par gawahi di ke un dono ne Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par gawahi di ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab banda kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur Allah sab se bada hai, to Tabarak wa Taala farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin aur Main Akela hun. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Akela, jis ka koi sharik nahin, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, Mera koi sharik nahin. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Usi ke liye badshahat hai aur Usi ke liye hamd hai, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, Mere hi liye badshahat hai aur Mere hi liye hamd hai. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Allah ke siwa koi quwwat aur taqat nahin, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Mere siwa koi quwwat aur taqat nahin. Abu Ishaq ne kaha: Phir al-Agharr ne kuch kaha jo main samajh na saka, to main ne Abu Jafar se kaha: Us ne kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Us ne kaha: Jise maut ke waqt ye kalimat naseeb ho jayen use Aag nahin chhuyegi."
"944","Hamen Musab ibn Miqdam al-Khathami ne bayan kiya, hamen Israil ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Muslim al-Agharr se, Abu Hurayrah aur Abu Said se, ke un dono ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par gawahi di, aur main un dono ke waseele se Aap par gawahi deta hun, ke un dono ne Aap se bayan kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab banda kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin aur Allah sab se bada hai, to us ka Rabb us ki tasdiq karta hai aur farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin aur Main sab se bada hun. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Akela, to us ka Rabb us ki tasdiq karta hai aur farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin aur Main Akela hun. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, jis ka koi sharik nahin, to us ka Rabb us ki tasdiq karta hai aur farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, Mera koi sharik nahin. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Usi ke liye badshahat hai aur Usi ke liye hamd hai, to us ka Rabb us ki tasdiq karta hai aur farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, Mere hi liye badshahat hai aur Mere hi liye hamd hai. Jab woh kehta hai: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Allah ke siwa koi quwwat aur taqat nahin, to farmata hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, Mere siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Mere siwa koi quwwat aur taqat nahin."
"945","Hamen Musab ibn Miqdam ne bayan kiya, hamen Israil ne bayan kiya, Abu Jafar al-Farra se, al-Agharr se, Abu Ishaq ki hadith ki manind, siwa is ke ke us ne is me izafa kiya, us ne kaha: Jo shakhs inhen apni bimari me kahe phir mar jaye to Aag me dakhil nahin hoga."
"946","Mujhe Ali ibn Asim ne khabar di, hamen Abu Harun al-Abdi ne bayan kiya, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main fajr ki namaz ke liye nikla to masjid ke dehliz me shaitan mujhe mila aur mujh se bhid gaya hatta ke main us ke baal mehsus karne laga. Main ne use pakad liya aur us ka gala ghonta hatta ke main apne hath par us ki zaban ki thandak mehsus karne laga. Agar mere bhai Sulayman ki dua na hoti to subah use murda chhod diya jata taake tum use dekho."
"947","Hamen Ali ibn Asim ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Harun al-Abdi ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Said ne bayan kiya, jinhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sath nikle, aur Aap jab ek farsakh safar karte to namaz qasr farmate."
"948","Hamen Husayn al-Jufi ne bayan kiya, Fudayl ibn Iyad se: hamen Sufyan al-Thawri ne bayan kiya, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, Abu Said se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apne khadim ko mare aur woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ka zikr kare to use apna hath utha lena chahiye."
"949","Hamen Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamen Mamar ne khabar di, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Adam aur Musa alaihimas salam ne ek dusre se hujjat ki. Musa ne kaha: Aap Allah ke khalifa hain, Us ne Apne Hath se Aap ko Apni Jannat me basaya aur Apne farishton se Aap ko sajda karwaya, phir bhi Aap ne apni aulad ko Jannat se nikalwaya aur unhen badbakht kiya. Adam alaihissalam ne kaha: Aap Musa hain jinhen Allah ne Apne kalam aur Apne paighamat se muntakhab kiya, kya Aap mujhe us cheez par malamat karte hain jo mere paida hone se pehle mere liye muqaddar ki gayi thi? Aap ne farmaya: Pas Adam dalil me Musa par ghalib aaye, pas Adam dalil me Musa par ghalib aaye."
"950","Hamen Abu Nuaym aur Abu Ahmad al-Zubayri ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se mushrikin ke bachchon ke bare me puchha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Allah behtar janta hai jo woh karte."
"951","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, Abu Said se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sawariyan sirf teen masjidon ki taraf kasi jati hain: Masjid al-Haram, Rasul ki Masjid, aur Masjid al-Aqsa."
"952","Hamen Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamen Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte suna: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hamen Fajr Quran ki do sab se chhoti surton ke sath padhayi. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aaj Aap ne hamen aisi namaz padhayi jo Aap kabhi nahin padhate the. Aap ne farmaya: Main ne aurton ki safon me ek bachche ke rone ki awaz suni."
"953","Hamen Ubayd Allah ibn Musa aur Abu Ahmad al-Zubayri ne khabar di, Sufyan se, Abu Harun se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apne khadim ko mare aur woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ka zikr kare to use apna hath utha lena chahiye."
"954","Hamen Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Sufyan se, Abu Harun se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz ke aakhir me kaha karte the, main nahin janta taslim se pehle ya taslim ke baad: Pak hai aap ka Rabb, izzat ka Rabb, us se jo woh bayan karte hain, aur rasulon par salaam ho, aur tamam taarif Allah ke liye hai jo tamam jahanon ka Rabb hai."
"955","Hamen Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne khabar di, hamen Abu Jafar al-Razi ne khabar di, Abu Harun se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Muhajirin me ek zaeef shakhs tha jise Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ek hajat thi, pas us ne tanhayi me Aap se milna chaha taake apni hajat Aap se arz kare. Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam al-Batha me utre hue the aur raat ko aate aur Baitullah ka tawaf karte, hatta ke jab fajr qareeb hoti to wapas aate aur unhen subah ki namaz padhate. Unhon ne kaha: Ek raat tawaf ne Aap ko rok liya hatta ke subah ho gayi. Jab Aap apni untni par sawar hue to us shakhs ne Aap ka rasta roka aur Aap ki untni ki mahar pakad li, kehte hue: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe Aap se ek hajat hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum apni hajat pa loge. Lekin us ne inkar kiya, aur jab Aap ko andesha hua ke woh Aap ko rok lega to Aap ne use kode se halka mara, phir aage badhe aur unhen subah ki namaz padhayi. Jab Aap farigh hue to Aap ne apna chehra logon ki taraf phera, aur jab Aap aisa karte to woh jante ke kuch pesh aaya hai, pas log Aap ke gird jama ho gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Woh kahan hai jise main ne abhi mara hai? Aap ne doharaya: Agar woh logon me hai to khada ho jaye. Unhon ne kaha: Woh shakhs kehne laga: Main Allah ki aur phir Us ke Rasul ki panah mangta hun, jabke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmate rahe: Qareeb aao, qareeb aao, hatta ke woh Aap ke qareeb aaya. Phir Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam us ke samne baith gaye aur use koda de diya, farmate hue: Apne kode ka badla le lo aur qisas lo. Us ne kaha: Main Allah ki panah mangta hun Us ke Nabi ko marne se. Aap ne farmaya: Apne kode ka badla le lo, tum par koi harj nahin. Us ne kaha: Main Allah ki panah mangta hun Us ke Nabi ko marne se. Aap ne farmaya: Illa ye ke tum muaf kar do. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne koda phenk diya aur kaha: Main ne muaf kiya, Ya Rasulullah. Phir Abu Dharr us ke samne khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya Aap ko al-Aqabah ki raat yaad hai jab main Aap ki sawari hank raha tha jabke Aap so rahe the? Jab bhi main use hankta woh sust hoti, aur jab bhi main us ki mahar pakadta woh zid karti, pas main ne Aap ko kode se halka mara aur kaha: Log Aap ke pas aa gaye hain, aur Aap ne farmaya: Tum par koi harj nahin. Lijiye, Ya Rasulullah, aur qisas lijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Main ne muaf kiya. Us ne kaha: Qisas lijiye, kyunke ye mujhe zyada mahbub hai. Pas Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne use mara, aur main ne use Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki maar se karahte dekha. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Aye logon, Allah se daro, kyunke Allah ki qasam, koi momin kisi momin par zulm nahin karta magar Allah Qiyamat ke Din us se us ka badla lega."
"956","Hamen Ali ibn Asim ne khabar di, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni namaz ke aakhir me salam pherte to farmate: Pak hai aap ka Rabb, izzat ka Rabb, us se jo woh bayan karte hain, aur rasulon par salaam ho, aur tamam taarif Allah ke liye hai jo tamam jahanon ka Rabb hai."
"957","Hamen Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamen Mamar ne khabar di, Abu Harun al-Abdi se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par us raat jab Aap ko raat ko le jaya gaya pachas namazen farz ki gay"
"958","Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, jo kehte hain: Hisham ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Said se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Raaston mein baithne se bacho. Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, humein apni majlison se chara nahi jahan hum baatein karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum majlis par israar karte ho to raaste ka haq ada karo. Unhone kaha: Ya Rasulullah, raaste ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nigah neechi rakhna, takleef rokna, salaam ka jawab dena, aur neki ka hukm dena aur burayi se rokna."
"959","Ismail ibn Abi Uways ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn Aslam ne humein khabar di, apne walid se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen cheezein rozedar ka roza nahi todtin: qai, hijama, aur ehtelam."
"960","Abd al-Razzaq ne humein khabar di, Mamar ne humein khabar di, Zayd ibn Aslam se, ek aadmi se, Abu Said se riwayat hai jo kehte hain: Ek aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam par haath rakha aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, main Aap ke tez bukhar ki wajah se mushkil se hi Aap par haath rakh pa raha hun. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum anbiya ki jamaat par aazmaish dugni kar di jati hai jaise hamara sawab dugna kar diya jata hai. Anbiya mein ek nabi aisa tha jo juon mein mubtala rehta yahan tak ke wo use qatl kar detin, aur anbiya mein ek nabi aisa tha jo faqr mein mubtala rehta yahan tak ke wo ek aba leta aur use lapet leta. Wo aazmaish par aise khush hote jaise tum aasani par khush hote ho."
"961","Mujhe Musa ibn Masud ne bayan kiya, hamein Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Halhalah se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Said aur Abu Hurayrah se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Musalman shakhs ko koi thakan, na bimari, na bechaini, na gham, na takleef aur na ranj pahunchta hai, hatta ke ek kaanta bhi jo use chubhe, magar Allah us ke zariye us ke kuch gunahon ka kaffarah farma deta hai."
"962","Mujhe Ibrahim ibn al-Ashath ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne bayan kiya, hamein Layth ibn Sad ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Khalid ibn Yazid ne bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Hilal se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Qayamat ke din zameen ek roti ki manind hogi jise Allah al-Jabbar is tarah ulat palat karega jaise tum mein se koi safar mein apni roti ko ulta palta karta hai, ahl-e-jannat ki ziyafat ke taur par. Unhon ne kaha: Phir yahud ke ulama mein se ek aalim aaya aur kehne laga: Al-Rahman aap ko barkat de, ai Abu al-Qasim, kya main aap ko qyamat ke din ahl-e-jannat ki ziyafat ke bare mein na bataun? Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi, zaroor. Us ne kaha: Zameen ek roti hogi, jaisa ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya. Phir Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamari taraf dekha aur hanse yahan tak ke aap ki dadhein nazar aane lagein. Phir aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhein un ke salan ke bare mein na bataun? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi, zaroor. Aap ne farmaya: Un ka salan balam aur nun hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ek bail aur ek machhli hai; sattar hazar afrad un ke jigar ki zayed phank se khayenge."
"963","Hamein Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne bayan kiya, Kharijah ibn Musab se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, Abu Said se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi subah aisi nahi guzarti magar do farishte pukarte hain: Auraton ki wajah se mardon ke liye halakat hai, aur mardon ki wajah se auraton ke liye halakat hai."
"964","Hamein Safwan ibn Isa ne khabar di, Unays se, un ke walid se, Abu Said se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us bimari ke dauran hamare paas tashreef laye jis mein aap ki wafaat hui, is haal mein ke aap ka sar patti se bandha hua tha. Unhon ne kaha: Main aap ke peeche chala yahan tak ke aap mimbar par chadhe, aur aap ne farmaya: Main is waqt Hawd par khada hun. Phir aap ne farmaya: Ek bande ko duniya aur us ki zeenat pesh ki gayi to us ne akhirat ko chun liya. Unhon ne kaha: Logon mein se Abu Bakr ke siwa koi na samjha, unhon ne kaha: Mere maa baap aap par qurban hon, balke hum aap par apni janon, apne malon aur apni auladon ko qurban karenge. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aap mimbar se utre aur us ghadi tak dobara nazar na aaye."
"965","Hamein Husayn ne bayan kiya, Zaidah se, Abd al-Malik ibn Umayr se, Qazah se, Abu Said se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Do namazon ke baad koi namaz nahi: Fajr ke baad se suraj nikalne tak, aur Asr ke baad se suraj ghurub hone tak."
"966","Hamein Yala ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Hamzah se, al-Hasan se, Abu Said se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke aap ne farmaya: Sachcha amantdar tajir nabiyon, siddiqon aur shuhada ke saath hoga."
"967","Hamein Yahya ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Lahiah ne khabar di, Ishaq ibn Abd Allah ibn Abi Farwah se, Iyad ibn Abd Allah ibn Sad se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Youm-e-Arafah ka roza rakhe, Allah us ke do saal bakhsh dega: ek saal jo is se pehle hai aur ek saal jo is ke baad hai."
"968","Hamein Abd Allah ibn Yazid al-Muqri ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd al-Rahman ibn Ziyad ibn Anum al-Ifriqi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abd Allah ibn Rashid ne jo Uthman ibn Affan ke azad kardah ghulam hain, bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Al-Rahman Tabarak wa Ta'ala ke paas ek Lauh hai jis mein teen sau pandrah qanoon hain. Al-Rahman farmata hai: Meri Izzat aur Jalal ki qasam, mera koi banda jo mere saath kisi cheez ko shareek na kare, in mein se ek par bhi amal karte hue zindagi guzare, magar main use Jannat mein dakhil karunga."
"969","Hamein Shuja ibn al-Walid ibn Qays al-Sakuni ne bayan kiya, Sulayman se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir ibn Abd Allah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein apni namaz mukammal kar le to apni namaz ka kuch hissa apne ghar ke liye bhi rakhe, kyunki Allah Azza wa Jalla us ki namaz ki wajah se us ke ghar mein khair paida farma dega."
"970","Hamein Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir ibn Abd Allah se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein apni namaz mukammal kar le to apni namaz ka kuch hissa apne ghar ke liye bhi rakhe, kyunki Allah Azza wa Jalla us ke ghar mein us ki ghar mein ada ki gayi namaz ki wajah se khair paida farma dega."
"971","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Amr ibn Murrah se, Abu al-Bakhtari se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne aap ko haqir na samjhe ke wo Allah Azza wa Jalla se mutalliq koi muamla dekhe jis par use baat karni chahiye phir wo us par khada na ho; phir wo Allah Azza wa Jalla se milega to Allah kahega: Fulan din fulan baat kehne se tujhe kis cheez ne roka? Wo kahega: Ai Rab, logon ke khauf ne. Allah kahega: Mujh hi se darna tumhare liye zyada munasib tha."
"972","Hamein Abu Nuaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Zubayd se, Amr ibn Murrah se, Abu al-Bakhtari se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne aap ko haqir na samjhe ke wo Allah ke kisi muamle ko dekhe jis par kehne ko kuch ho aur wo us par khada na ho; us se kaha jayega: Fulan fulan baat kehne se tujhe kis cheez ne roka? Wo kahega: Logon ka khauf. Allah kahega: Mujh hi se darna tumhare liye zyada munasib tha."
"973","Hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, hamein Sulayman ibn Bilal ne bayan kiya, Umarah ibn Ghaziyyah se, Yahya ibn Umarah se, Abu Said se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne qareeb al-maut logon ko La ilaha illallah ki talqeen karo."
"974","Hamein Jafar ibn Awn ne khabar di, hamein Hisham ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Abd Allah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne bayan kiya, Nahhar ibn Abd Allah al-Abdi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Said al-Khudri ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Allah Azza wa Jalla qyamat ke din bande se sawal karega, aur jin cheezon ke bare mein wo us se sawal karega un mein se ye kahega: Tujhe kis cheez ne roka jab tune burai dekhi ke tu us par nakir karta? Jab use us ki hujjat talqeen ki jayegi to wo kahega: Ai Rab, main logon se dara lekin tujh par bharosa kiya."
"975","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ata ibn Yazid se, Abu Said se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ai Rasul Allah, kaun se log sab se behtar hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo momin jo apni jaan aur apne maal ke saath Allah ke raste mein jihad kare. Us ne kaha: Phir kaun? Aap ne farmaya: Phir wo shakhs jo pahad ki kisi ghati mein گوشہ nashin ho jaye, apne Rab ki ibadat kare aur logon ko apne shar se mahfooz rakhe."
"976","Hamein Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, Hilal ibn Maymun se, Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi se, Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jamaat ke saath namaz us ki tanhah namaz se pachees darje badh kar hai; agar wo use bayaban zameen mein wuzu, ruku aur sujud mukammal karke ada kare to us ki namaz pachas darjon tak pahunch jati hai."
"977","Hamein Rawh ibn Ubadah ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, hamein Suhayl ibn Abi Salih ne bayan kiya, al-Numan ibn Abi Ayyash se, Abu Said se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda aisa nahi jo Allah ki rah mein, Allah Azza wa Jalla ki raza talash karte hue ek din ka roza rakhe, magar Allah us ke chehre ko aag se nabbe kharif, ya sattar kharif ki musafat tak door kar dega."
"978","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, Shubah se, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abd Allah ibn Abi Utbah ko Abu Said al-Khudri se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne khidr mein baithi kunwari ladki se bhi zyada haya daar the, aur jab aap kisi cheez ko na pasand farmate to hum us ko aap ke chehre se pehchan lete the."
"979","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Sahba se, Said ibn Jubayr se, Abu Said se marfu'an riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ibn-e-Adam subah bedar hota hai to tamam aaza zaban ke samne aajizi karte hain, kehte hain: Hamare bare mein Allah se daro; agar tum seedhi raho gi to hum seedhe rahenge, aur agar tum tedhi ho gayi to hum bhi tedhe ho jayenge."
"980","Mujhe Khalid ibn Makhlad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Malik ne bayan kiya, Ayyub ibn Habib se, Abu al-Muthanna al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ibn al-Hakam ne Abu Said al-Khudri se kaha: Kya tum ne Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko peene ki cheez mein phunk marne se mana karte hue suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Ek aadmi ne aap se kaha: Ai Rasul Allah, main ek saans mein apni pyaas nahi bujha pata. Aap ne farmaya: Phir pyale ko apne munh se hata kar saans lo. Us ne kaha: Agar us mein koi tinka ho to? Aap ne farmaya: To use baha do."
"981","Abd Allah ibn Maslamah al-Qanabi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi al-Mawal ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Amrah al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said ko un ki qaum mein ek janazay ki khabar di gayi, aur aisa laga ke unhon ne takheer ki yahan tak ke log baith gaye, phir woh aaye. Jab logon ne unhein dekha to woh un ke ird gird se hat gaye, aur un mein se baaz kharay ho gaye taake woh un ki jagah baith jayein. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Behtareen majlisein woh hain jo sab se kushada hon. Phir woh hat gaye aur ek kushada jagah mein baith gaye."
"982","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said, al-Mahri ke azaad kardah ghulam, ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mera ek bhai ayaal chhor kar faut ho gaya aur maal nahin chhora, to main Abu Said al-Khudri ke paas gaya aur kaha: Mera ek bhai ayaal chhor kar faut ho gaya hai aur maal nahin chhora, aur main unhein amsar mein se kisi misr ki taraf le jane ka irada rakhta hun. Unhon ne mujh se kaha: Tujh par afsos hai, unhein bahar na le ja, kyunke main ne unhein farmate hue suna — yani Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam): Jo shakhs us ki sakhti aur shiddat par sabr karega, main Qayamat ke din us ke liye sifarishi ya gawah banunga."
"983","Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Rafi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sulayman, Abu Said al-Khudri ke azaad kardah ghulam se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla sharab pine wale ki namaz qabool nahin farmayega jab tak us ka kuch hissa us ke jism mein baqi rahe."
"984","Zakariyya ibn Adi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah ibn Amr al-Raqqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd Allah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke unhon ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Kya main tumhein us cheez ki taraf rahnumayi na karun jis se Allah gunahon ka kaffara karta hai aur nekiyon mein izafa karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, zaroor. Unhon ne farmaya: Mushakkaton ke bawajood wuzu ko mukammal karna, masajid ki taraf kasrat se qadam barhana, aur ek namaz ke baad doosri namaz ka intezar karna. Tum mein se jo koi apne ghar se taharat ki halat mein nikalta hai aur Musalmanon ke sath ba-jamaat namaz parhta hai, phir doosri namaz ke intezar mein apni jagah baitha rehta hai, magar farishte kehte hain: Ae Allah, usay bakhsh de; Ae Allah, us par rehem farma. Jab tum namaz ke liye kharay ho, apni safon ko seedha karo aur khala ko pur karo, kyunke main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun. Jab tumhara imam kahe: Allahu Akbar, to kaho: Allahu Akbar; jab woh ruku kare, to ruku karo; jab woh kahe: Sami Allahu liman hamidah, to kaho: Ae Allah, ae hamare Rab, tere hi liye hamd hai. Ae aurton ki jamaat, jab mard sajda karein, apni nigahein neechi rakho aur tang tehbandon ki wajah se mardon ke satr ki taraf na dekho."
"985","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abd Allah ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Usamah ibn Zayd se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban ne mujhe khabar di ke Wasi ibn Habban ne unhein khabar di ke Abu Said al-Khudri ne unhein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tumhein qurbani ke janwaron ke gosht se mana kiya tha, to ab khao aur zakhira karo; main ne tumhein qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya tha, to ab un ki ziyarat karo, kyunke un mein ibrat hai; aur main ne tumhein nabidh se mana kiya tha, to ab nabidh banao, lekin main tumhare liye koi nashawar cheez jayez nahin karta."
"986","Zakariyya ibn Adi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ubayd Allah ibn Amr ne hamein khabar di, Abd Allah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Hamzah ibn Abi Said se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: Un logon ka kya haal hai jo kehte hain ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki qarabat Qayamat ke din faida nahin degi? Haan, Allah ki qasam, meri qarabat duniya aur akhirat mein juri hui hai. Ae logo, Qayamat ke din Hawd par main tum se pehle pahunchunga. Jab tum aaoge, to ek aadmi kahega: Ae Allah ke Rasul, main falan bin falan hun, aur doosra kahega: Ae Allah ke Rasul, main falan bin falan hun. Phir main kahunga: Nasab ke hawale se to main ne pehchan liya tha, lekin tum ne mere baad bidat nikali aur apni aidiyon par wapas laut gaye."
"987","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Abd al-Malik ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Muhammad ko Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se riwayat karte hue suna, Abu Said al-Khudri se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Bakriyon ki izzat karo, un se mitti saaf karo, aur un ke baithne ki jagah mein namaz parho, kyunke woh Jannat ki sawariyon mein se hain."
"988","Khalid ibn Makhlad al-Bajali ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Musa ne mujhe bayan kiya, Sad ibn Ishaq ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Kab ibn Ujrah se, un ki phuphi se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said al-Khudri ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aurat se teen khubiyon mein se ek ki bina par nikah kiya jata hai: aurat se us ke maal ki wajah se nikah kiya jata hai, aurat se us ke husn ki wajah se nikah kiya jata hai, aur aurat se us ke deen ki wajah se nikah kiya jata hai. Pas deen aur akhlaq wali ko ikhtiyar karo; tumhara dayan haath khak aalood ho."
"989","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Layth ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Habib ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Khayr se, Abu al-Khattab se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke unhon ne kaha: Tabuk ke saal mein Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne logon se khitab kiya jabke unhon ne apni peeth khajoor ke darakht se lagayi hui thi, aur farmaya: Kya main tumhein behtareen logon aur badtareen logon ke baare mein na bataun? Behtareen logon mein se woh aadmi hai jo Allah ki rah mein ghore par, ya oont par, ya paidal jihad karta hai yahan tak ke usay maut aa jaye. Aur badtareen logon mein se woh fajir aadmi hai jo Allah ki Kitab parhta hai lekin us mein se kisi cheez se baaz nahin aata."
"990","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Chori mein badtareen log woh hain jo apni namaz mein se chori karte hain."
"991","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Zayd se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, Abu Said al-Khudri aur Abu Hurayrah se, un donon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aag se nikalne wale aakhri do aadmi honge. Allah Azza wa Jalla un mein se ek se farmayega: Ae ibn-e-Adam, tune is Din ke liye kya tayyari ki? Kya tune koi neki ki ya mujh se ummeed rakhi? Woh kahega: Nahin, ae mere Rab. Phir use Aag ka hukm diya jayega, aur woh Jahannam walon mein sab se zyada nadim hoga. Aur woh doosre se farmayega: Ae ibn-e-Adam, tune is Din ke liye kya tayyari ki? Kya tune koi neki ki ya mujh se ummeed rakhi? Woh kahega: Haan, ae mere Rab; mujhe ummeed thi ke jab Tu mujhe is se nikalega to mujhe is mein wapas nahin lautayega. Phir us ke liye ek darakht zahir kiya jayega aur woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe is darakht ke neeche thehra de taake main us ke saye mein saya hasil karun, us ke phal se khaun, aur us ke pani se piyun; aur woh us se ahd karega ke us se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangega. Pas woh use us ke qareeb kar dega. Phir us ke liye pehle se behtar aur pani mein zyada ek darakht zahir kiya jayega, aur woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, bas yehi — main tujh se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangunga. Mujhe us ke neeche thehra de taake main us ke saye mein saya hasil karun, us ke phal se khaun, aur us ke pani se piyun. Woh farmayega: Ae ibn-e-Adam, kya tune mujh se ahd nahin kiya tha ke mujh se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangega? Woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, bas yehi — main tujh se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangunga. Pas woh use us ke neeche thehra dega, aur woh us se ahd karega ke us se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangega. Phir us ke liye Jannat ke darwaze par ek darakht zahir kiya jayega, jo pehle donon se behtar aur kasrat wala hoga, aur woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, main tujh se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangunga; mujhe us ke saye mein us ke neeche thehra de aur main us ke pani se piyunga. Woh farmayega: Ae ibn-e-Adam, kya tune mujh se ahd nahin kiya tha ke mujh se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangega? Woh kahega: Ae mere Rab, main tujh se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangunga. Pas use us ke neeche thehra diya jayega, aur woh us se ahd karega ke us se us ke siwa kuch aur nahin mangega. Phir woh Ahl-e-Jannat ki awazein sunega aur apne aap par qaboo na rakh sakega, kehte hue: Ae mere Rab, mujhe Jannat mein dakhil farma. Phir Allah Tabarak wa Taala farmayega: Mang aur tamanna kar. Pas woh mangega aur tamanna karega, aur Allah use aisi cheezein yaad dilayega jin ka use ilm na tha. Woh duniya ke dinon mein se teen din ke barabar mangega aur tamanna karega, aur woh farmayega: Ae ibn-e-Adam, jo tune manga woh tera hai. Abu Said al-Khudri ne kaha: Aur us ke sath us jaisa aur; aur Abu Hurayrah ne kaha: Aur us ke sath us jaisa das guna. Phir un mein se ek ne apne sathi se kaha: Jo tune suna woh bayan kar, aur jo main ne suna woh main bayan karunga."
"992","Zayd ibn Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, Layth ibn Sad se, Bukayr ibn Abd Allah ibn al-Ashajj se, Iyad ibn Abd Allah se, Abu Said se: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein ek aadmi ne phal khareede aur un mein nuqsan uthaya, aur us par qarz lazim ho gaya. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai par sadqa karo. Pas unhon ne us par sadqa kiya, lekin woh us ke qarz ki adayegi ke liye kafi na hua. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Jo pao le lo, aur tumhare liye us ke siwa kuch nahin."
"993","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Sasah se, un ke walid se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Ae mere bete, main dekhta hun ke tum bakriyon se mohabbat karte ho aur unhein rakhte ho, to un ki achhi dekh bhal karo aur un ke naak ki reeth ki dekh bhal karo. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Logon par ek zamanah qareeb aayega jab bakriyan Musalman ka behtareen maal hongi, jin ke sath woh paharon ki chotiyon aur barish barasne ki jaghon ke peeche jayega, fitnon se apne deen ko lekar bhagte hue."
"994","Muhammad ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhib ne hum se bayan kiya, Kathir ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Ghatfani ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Thawban se, Abu Said al-Khudri se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasul, us ke baare mein aap kya farmate hain jo mujhe mera maal lene ke irade se mile? Unhon ne farmaya: Use Allah ka wasta dekar teen martaba samjhao; agar woh inkar kare, to us se lado. Agar woh tumhein qatl kar de, to tum Jannat mein dakhil hoge, aur agar tum use qatl kar do, to woh Aag mein jayega."
"995","Sulayman ibn Harb ne mujhe bayan kiya, Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sad ibn Ibrahim se, Abu Umamah se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Banu Qurayzah Sad ke faisle par utar aaye, to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein bulaya, aur woh qareeb hi thay, to woh gadhe par aaye. Jab woh qareeb aaye, to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne sardar ke liye kharay ho jao. Woh aaye aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pehlu mein baith gaye, aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Ye log tumhare faisle par utar aaye hain. Unhon ne kaha: Pas main faisla karta hun ke larnay walon ko qatl kiya jaye aur aulad ko qaid kiya jaye. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne un ke baare mein Badshah ke faisle ke sath faisla kiya hai."
"996","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Sadaqah ibn Musa al-Sulami se, Malik ibn Dinar se, Abd Allah ibn Ghalib se, Abu Said se, ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Do khaslatein momin mein kabhi jama nahin hotin: bakhl aur bad-akhlaqi."
"997","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Sasah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said ne mujh se kaha: Ae mere bete, jab tum in bayabanon mein ho, to azan buland awaz se kaho, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Koi insan, na jinn, na pathar, na darakht use sunta hai magar woh us ke liye gawahi dega."
"998","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Ubayd Allah ibn al-Mughirah ibn Muayqib se, Amr ibn Sulaym se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah, main tujh se ek ahd leta hun jise Tu Qayamat ke din mere liye poora farmayega; beshak Tu wada khilafi nahin karta. Main sirf ek insan hun, pas jis Musalman ko main ne takleef di, ya bura kaha, ya — unhon ne kaha — mara, ya lanat ki, use us ke liye dua bana de, use us ke liye taharat bana de, aur qurb ka zariya bana de jis se Tu use Qayamat ke din apne qareeb kare."
"999","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Hubab ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Shurayh ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hani ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Ali se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Said ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahe: Main Allah ke Rab hone par, Islam ke deen hone par, aur Muhammad ke Rasul hone par razi hun, us ke liye Jannat wajib ho jati hai."
"1000","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nadrah se, Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mubarak hai woh jis ne mujhe dekha, aur woh jis ne mujhe dekhne wale ko dekha, aur woh jis ne mujhe dekhne wale ko dekhne wale ko dekha."
"1001","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne bayan kiya, Hammam se, woh Qatadah se, woh Abu Isa al-Uswari se, woh Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bimaron ki iyadat karo aur janaze ke sath chalo; ye tumhein Akhirat ki yaad dilate hain."
"1002","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Sinan se, woh Abu al-Mubarak se, woh Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Said al-Khudri ne kaha: Miskeenon se muhabbat karo, kyunki main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko apni dua mein yun kehte hue suna: Aye Allah, mujhe miskeen ki halat mein zinda rakh, miskeen ki halat mein wafat de, aur miskeenon ki jamaat mein mera hashr farma."
"1003","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Sinan se, woh Abu al-Mubarak se, woh Ata se, woh Abu Said se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us shakhs ka Quran par iman nahi jo is ki haram kardah cheezon ko halal samjhe."
"1004","Hamein Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Usamah ibn Zayd se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir se: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Yawm al-Nahr ko Jamrah ko kankariyan maren, phir log baith gaye. Ek aadmi Aap ke pas aaya aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main ne qurbani se pehle sar mundwa liya. Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi. Phir dusra shakhs Aap ke pas aaya aur kaha: Main ne rami se pehle sar mundwa liya. Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Aap se jis cheez ke bare mein bhi pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi. Phir Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tamam Arafah mauqif hai, tamam Muzdalifah mauqif hai, tamam Mina qurbangah hai, aur Makkah ke tamam ghati raste aur qurbangah hain."
"1005","Hamein Zakariyya ibn Adi ne khabar di, hamein Ubayd Allah ibn Amr ne khabar di, Abd al-Karim se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir se ke ek aadmi ne apne ghulam ko apni maut ke baad azad hone ki tadbeer ki, phir us ka malik muhtaj ho gaya to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne use bechne ka hukm diya. Us ne use aath sau dirham mein bech diya, aur Aap ne farmaya: Ise apne ahl o ayal par kharch karo, kyunki sadqah to sirf maal e fazil se hota hai, aur ibtida un se karo jin ki kifalat tum par hai."
"1006","Hamein Ubayd Allah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Abi Layla se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ka hath pakda aur unhein khajoor ke darakhton ki taraf le gaye, jahan un ke bete Ibrahim apni walidah ki god mein aakhiri saansen le rahe the. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne unhein le kar apni god mein rakh liya, phir farmaya: Aye Ibrahim, hum Allah ke muqable mein tumhare liye kuch kaam nahi aa sakte. Phir Aap ki aankhon se aansu beh nikle. Abd al-Rahman ibn Awf ne Aap se arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya Aap ro rahe hain? Kya Aap ne rone se mana nahi farmaya tha? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke main ne noha karne se mana kiya hai, aur do ahmaqana, fajirana awazon se: lahu o la'b ke naghme par uthne wali awaz aur shaitan ke baajon ki awaz, aur musibat ke waqt ki awaz: chehre nochna, kapde phadna, aur shaitan ki cheekh o pukar. Ye rehmat hai, aur jo reham nahi karta us par reham nahi kiya jata. Aye Ibrahim, agar ye ek barhaq mamla, sachcha wada, laaziman tay kiya jane wala rasta, aur hamare baad walon ka hamare pehle walon se mil jana na hota to hum tum par is se sakht gham karte. Hum bila shuba tum par ghamgeen hain: aankh roti hai aur dil ghamgeen hai, lekin hum woh baat nahi kehte jo Rab Azza wa Jalla ko naraz kare."
"1007","Mujhe Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Kathir ibn Shinzhir se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir ibn Abd Allah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke sath ek safar mein tha, aur Aap ne mujhe kisi kaam se bheja. Main aaya aur Aap ko salam kiya to Aap ne mera salam ka jawab na diya. Kuch der baad Aap ne mujhe jawab diya, farmate hue: Mujhe tumhare salam ka jawab dene se sirf is baat ne roka ke main namaz padh raha tha. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ka chehra qiblah se phira hua tha."
"1008","Hamein Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd al-Munim ibn Nuaym ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Muslim se, woh al-Hasan aur Ata se, woh Jabir ibn Abd Allah se ke Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Bilal se farmaya: Aye Bilal, jab tum adhan kaho to theher theher kar kaho, aur jab iqamah kaho to jaldi karo. Apni adhan aur iqamah ke darmiyan itna waqfa rakho ke khane wala apna khana khatam kar le, peene wala apna peena khatam kar le, aur qaza e hajat karne wala apni hajat se farigh ho jaye. Aur jab tak mujhe na dekh lo khade na ho."
"1009","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, Habib al-Muallim se, woh Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, woh Jabir ibn Abd Allah se ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main ne nazr mani thi ke agar Allah Aap ko Makkah ki fath ata farmaye to main Bayt al-Maqdis mein namaz padhunga. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahan namaz padh lo. Us aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se ek ya do martaba phir wohi baat dohrai, aur jab us ne israr kiya to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Phir jaise chahe karo."
"1010","Hamein Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ki baali jaisi hai jise hawa jhukati rehti hai, kabhi gir jati hai aur kabhi seedhi khadi ho jati hai; aur kafir ki misaal deodar ke darakht jaisi hai jo seedha khada rehta hai yahan tak ke ek hi baar mein ukhad diya jata hai."
"1011","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Koi Musalman aisa nahi jo koi pauda lagaye magar us ke liye sadqah shumar hota hai, jo kuch us se khaya jaye, jo kuch us se churaya jaye, jo parinde us se khayen, aur jo janwar us se khayen."
"1012","Mujhe Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd Allah ibn Numayr ne bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik se, woh Ata se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke zamane mein us din suraj grahan hua jis din Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke bete Ibrahim ki wafat hui. Logon ne kaha: Suraj sirf Ibrahim ki maut ki wajah se grahan hua hai. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam khade hue aur logon ko namaz padhai: chhe ruku chaar sajdon ke sath. Aap ne ibtida ki, Allahu Akbar kaha, phir qirat ki aur qirat ko tawil kiya, phir ruku kiya taqreeban utni der jitni der qiyam kiya tha, phir ruku se sar uthaya aur pehli qirat se kam ek qirat ki, phir ruku kiya taqreeban utni der jitni der qiyam kiya tha, phir ruku se sar uthaya aur dusri qirat se kam qirat ki, phir ruku kiya taqreeban utni der jitni der qiyam kiya tha, phir ruku se sar uthaya, phir sajde mein gaye aur do sajde kiye. Phir khade hue aur phir bhi teen ruku kiye, un mein se koi ruku aisa na tha magar us se pehle wala us ke baad wale se lamba tha, aur Aap ka ruku taqreeban Aap ke sajde ke barabar tha. Phir Aap peeche hate, aur Aap ke peeche ki safen bhi peeche hatin yahan tak ke Aap khawateen tak pahunch gaye. Phir Aap aage badhe, aur log bhi Aap ke sath aage badhe yahan tak ke Aap apni jagah par khade ho gaye. Aap ne namaz khatam ki jab khatam ki aur suraj roshan ho chuka tha. Aap ne farmaya: Aye logo, suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain, aur ye kisi insan ki maut ki wajah se grahan nahi hote. Jab tum is mein se kuch dekho to us waqt tak namaz padhte raho jab tak ye saaf na ho jaye. Tum se jo wada kiya gaya hai us mein se koi cheez aisi nahi jo main ne apni is namaz mein na dekhi ho. Jahannum layi gayi, aur yehi woh mauqa tha jab tum ne mujhe peeche hat-te dekha, is dar se ke kahin us ki lapak mujhe na aa lage. Main ne us mein aankde wali lathi wale aadmi ko bhi dekha jo apni anten Jahannum mein ghasit raha tha; woh apni aankde wali lathi se hajiyon ka saman churata tha — agar use dekh liya jata to kehta: Ye to sirf meri lathi mein atak gaya tha, aur agar use khabar na hoti to use le jata. Main ne us mein us billi wali aurat ko bhi dekha jis ne billi ko bandh kar rakha tha: na us ne use khilaya aur na use chhoda ke zameen ke keede makodon se kha le yahan tak ke woh bhook se mar gayi. Phir Jannat layi gayi, aur yehi woh mauqa tha jab tum ne mujhe aage badhte dekha yahan tak ke main apni jagah par khada ho gaya. Main ne apna hath badhaya, irada kiya ke us ke phalon mein se kuch le kar tumhein dikhaun, phir mere dil mein khayal aaya ke aisa na karun. Tum se jo wada kiya gaya hai us mein se koi cheez aisi nahi jo main ne apni is namaz mein na dekhi ho."
"1013","Hamein Musab ibn Miqdam al-Khathami aur Abu Nuaym ne khabar di, kehte hain: hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Amash se, woh Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har banda usi halat par uthaya jayega jis par woh faut hua tha."
"1014","Hamein Yala ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazon ki misaal tum mein se kisi ke darwaze par behne wali meethi neher jaisi hai jis se woh har din paanch martaba ghusl karta hai."
"1015","Hamein Yala ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko un ki wafat se teen din pehle yun farmate hue suna: Tum mein se koi shakhs is hal ke siwa na mare ke woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ke bare mein husn e zann rakhta ho."
"1016","Hamein Yala ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se pucha: Kaun si namaz afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Lamba qiyam wali namaz."
"1017","Hamein Yala ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs dare ke woh raat ke aakhir mein bedar nahi ho sakega to woh raat ke shuru mein Witr padh kar so jaye; aur jo shakhs umeed rakhe ke woh raat ke aakhir mein bedar ho jayega to woh raat ke aakhir mein Witr padhe, kyunki raat ke aakhir ki qirat mein farishte hazir hote hain, aur yehi afzal hai."
"1018","Hamein Yala aur Muhammad ibnay Ubayd ne bayan kiya, kehte hain: hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ubayy ibn Kab bimar hue to Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne un ke pas ek tabeeb bheja, jis ne un ke baazu ki darmiyani rag par daagh lagaya."
"1019","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Amash ne bayan kiya, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar main zinda raha, In shaa Allah, to main apni ummat ko hukm dunga — ya mana karunga — ke koi Nafi, Aflah ya Barakah naam na rakhe. Al-Amash ne kaha: Mujhe maloom nahi ke unhon ne Nafi ka zikr kiya tha ya nahi, kyunki jab koi aadmi aa kar kehta hai: Kya yahan Barakah hai? To log kehte hain: Nahi hai."
"1020","Hamein Jafar ibn Awn ne khabar di, hamein al-Amash ne khabar di, Abu Sufyan se, woh Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon par ek waqt zaroor aayega jab ek lashkar niklega aur mere Sahaba mein se kisi aadmi ko talash kiya jayega. Kaha jayega: Kya tum mein Muhammad ke Sahaba mein se koi shakhs maujood hai? Woh kahenge: Haan, to woh us ke waseele se fath talab karenge aur unhein fath ata ki jayegi. Phir logon par ek waqt aayega jab ek lashkar niklega aur kaha jayega: Kya tum mein Muhammad ke Sahaba mein se koi hai? Woh use talash karenge lekin use na payenge. Phir kaha jayega: Kya tum mein koi aisa hai jis ne Muhammad ke Sahaba mein se kisi ko dekha ho? Woh use talash karenge lekin use na payenge. Agar mere Sahaba mein se koi aadmi samandar ke paar bhi hota to woh zaroor us tak pahunchte."
"1021","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Mamar ne hamein khabar di, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Humaid al-Ansari Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas doodh ka ek pyala lekar aaye, use khula hua uthaye hue thay. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum ne ise kyun na dhanka, chahe ek lakdi hi is par aar paar rakh kar."
"1022","Ubaid Allah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan se, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Iman aur kufr ke darmiyan namaz ko tark karna hai."
"1023","Ubaid Allah ibn Musa ne hum se riwayat ki, Sufyan se, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se: Bukhar Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas hazir hone ki ijazat mangne aaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum kaun ho. Us ne kaha: Main Umm Mildam hun. Unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum Quba walon ko janti ho. Us ne kaha: Ji han. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir un ke paas jao. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se shikayat ki, aur unhon ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to main Allah, Woh Buland hai, se dua karunga ke Woh ise tum se door kar de, aur agar tum chaho to yeh tumhare liye taharat ka sabab hogi. Unhon ne kaha: Balke yeh hamare liye taharat ka sabab ho."
"1024","Abd al-Rahim ibn Abd al-Rahman al-Muharibi ne hum se riwayat ki, Zaidah se, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs aaya jabke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba de rahe thay, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use do rakatein mukhtasar karke parhne ka hukm diya. Main ne Sulaiman se kaha: Kya Jumuah ke din. Unhon ne kaha: Ji han."
"1025","Muhadir ibn al-Muwarra ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: al-Amash ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar ke ek mard ke han larka paida hua aur us ne us ka naam Muhammad rakha. Unhon ne kaha: Hum tumhe Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke naam par nahi pukareinge jab tak hum un se mashwara na kar lein. Woh un ke paas gaye aur unhe paya ke woh ghore se lakri par gir pare thay aur un ka paon kuchal gaya tha. Unhon ne unhe Aishah ke ek bala khane me paya. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum falan falan ke bare me mujh se puchne aaye ho. Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunyat ikhtiyar na karo. Unhon ne kaha: Aur tum ne Qayamat ka zikr kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Woh bat raste me chhir gayi thi. Unhon ne farmaya: Koi zinda jaan aisi nahi jis par sau baras guzrein."
"1026","Muhadir ne mujh se riwayat ki, al-Amash ne hum se riwayat ki, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Nabi, main bichhu ke dank ke liye dam kiya karta tha, lekin aap ne ise mana kar diya. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum me se jo apne bhai ko faida pahuncha sakta ho, use faida pahunchaye."
"1027","Muhadir ne mujh se riwayat ki, al-Amash ne riwayat ki, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya jabke hum safar me thay: Beshak Madinah me aise mard hain, tum koi wadi ubur nahi karte aur na koi rasta tay karte ho magar woh tumhare sath hain; bimari ne unhe tum se rok rakha hai."
"1028","Ibrahim ibn al-Ashath ne mujh se riwayat ki, al-Fudayl ibn Iyad ne riwayat ki, Sulaiman se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se: Hum Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek safar me thay jab ek badbudar hawa chali, to Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Munafiqon ki ek jamaat ne musalmanon me se kuch ki ghibat ki, aur isi wajah se yeh hawa bheji gayi; aur shayad unhon ne farmaya: isi wajah se yeh hawa chali hai."
"1029","Ibrahim ibn al-Ashath ne riwayat ki, Fudayl ibn Iyad ne riwayat ki, Sulaiman se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se: Hum Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek safar me thay jab ek hawa chali jo sawar ko taqriban dafn karne lagi, to Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Yeh hawa ek munafiq ki maut ke liye bheji gayi hai. Jab hum Madinah wapas aaye to hum ne paya ke usi din ek sakht munafiq munafiq mar gaya tha, aur baad me main ne apne sathiyon ko kehte suna ke woh Rafi ibn al-Tabut tha."
"1030","Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne riwayat ki, Sufyan ne riwayat ki, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se unhon ne farmaya: Jannat wale khayenge aur piyenge, aur na peshab karenge, na pakhana karenge, na naak saaf karenge, na thukenge; un ke khane ke baad dakar aur mushk ke paseene jaisa paseena aayega; us me unhe Allah ki tasbih aur takbir is tarah ilham ki jayegi jis tarah unhe sans lena ilham hota hai."
"1031","Ibn Abi Shaibah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Waki ne riwayat ki, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, main ne khwab me dekha goya mera sar kat gaya hai. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hanse aur farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi se us ki neend me khela jaye to use logon se bayan na kare."
"1032","Ibn Abi Shaibah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abu Muawiyah ne riwayat ki, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab muazzin azan kehta hai to shaitan bhagta hai yahan tak ke woh al-Rawha me hota hai, jo Madinah se tees meel door hai."
"1033","Ibn Abi Shaibah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Abu Muawiyah ne riwayat ki, al-Amash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Iblis apna takht pani par bichhata hai, phir woh apne dastay bhejta hai; un me se martabe me us ke qareeb tar woh hai jo fitne me sab se bara hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Un me se ek us ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Main ne falan falan kiya, aur woh kehta hai: Tum ne kuch nahi kiya. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir un me se ek us ke paas aata hai aur kehta hai: Main ne use na chhora yahan tak ke main ne use us ki biwi se juda kar diya, aur woh kehta hai: Tum khoob ho, aur use apne qareeb kar leta hai."
"1034","Husayn ibn Ali al-Jufi ne riwayat ki, Zaidah se, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Bakr se farmaya: Tum witr kab parhte ho. Unhon ne kaha: Isha ki namaz ke baad sone se pehle. Aur unhon ne Umar se farmaya: Tum witr kab parhte ho. Unhon ne kaha: Raat ke akhri hisse me. Unhon ne farmaya: Ek ne ehtiyat ikhtiyar ki aur ek ne quwwat ka izhar kiya. Al-Husayn ne kaha: Unhon ne ehtiyat ko apnaya."
"1035","Abu Nuaym ne riwayat ki, Sufyan ne riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Muhammad se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Maghrib parha karte thay, phir hum apne gharon ko wapas jate jo ek meel door thay, jabke hum teeron ke girne ki jaghein dekh sakte thay."
"1036","Zakariyya ibn Adi ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ubaidullah ibn Amr ne riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Jabir se: Jabke hum Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Zuhr ya Asr ki namaz me apni safon me thay, Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne namaz me hote hue koi cheez lene ka irada kiya, phir woh peeche hate, to log peeche hate. Jab woh farigh hue to Ubayy ibn Kab ne un se pucha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, aap ne namaz me kuch aisa kiya jo aap pehle nahi kiya karte thay. Unhon ne farmaya: Mujh par Jannat pesh ki gayi us ke husn samait jo us me hai, aur main ne us me se anguron ka ek khosha tumhare liye lane ko haath barhaya, lekin mujhe us se rok diya gaya; agar main use tumhare liye le aata to aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan wale us me se khate baghair use kam kiye. Phir mujh par Jahannum pesh ki gayi, aur jab main ne us ki tapish mehsoos ki to main us se peeche hata. Jinhe main ne us me dekha un me aksar aurtein thin jo, agar amanat sonpi jaye to zaahir kar deti hain, agar mangti hain to chipat kar mangti hain, aur agar un se manga jaye to rok leti hain. Aur main ne us me Luhayy ibn Amr ko dekha jo Jahannum me apni antein ghaseet raha tha; aur jise main ne us se sab se zyada mushabeh dekha woh Mabad ibn Aktham al-Kabi tha. Mabad ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, kya meri us se mushabehat ki wajah se mere liye darr hai, jabke woh mera baap hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Nahi, tum momin ho aur woh kafir hai. Luhayy sab se pehla tha jis ne Arbon ko buton ki ibadat ki taraf lagaya."
"1037","Musa ibn Masud ne mujh se riwayat ki, Zuhayr ibn Muhammad ne riwayat ki, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se: Ek shakhs Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Falan shakhs ka mere bagh me khajur ka ek tana hai, aur us ne mujhe nuqsan pahunchaya hai aur us ki jagah mere liye takleef ban gayi hai. To Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use bulwaya aur farmaya: Apna khajur ka tana jo falan ke bagh me hai mujhe bech do. Us ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir use mujhe tohfe me de do. Us ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir use mujhe Jannat me khajur ke ek tane ke badle bech do. Us ne kaha: Nahi. To Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tum se zyada bakhil koi insan nahi dekha siwaye us ke jo salam me bakhl karta hai."
"1038","Ibn Abi Shaibah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Husayn ibn Ali ne riwayat ki, Zaidah se, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Jabir se, jo Ibn Abdullah hain, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ai Umar, logon me elan karo ke jo shakhs dil se ikhlas ke sath Allah ki ibadat karte hue marega, Woh use Jannat me dakhil karega, ya Woh us par Jahannum haram karega. To Umar ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, phir woh is par bharosa kar lenge."
"1039","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ibn Uyaynah ne riwayat ki, Muhammad ibn Ali al-Sulami se, Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ai Jabir, kya tum jante ho ke Allah, Aziz o Jalil, ne tumhare walid ko zinda kiya aur un se farmaya: Mujh se jo chaho mango. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe duniya me wapas lotaya jaye taake main ek baar phir qatl kiya jaun. Unhon ne farmaya: Main faisla kar chuka hun ke woh wapas nahi lotenge."
"1040","Husayn ibn Ali al-Jufi ne riwayat ki, Zaidah se, Layth se unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujh se riwayat ki, Jabir ibn Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us waqt tak nahi sote thay jab tak Alif Lam Mim, Surah al-Sajdah ki tanzil, aur Tabarakallazi biyadihil mulk na parh lete."
"1041","Abu Asim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Abu al-Zubair ne mujhe bayan kiya, Jabir se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shakhs na mare magar is haal mein ke Allah ke baare mein husn-e-zan rakhta ho."
"1042","Abu Asim ne khabar di, Ibn Juraij se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Abu al-Zubair ne mujhe khabar di ke unhone Jabir ibn Abdullah ko yeh kehte hue suna: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) A'ishah ke paas tashreef laye jabke woh ro rahi thin, aur farmaya: Tumhein kya hua hai ke tum ro rahi ho? Unhone kaha: Main is liye ro rahi hun ke log ihram se halal ho gaye aur main halal nahi hui, aur unhone Baitullah ka tawaf kar liya aur maine nahi kiya, aur yeh Hajj jaisa ke aap dekh rahe hain aa gaya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ek aisa mu'amala hai jo Allah ne Adam ki betiyon par muqaddar farma diya hai, pas ghusl karo aur Hajj ka ihram bandh lo aur jo kuch haji karta hai woh karo siwaye is ke ke tum Baitullah ka tawaf na karo, na namaz padho. Pas unhone aisa hi kiya, aur jab woh paak ho gayin to Aap ne farmaya: Baitullah ka tawaf karo aur al-Safa aur al-Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i karo. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum apne Hajj aur apne Umrah se halal ho gayi. Unhone kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, mere dil mein apne Umrah ke baare mein khalish hai ke maine jab Hajj kiya to tawaf nahi kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Aye Abd al-Rahman, ise le jao aur iske saath al-Tan'im se Umrah karao."
"1043","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Umar ibn Zaid ne khabar di, unhone kaha: Abu al-Zubair ne mujhe khabar di ke unhone Jabir ibn Abdullah ko yeh kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bande aur kufr ke darmiyan, ya farmaya: shirk ke darmiyan, sirf farz namaz ka tark karna haail hai."
"1044","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Umar ibn Zaid al-San'ani ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair ne mujhe bayan kiya ke unhone Jabir ibn Abdullah ko yeh kehte hue suna: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne billi khane aur uski qeemat khane se mana farmaya."
"1045","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Lais ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Mujh par anbiya pesh kiye gaye: Musa dubla-patla jism wale shakhs the goya ke woh Azd Shanu'ah ke mardon mein se ek hain; aur maine Isa ibn Maryam ko dekha, aur jin ko maine unse sab se zyada mushabeh dekha woh Urwah ibn Mas'ud the; aur maine Ibrahim ko dekha, aur jin ko maine unse sab se zyada mushabeh dekha woh tumhare sahab the, ya'ni apni zaat muraad li; aur maine Jibril ko dekha, aur jin ko maine unse sab se zyada mushabeh dekha woh Dihyah the."
"1046","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Lais ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mujhe khwab mein dekha to usne haqeeqatan mujhe hi dekha, kyunke shaitan ke liye munasib nahi ke woh meri soorat ikhtiyar kare. Aur Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khwab dekhe to logon ko na bataye ke shaitan khwab mein uske saath khela hai."
"1047","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujhe bayan kiya, Lais ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khwab dekhe jise woh na-pasand karta ho to apne bayen janib teen martaba thuthkare, teen martaba shaitan se Allah ki panah mange, aur jis pehlu par tha usse palat jaye."
"1048","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujhe bayan kiya, Lais ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Sulayk al-Ghatafani Jumu'ah ke din aaye jabke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mimbar par the, aur Sulayk namaz padhe baghair baith gaye, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unse farmaya: Kya tumne do rak'atein padhi hain? Unhone kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho aur woh do rak'atein padho."
"1049","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne mujhe bayan kiya, Lais ibn Sa'd ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Sawari ke oonton ko jis behtareen maqsad ke liye kasa jata hai woh meri yeh masjid aur Bait al-Atiq hai."
"1050","Abu Nu'aim ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, Jabir se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jiska imam ho to imam ki qiraat uski qiraat hai."
"1051","Abu Nu'aim ne bayan kiya, al-Umari ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein ek hi kapde mein lipta hua namaz padhayi."
"1052","Yahya ibn Abd al-Hamid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Shu'aib al-Himmani ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aadmi namaz hi mein rehta hai jab tak woh namaz ka intezar karta hai."
"1053","Ubaidullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Isma'il ibn Abd al-Malik se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath ek safar par nikla, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) qaza-e-hajat ke liye na jate yahan tak ke aankhon se ojhal ho jate aur dikhai na dete. Hum ek bayaban zameen mein utre jahan na koi darakht tha na koi nishan, to Aap ne farmaya: Aye Jabir, apni mashkeezah mein pani dalo phir hamare saath chalo. Unhone kaha: Pas hum chale yahan tak ke dikhai na dete the, jab wahan do darakht the jin ke darmiyan chaar haath ka fasla tha. Aap ne farmaya: Aye Jabir, is darakht ke paas jao aur kaho: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumse kehte hain: Apne saathi se ja milo taake main tum dono ke peeche baith sakun. Pas woh usse ja mila, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un dono ke peeche baith gaye; phir woh apni jagahon par wapas chale gaye. Phir hum Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath sawar hue, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare darmiyan the goya ke parinde hum par saya kiye hue the. Ek aurat ek ladke ke saath Aap se mili aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, mera yeh beta rozana teen martaba shaitan ke daure mein mubtala hota hai. Aap uske liye ruk gaye, phir ladke ko liya aur use apne aur kajawe ke agle hisse ke darmiyan bithaya, phir farmaya: Nikal ja Allah ke dushman, main Allah ka Rasul hun, teen martaba, phir use uski maa ko wapas kar diya. Jab hum apna safar mukammal karke us jagah se guzre to woh aurat apne ladke ke saath aur do mendhe hankte hue hamein mili aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, meri taraf se yeh hadiya qubool farmaiye, pas us Zaat ki qasam Jis ne Aap ko haqq ke saath bheja hai, uske baad use yeh daura dobara nahi hua. Aap ne farmaya: Usse ek le lo aur dusra use wapas kar do. Unhone kaha: Phir hum Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar karte rahe jabke Aap hamare darmiyan the goya ke parinde hum par saya kiye hue the, jab ek bhata hua oont namudar hua yahan tak ke jab woh do safon ke darmiyan aaya to sajde mein gir gaya. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baith gaye, phir logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Is oont ka malik kaun hai? Ansar ke kuch naujawan aage aaye aur kaha: Yeh hamara hai, Ya Rasul Allah. Aap ne farmaya: Iska kya haal hai? Unhone kaha: Hum isse bees saal se pani bharne ka kaam lete rahe hain, aur is par thodi charbi thi, to humne chaha ke ise zibah karke apne bachchon mein taqseem kar dein, lekin yeh humse bhaag gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ise mere haath bechoge? Unhone kaha: Nahi, balke yeh Aap hi ka hai, Ya Rasul Allah. Aap ne farmaya: Mere zimme hai, iske saath achha sulook karo yahan tak ke iski ajal aa jaye. Musalmanon ne us par kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, phir to hum janwaron se zyada sajda karne ke haqdar hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kisi cheez ko sajda karna jayez nahi; agar aisa hota to main auraton ko hukm deta ke woh apne shoharon ko sajda karein."
"1054","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Ibn Lahi'ah ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke unhone Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko yeh farmate hue suna: Aadmi usi ke saath hai jis se woh mohabbat karta hai."
"1055","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Ibn Lahi'ah ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko yeh farmate hue suna: Har bande ki bad-shuguni uski gardan par hai."
"1056","Al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, Ibn Lahi'ah ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: In na'lain ko kasrat se pehno, kyunke tum mein se koi jab tak na'lain pehne rehta hai goya sawar rehta hai."
"1057","Yahya ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Ibn Lahi'ah ne khabar di, Abu al-Zubair se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Maine Jabir ibn Abdullah ko ghazwah Tabuk se wapas aane ke baad yeh kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Madinah mein kuch log hain, tum koi musafat tay nahi karte aur na kisi wadi ko uboor karte magar woh tumhare saath the; unhein beemari ne rok rakha tha."
"1058","Ubaidullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Kuch log jinke ghar masjid se door the unhone iski shikayat Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ki, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unse farmaya: Apni jagah hi par raho, kyunke beshak tumhare liye har qadam par ek neki hai."
"1059","Ubaidullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai unhone kaha: Rasul Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne khana bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us par do nap tol liye jayen: bechne wale ka nap aur kharidne wale ka nap."
"1060","Ubaidullah ibn Musa ne khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila se, Abu al-Zubair se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Ek aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, do wajib kar dene wali cheezein kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs is haal mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta ho uske liye Jannat wajib ho jati hai; aur jo shakhs is haal mein mare ke Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek karta ho uske liye Jahannam wajib ho jati hai. Usne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kaunsa Islam sab se afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jiski zaban aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahein. Usne kaha: Kaunsi namaz sab se afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Lamba qiyam. Usne kaha: Kaunsa jihad sab se afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jiska ghoda kaat diya jaye aur jiska khoon baha diya jaye. Usne kaha: Kaunsi hijrat sab se afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh ke tum woh cheezein chhod do jo tumhara Rabb na-pasand karta hai."
"1061","Mujhe Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Hisham al-Dastuwa'i ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr ne bayan kiya, Jabir se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ek aurat ko dekha, phir Zaynab bint Jahsh ke pas dakhil hue aur un se apni hajat puri ki, phir apne Sahaba ki taraf bahar tashrif laye aur un se farmaya: Aurat Shaitan ki surat me samne aati hai aur Shaitan ki surat me peeth pher kar jaati hai, pas jo is ko mehsoos kare to use chahiye ke apni biwi ke pas jaye, pas beshak ye us cheez ko door karta hai jo us ke dil me hai."
"1062","Mujhe Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Hisham al-Dastuwa'i ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr ne bayan kiya, Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo Allah Azza wa Jalla se is haal me mulaqat kare ke us ke saath kisi cheez ko sharik na karta ho to Allah use Jannat me daakhil karega, aur jo us se is haal me mulaqat kare ke us ke saath kisi cheez ko sharik karta ho to wo use Aag me daakhil karega."
"1063","Mujhe Muhammad ibn Munib al-Adani ne bayan kiya, al-Sari ibn Yahya ne khabar di, Hisham se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Maghfirat ki sardar dua seekho: Ae Allah, Tu mera Rabb hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahi, Tune mujhe paida kiya aur main Tera banda hun, aur main Tere ahd aur Tere wade par hun jahaan tak mujh se ho sake, main Tere saath panaah maangta hun us burai se jo maine ki, main Tere saamne Tere nemat ka jo mujh par hai iqraar karta hun aur apne gunaah ka iqraar karta hun, pas mujhe bakhsh de, beshak gunaahon ko Tere siwa koi nahi bakhshta."
"1064","Mujhe Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Kathir ibn Hisham ne bayan kiya, Hisham se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Main bimaar pada jabke mere saath meri saat behnen thin, aur Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere paas daakhil hue aur mere chehre par phoonka to main sehatyaab ho gaya, maine arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Rasul, kya main apni behnon ke liye do tihaai ki wasiyyat na kar dun, Aap ne farmaya: Rok lo, maine arz kiya: Aadha, Aap ne farmaya: Rok lo, phir Aap bahar tashreef le gaye aur mujhe chhor diya, aur farmaya: Ae Jabir, mera khayaal nahi ke tum is bimaari se faut hoge, Allah Azza wa Jalla ne tumhari behnon ke baare me naazil farmaya aur wazaahat farmai, aur un ke liye do tihaai muqarrar kiya, Jabir kaha karte the: Ye aayat mere baare me naazil hui: Wo tum se fatwa maangte hain, kaho: Allah tumhen kalaalah ke baare me fatwa deta hai."
"1065","Mujhe Said ibn Sallam ne bayan kiya, Zakariyya ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr ne bayan kiya, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne ikkis ghazwaat me shirkat farmai."
"1066","Umar ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ko khaane ki dawat di jaye to use qubool kare, phir agar chaahe to khaaye aur agar chaahe to chhor de."
"1067","Umar ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ka luqma gir jaye to use chahiye ke us se takleef deh cheez door kare aur use Shaitan ke liye na chhore, aur apna haath na ponchhe yahaan tak ke use chaat le ya chatwaaye, pas beshak wo nahi jaanta ke us ke khaane ke kis hisse me barkat hai."
"1068","Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne gandna, pyaaz aur lehsan khaane se mana farmaya, Aap ne farmaya: Farishte us cheez se takleef paate hain jis se Aulad-e-Adam takleef paati hai."
"1069","Mujhe Muhammad ibn al-Fadl ne bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Ayyub ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere paas tashreef laaye jab mera ek oont mere liye thaak kar sust ho gaya tha, Aap ne farmaya: Aap ne jo chaaha dua farmai, phir farmaya: Sawaar ho jaao, phir Aap ne use ek chhari se haanka jo Aap ke paas thi, unhon ne kaha: Pas wo uchhal pada, aur Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Thaame raho, unhon ne kaha: Main use Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rokne laga taake Aap ki guftagu sun sakun, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere paas aaye aur farmaya: Kya tum apna oont mujhe farokht karoge ae Jabir, maine kaha: Ji haan, main use aap ko paanch ooqiya me farokht karta hun is shart par ke meri manzil tak pahunchne tak us ka istemaal mere liye hoga, unhon ne kaha: Pas Aap ne meri aamad tak us ka istemaal mujhe ata farmaya, jab main Aap ke paas aaya to Aap ne mujhe paanch ooqiya naqd adaa kiye aur mere liye ek qiraat ka izaafa farmaya, phir us ke baad use mujhe tohfe me waapas ata farma diya."
"1070","Mujhe Salih ibn Abdullah ne bayan kiya, al-Rabi ibn Badr ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek mudd se wuzu farmate the aur ek saa se ghusl farmate the."
"1071","Salih ibn Abdullah ne bayan kiya, al-Rabi ibn Badr ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur Aishah ek hi bartan se ghusl farmate the."
"1072","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Waki ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Har Musalmaan par har saat din me ek din me ghusl hai, aur wo Jumua ka din hai."
"1073","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Hushaym ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Koi mard kisi aurat ke saath raat na guzaare magar ye ke wo us ka shohar ho ya us ka mahram ho."
"1074","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Zakariyya ibn Abi Zaidah ne bayan kiya, Hajjaj se, Abu al-Zubayr aur Ata se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khajoor ke darakhton ki chotiyon par jo hai use nape hue khajooron ke badle farokht karne se mana farmaya."
"1075","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne qabr par gachkaari karne aur us par baithne aur us par imaarat banaane se mana farmaya, aur Sulayman ibn Musa ne kaha: Aur us par likhne se."
"1076","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Qabisah ibn Uqbah ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ibrahim alaihissalam ne Allah Azza wa Jalla ke Ghar ko hurmat waala aur aman waala qaraar diya, aur maine Madinah ko hurmat waala qaraar diya jo us ke do harra ke darmiyaan hai, us ke kaantedar darakht na kaate jaayen aur na us ka shikaar kiya jaaye."
"1077","Umar ibn Sad ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Aban se, Abu Nadrah se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo Jumua ke din wuzu kare to usi par guzaara ho gaya aur baabarkat hai, aur jo ghusl kare to wo zyada afzal hai."
"1078","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, Abu Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, Abu Nadrah se, Jabir se unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek raat bahar tashreef laaye jabke Aap ke Sahaba Aap ka raat ki aakhri namaaz ke liye intezaar kar rahe the, aur farmaya: Log so chuke aur let chuke jabke tum namaaz ka intezaar kar rahe ho, beshak tum namaaz hi me ho jab tak tum us ka intezaar karte ho, agar kamzoron ki kamzori aur boorhon ki umar raseedgi na hoti to main is namaaz ko aadhi raat tak muakkhar kar deta."
"1079","Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Shubah ibn al-Hajjaj ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Muhammad ibn Amr se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam safar me the, wahaan hujoom tha aur ek aadmi tha jis par saaya kiya gaya tha, pas Aap ne us ke baare me poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Wo roza rakhe hue hai, Aap ne farmaya: Safar me roza rakhna neki nahi hai."
"1080","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Mamar ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne sirf har ghair taqseem shuda cheez me shufa saabit farmaya, jab hudood waqe ho jaayen aur raaste tartib de diye jaayen to koi shufa nahi."
"1081","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar ne khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam kisi aise shakhs par namaz-e-janazah nahi parhte the jis par qarz hota. Unhon ne kaha: Ek janazah laya gaya to aap ne pucha: Kya is par qarz hai? Logon ne kaha: Ji han, do dinar. Aap ne farmaya: Apne sathi par tum namaz parh lo. Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Ye qarz mere zimme hai, Ya Rasul Allah. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aap ne us par namaz parhi. Jab Allah ne apne Rasul ko fatah ata farmayi to aap ne farmaya: Main har momin ke liye us ki apni zaat se bhi zyada qareeb hun; jo koi qarz chhor kar jaye to us ki adayigi mere zimme hai, aur jo koi maal chhore to wo us ke warison ke liye hai."
"1082","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ek manzil par utre aur log kantedar darakhton me bikhar gaye un ke niche saya hasil karne ke liye. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apna hathyar ek darakht par latkaya, itne me ek dehati aaya aur aap ki talwar tak pahunch kar use le liya aur use myaan se nikala, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki taraf mutawajjeh hua aur kaha: Mujh se tumhe kaun bachayega? Aap ne farmaya: Allah. Dehati ne do ya teen martaba kaha: Mujh se tumhe kaun bachayega, jabke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam farmate rahe: Allah. Unhon ne kaha: Phir dehati ne talwar myaan me rakh li, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne apne Sahaba ko bulaya aur unhe dehati ke kiye se aagah kiya jabke wo aap ke pehlu me baitha hua tha; aap ne use saza nahi di."
"1083","Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Abd al-Hamid ibn al-Hasan al-Hilali ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ne bayan kiya, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har neki sadqah hai; jo kharch Musalman apni zaat aur apne ahl par karta hai wo us ke liye sadqah likha jata hai; jis cheez se Musalman apni izzat bachata hai wo bhi us ke liye sadqah likhi jati hai; aur jo bhi kharch Musalman karta hai us ka badla Allah ke zimme hai, siwaye imarat par kharch ya nafarmani me kharch ke. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn al-Munkadir se kaha: Un ka ye qaul kya hai: 'Jis se Musalman apni izzat bachata hai'? Unhon ne kaha: Ye ke wo shair aur bad-zaban shakhs ko deta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main sirf itna janta hun ke unhon ne kaha: Khuda-tars. [NISHAN: aakhiri laqab manba me naqis/garbled hai]"
"1084","Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Shu'bah ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas apne walid par qarz ke silsile me aaya to main ne darwaza khatkhataya. Aap ne farmaya: Kaun hai? Main ne kaha: Main. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main, main', goya aap ne ise napasand farmaya."
"1085","Ja'far ibn Awn ne khabar di, Isma'il ibn Muslim ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sote waqt ithmid lagao, kyunke ye nigah ko taqat deta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"1086","Uthman ibn Umar ne khabar di, Abdullah ibn Amir ne khabar di, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya main tumhe tum me se behtareen logon ke baare me na bataun? Tum me se behtareen wo hain jo umr me sab se zyada taweel hon aur amal me sab se behtar hon."
"1087","Abu Nu'aym ne khabar di, aur Abd al-Razzaq ne, Ibn Uyaynah se, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se riwayat hai: Main ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kabhi koi cheez bhi mangi nahi gayi ke aap ne 'Nahi' kaha ho."
"1088","Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghazwa-e-Ahzab ke din mujhe logon ki khabar kaun la kar dega? Al-Zubayr ne kaha: Main. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe logon ki khabar kaun la kar dega? Al-Zubayr ne kaha: Main. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe logon ki khabar kaun la kar dega? Al-Zubayr ne kaha: Main. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har nabi ka ek hawari hota hai, aur beshak mera hawari al-Zubayr hai."
"1089","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi al-Mawal ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir ko Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat karte hue suna ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam hame istikhara is tarah sikhate the jaise hame Qur'an ki koi surat sikhate the, farmate hue: Jab tum me se koi kisi kaam ka iradah kare to farz ke alawah do rak'aten parhe, phir ye kahe: 'Ay Allah, main Tere ilm ke zariye Tujh se khair talab karta hun, Teri qudrat ke zariye Tujh se qudrat talab karta hun, aur Tere fazl-e-'azim ka sawal karta hun; kyunke Tu taqdir farmata hai aur main taqdir nahi karta, Tu janta hai aur main nahi janta, aur Tu ghaibon ka khoob janne wala hai. Ay Allah, agar Tu janta hai ke ye mu'amla - jo cheez us ka iradah ho us ka naam le kar - mere liye mere din, meri ma'ishat aur mere anjam-e-kaar me behtar hai, ya farmaya: mere fauri mu'amle aur baad ke mu'amle me behtar hai, to ise mere liye muqaddar farma de, mere liye aasan farma de, aur is me mujhe barkat ata farma; aur agar Tu janta hai - pehli martaba jo kaha usi tarah kehte hue - aur agar ye bura hai to ise mujh se pher de aur mujhe is se pher de, mere liye khair muqaddar farma de jahan bhi wo ho, phir mujhe us par razi kar de.'"
"1090","Khalid ibn Makhlad ne mujhe bayan kiya, al-Munkadir ne mujhe bayan kiya, apne walid se, Jabir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har neki sadqah hai; nekiyon me se ye bhi hai ke tum apne bhai se khush-ru'i se milo, aur ye ke tum apne dol se apne bhai ke bartan me pani dalo."
"1091","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, Talhah ibn Amr se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Munkadir ne mujhe khabar di, Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah 'Azza wa Jalla ke nazdeek sab se afzal iman Allah par iman, us ke raste me jihad, aur Hajj-e-Mabrur hai. Hum ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Hajj ki maqbuliyat kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Khana khilana aur narm guftagu."
"1092","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne bayan kiya, al-Mufaddal ibn Fadalah ne bayan kiya, Habib ibn al-Shahid se, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ek korhi ka hath pakra aur use apne saath pyale me rakha aur farmaya: Khao, bismillah, Allah par bharosa aur us par tawakkul karte hue."
"1093","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Waki' ne bayan kiya, Usamah ibn Zayd se, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, Jabir se riwayat hai: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah se nafa-bakhsh ilm mango, aur aise ilm se Allah ki panah mango jo nafa na de."
"1094","Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Iyad ne bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Hasan se riwayat hai ke unhon ne un se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko suna: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ek hi kapre me namaz parhi jo aap ne kamar par izar ki tarah lapeta hua tha."
"1095","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah ne bayan kiya, Sulayman al-Yashkuri se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs zamin ke gird diwar bana le wo usi ki hai."
"1096","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Awanah ne bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sulayman ibn Qays se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Muharib Khassafah ki taraf Nakhl me gaye, aur unhon ne Nabi Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ghaflat ka ek mauqa dekha, to un me se Ghawrath ibn al-Harith nami ek shakhs aaya yahan tak ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke sir par talwar liye khada ho gaya aur kaha: Mujh se tumhe kaun bachayega? Aap ne farmaya: Allah. Talwar us ke hath se gir gayi, to Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne talwar le li aur us se farmaya: Mujh se tumhe kaun bachayega? Us ne kaha: Behtareen pakadne wale ban jaiye. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahi? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin main aap se 'ahd karta hun ke na main aap se ladunga aur na aise logon ke saath rahunga jo aap se lade. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aap ne use chhor diya, aur wo apne sathiyon ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main tumhare paas behtareen insaan ke paas se aaya hun. Jab zawaal ya 'asr ka waqt hua - Abu Awanah ko shak hua - to Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne salat al-khawf ka hukm diya. Unhon ne kaha: Log do girohon me the: ek giroh apne dushman ke samne, aur ek giroh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath namaz parh raha tha. Aap ne apne saath wale giroh ke saath do rak'aten parhin, phir wo chale gaye aur un ki jagah le li, aur wo aaye aur Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath do rak'aten parhin. To Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke liye chaar rak'aten huin aur logon ke liye do rak'aten."
"1097","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Awanah ne bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sulayman ibn Qays se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai: Hum ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke saath Hudaybiyah ke din sattar oonton ki qurbani ki, har oont saat afrad ki taraf se."
"1098","Yazid ibn Harun ne khabar di, Shu'bah ne khabar di, Muharib ibn Dithar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ek safar par the aur hum un ke saath the; jab hum Madinah pahunche to Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mujh se farmaya: Ay Jabir, masjid me dakhil ho kar do rak'aten namaz parho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main masjid me aaya aur do rak'aten parhin."
"1099","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Mis'ar ne bayan kiya, Muharib ibn Dithar se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke zimme mera ek qarz tha, to unhon ne mujhe ada kiya aur izafa kar ke diya. Mis'ar ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main chasht ke waqt un ke paas aaya jabke wo masjid me the. Unhon ne farmaya: Jao namaz parho, ya farmaya: do rak'aten parho."
"1100","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, Muharib ibn Dithar ne bayan kiya, Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat hai: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne ek shakhs se ek oont kharida aur use zyada de diya."
"1101","Umar bin Sa'd ne, Sufyan se, unhon ne Muharib bin Dithar se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat kiya: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aadmi ko raat ke waqt apne ahl-e-khana ke paas aane ya un ke aib talash karne se mana farmaya."
"1102","Sa'id bin al-Rabi' ne riwayat kiya, Shu'bah ne riwayat kiya, Muharib bin Dithar se jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ko kehte hue suna: Mu'adh ne apni qaum ke sath Maghrib padhai aur al-Baqarah ya al-Nisa se shuru kiya; ek aadmi aaya jab raat chha chuki thi, apne pani dhone wale oont ke sath, pas us ne oont ko chhora aur un ke sath namaz mein shamil ho gaya; jab us ne dekha ke unhon ne namaz lambi kar di, apne oont ke khauf se us ne akele namaz padhi phir un se pehle chala gaya; us aadmi ko pahunchi ke Mu'adh ne us ke bare mein kaha: Munafiq; pas woh aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur unhen khabar di; Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum fitne mein dalne wale ho? Kya tum fitne mein dalne wale ho? Ya unhon ne kaha: Kya tum fitne mein dalne wale ho? Tum ne kyun na padhi, ya: tilawat ki, Apne Rab ke naam ki tasbeeh karo jo sab se buland hai, Suraj aur us ki roshni ki qasam, aur Raat ki qasam jab woh chha jaye - Shu'bah ne al-Shams ya al-Layl ke bare mein shak kiya, un mein se ek - tumhare peeche budhe, hajatmand aur kamzor namaz padhte hain."
"1103","Muhammad bin Muslim al-Ta'ifi ne, Amr bin Dinar se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat kiya, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch ooqiya se kam mein koi sadaqah nahin, paanch oonton se kam mein koi sadaqah nahin, aur paanch wasq se kam mein koi sadaqah nahin."
"1104","Abu Nu'aym ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Ibn Uyaynah ne riwayat kiya, Amr se: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Hum Hudaybiyah ke din ek hazar char sau the; Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum aaj zameen ke sab se behtareen log ho."
"1105","Muhammad bin al-Fadl ne riwayat kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne riwayat kiya, al-Kalbi se, Abu Salih se, Jabir bin Abdullah bin Ri'ab se: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ayat ke bare mein farmaya: Un ke liye duniya ki zindagi mein khushkhabri hai; Unhon ne farmaya: Woh nek khwab hai jo banda dekhta hai ya jo us ke liye dekha jata hai."
"1106","Sulayman bin Harb ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Ghalib bin Sulayman ne riwayat kiya, Kathir bin Ziyad al-Bursani se, Abu Sumayyah se jinhon ne kaha: Hum ne yahan Basra mein Jahannam par se guzarne ke bare mein ikhtilaf kiya; ek giroh ne kaha: Koi momin is mein dakhil nahin hota, aur dusron ne kaha: Sab us par se guzarte hain; pas main Jabir bin Abdullah se mila aur un se is ke bare mein pucha; Unhon ne kaha: Sab us par se guzarte hain, phir Allah un logon ko nijat deta hai jo us se dare aur zalimon ko us mein ghutnon ke bal gira hua chhor deta hai; Main ne kaha: Hum ne Basra mein is ke bare mein ikhtilaf kiya; ek qaum ne kaha: Koi momin is mein dakhil nahin hota, aur dusron ne kaha: Sab is mein dakhil hote hain; Unhon ne apni do ungliyon se apne kanon ki taraf ishara kiya aur kaha: Yeh behre ho jayen agar main ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh kehte hue na suna ho: Guzarna hi dakhil hona hai; koi nek na bura baqi nahin rehta magar woh is mein dakhil hota hai; woh mominon par thandak aur salamti ban jati hai jaisa ke woh Ibrahim par thi, yahan tak ke Jahannam - ya Aag - ko un ki thandak se shor hota hai; phir Allah un logon ko nijat deta hai jo us se dare aur zalimon ko us mein ghutnon ke bal gira hua chhor deta hai."
"1107","Habban bin Hilal ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Bishr bin al-Mufaddal ne riwayat kiya, Umar bin Abdullah mawla Ghufrah ne riwayat kiya, Ayyub bin Khalid bin Safwan al-Ansari se, Jabir bin Abdullah se jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamari taraf bahar tashreef laye aur farmaya: Beshak Allah, Azza wa Jalla, ke farishton ke dastay hain jo utarte hain aur zameen mein zikr ki majlison par thaharte hain, pas Jannat ke baghon mein charo; Unhon ne kaha: Aur Jannat ke bagh kahan hain? Unhon ne farmaya: Zikr ki majlisen; Allah, Azza wa Jalla, ke zikr mein jao aur aao, aur use tanhai mein yaad karo; jo shakhs Allah ke han apna martaba jan'na chahe, use dekhna chahiye ke us ke han Allah ka martaba kya hai; pas Allah, Azza wa Jalla, bande ko apne han wahan rakhta hai jahan us ne use apne nafs mein rakha hai."
"1108","Yahya bin Ishaq ne mujhe riwayat kiya, jinhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Ayyub ne riwayat kiya, Haram bin Uthman ne riwayat kiya, Jabir ke dono beton se, unhon ne apne walid se jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne hujre ke darwaze par aaye, use salam karna chahiye, kyunke us ke sath us ka shayatin mein se sathi wapas laut jata hai; jab tum apne hujron mein dakhil ho, salam karo, taake us ka shaytani rehne wala nikal jaye; jab tum rawana ho, pehle kapde par Allah ka naam lo jo tum apni sawariyon par rakhte ho taake Shaytan tumhari sawari mein tumhare sath shareek na ho, kyunke agar tum aisa na karo to woh tumhare sath shareek hota hai; jab tum khao, Allah ka naam lo taake woh tumhare khane mein tumhare sath shareek na ho, kyunke agar tum aisa na karo to woh tumhare khane mein tumhare sath shareek hota hai; apne hujron mein kura-karkat raat bhar apne paas na chhoro, kyunke woh us ki nashist hai; apne gharon mein hath ponchhne ka rumal raat bhar apne paas na chhoro, kyunke woh us ka bichhauna hai; sawariyon ki pushton ko chhune wale kapde na bichhao; baghair taalon wale gharon mein sukoonat na karo; baghair deewaron wali chhaton par na so'o; aur jab tum kutte ke bhonkne ya gadhe ke henkne ki awaz suno, Allah ki panah mango, kyunke koi gadha henkta hai na kutta bhonkta hai jab tak woh use na dekh lein."
"1109","Muhammad bin Ubayd ne riwayat kiya, al-A'mash ne riwayat kiya, Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd se, Jabir bin Abdullah se jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas se guzre jabke main logon ke peeche apne ek oont ko hank raha tha, langdata hua ya beemar; Unhon ne farmaya: Is ka kya haal hai? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, yeh langdata hai ya beemar ho gaya hai; Unhon ne apne hath mein kuch liya aur use mara, phir farmaya: Sawar ho jao; Main use rokta raha yahan tak ke woh mujh se aa mile; jab hamare aur Madinah ke darmiyan ek manzil thi aur hum ne shaam ko padav dala, main ne apne ahl-e-khana ki taraf jaldi jana chaha; Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kahan? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, main naya shadi shuda hun, is liye main ne apne ahl-e-khana ki taraf jaldi jana chaha; Unhon ne mujh se farmaya: Raat ko apne ahl-e-khana ke paas na aao; phir unhon ne mujh se pucha: Kya tum ne kunwari se shadi ki ya pehle shadi shuda aurat se? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Balke pehle shadi shuda aurat se; Unhon ne farmaya: Kunwari se kyun nahin jis se tum khelo aur jo tum se khele? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, Abdullah faut ho gaya aur mere paas chhoti bachchiyan chhor gaya, pas main ne un ke liye unhi jaisi se shadi karna napasand kiya, aur main ek aqalmand tajurbakar aurat chahta tha; Unhon ne na farmaya: Tum ne achha kiya, na: Tum ne bura kiya; phir unhon ne farmaya: Apna oont mujhe bech do; Main ne kaha: Nahin, balke woh aap ka hai, Ya Rasool Allah; Unhon ne farmaya: Use mujhe bech do; Main ne kaha: Nahin, balke woh aap ka hai; jab unhon ne mujh par zor diya, main ne kaha: Fulan ke paas mere liye sone ka ek ooqiya hai, pas woh us ke badle aap ka hai; phir unhon ne farmaya: Use apne ahl-e-khana tak pahunchne ke liye istemal karo; Unhon ne kaha: Jab main Madinah pahuncha main use un ke paas laya, aur unhon ne Bilal ko hukm diya ke mujhe ek ooqiya de aur mujhe zyada de, pas Bilal ne mere liye ek qirat ka izafa kiya; Main ne kaha: Yeh woh cheez hai jo Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe zyada di; yeh mujh se kabhi juda na hogi, pas main ne use thaili mein rakh diya; Harrah ke din Ahl-e-Sham ne use un cheezon mein le liya jo unhon ne leen."
"1110","Muhammad bin Kathir ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Sulayman bin Kathir ne riwayat kiya, Husayn se, Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd se, Jabir se jinhon ne kaha: Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jumu'ah ki namaz mein the jab ek qafila Madinah mein dakhil hua, pas woh phire aur us ki taraf nikal gaye yahan tak ke un mein se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas barah aadmiyon ke siwa koi baqi na raha; phir yeh ayat nazil hui: Aur jab woh tijarat ya khel dekhte hain, us ki taraf muntashir ho jate hain aur aap ko khada chhor dete hain."
"1111","Amr bin Awn ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Hushaym se, Husayn se, Abu Sufyan aur Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd se, Jabir bin Abdullah se: Aur woh aap ko khada chhor dete hain; Unhon ne kaha: Ek qafila aaya, pas woh us ki taraf muntashir ho gaye, aur barah aadmiyon ke siwa koi baqi na raha."
"1112","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar ne khabar di, Mansur se, Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd se, Jabir bin Abdullah se jinhon ne kaha: Ansar ke ek aadmi ke han ladka paida hua, pas us ne us ka naam al-Qasim rakha; Ansar ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, hum tumhen is se kabhi kunyat nahin denge; yeh Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchi, pas unhon ne Ansar ki khub tareef ki, phir farmaya: Mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunyat ikhtiyar na karo."
"1113","Ubaydullah bin Musa ne khabar di, Isra'il bin Yunus se, Mansur se, Salim se, Jabir se jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek aadmi mere paas aata hai aur mujh se mangta hai, pas main use deta hun, aur woh jata hai apne aaghosh mein Aag ke siwa kuch liye hue nahin."
"1114","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Muhammad bin Fudayl ne riwayat kiya, Yazid bin Abi Ziyad se, Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jinhon ne farmaya: Wuzu ke liye ek mudd kafi hai, aur janabat ke liye ek sa'; ek aadmi ne kaha: Yeh humen kafi nahin hota; Unhon ne farmaya: Yeh tum se behtar aur zyada balon wale ko kafi tha."
"1115","Abu al-Walid ne mujhe riwayat kiya, Shu'bah ne riwayat kiya, Amr bin Murrah aur Husayn se; unhon ne Salim bin Abi al-Ja'd ko kehte hue suna: Main ne Jabir ko kehte hue suna: Humen piyas lagi aur hum zor se roye, phir hum Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunche; Unhon ne apna hath pani mein rakha, aur pani un ki ungliyon ke darmiyan se jaise chashmon ki tarah phutne laga, aur farmaya: Allah ka naam lo; pas hum ne piya yahan tak ke hum sair ho gaye aur woh humen kafi ho gaya; Shu'bah ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ki hadith mein: Hum ne Jabir se kaha: Tum kitne the? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ek hazar paanch sau the; agar hum ek lakh hote, to bhi woh humen kafi ho jata."
"1116","Abdullah bin Yazid al-Muqri ne riwayat kiya, Sa'id bin Abi Ayyub ne riwayat kiya, Amr bin Jabir al-Hadrami se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramadan ke roze rakhe aur Shawwal ke chhe, to goya us ne pure saal roze rakhe."
"1117","Usi sanad ke sath, Jabir se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke fuqara aghniya se chalis khizan pehle Jannat mein dakhil honge."
"1118","Abdullah bin Yazid ne riwayat kiya, Sa'id bin Abi Ayyub ne riwayat kiya, Amr bin Jabir al-Hadrami se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ta'oon se bhagne wala ladai se bhagne wale ki tarah hai, aur us mein sabr karne wala ladai mein sabr karne wale ki tarah hai."
"1119","Zayd bin Hubab al-Ukli ne khabar di, jinhon ne kaha: Layth bin Sa'd ne mujhe khabar di, jinhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri ne mujhe khabar di, Abd al-Rahman bin Ka'b se, Jabir bin Abdullah se jinhon ne kaha: Uhud ke din ek aadmi aur do aadmiyon ko ek hi kapde mein kafan diya jata tha; unhen un ke zakhmon ke sath kafan diya gaya, dafn kiya gaya, aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un par namaz na padhi."
"1120","Muhammad bin al-Fadl ne riwayat kiya, Hammad bin Zayd ne riwayat kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Asim bin Umar bin Qatadah se, Mahmud bin Labid se, Jabir bin Abdullah se: Ek aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sone ke ande jaisi cheez lekar aaya aur kaha: Yeh sadaqah hai, aur is ke siwa mere paas koi maal nahin; Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use usi se us par phenka, aur farmaya: Tum mein se koi jata hai aur apne maal se khali ho jata hai, phir logon par bojh ban jata hai."
"1121","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne Asim ibn Umar se, unhon ne Mahmud ibn Labid se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath the ke ek aadmi sone ke ande jaisi cheez le kar aaya jo us ne kisi ghazwah mein payi thi, aur use Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aap ki dayen janib se la kar kaha: Ya Rasulallah, ye mujh se sadqe ke taur par le lijiye, Allah ki qasam mere paas is ke siwa kuch nahi hai, Aap ne us se munh pher liya, phir wo bayen janib se aaya aur isi tarah kaha, phir samne se aaya aur isi tarah kaha, Aap ne farmaya: Lao ise, gusse ki halat mein aur use us ki taraf aise phenka ke agar wo use lag jata to use zakhmi ya takleef pahunchata, phir farmaya: Tum mein se koi apna sara maal le kar aata hai jis ke siwa us ke paas kuch nahi hota aur use sadqa kar deta hai, phir baad mein logon se bheek mangta phirta hai, sadqa to sirf zarurat se zayed maal se hota hai, apna maal le jao, humein is ki koi hajat nahi, chunanchah wo aadmi apna maal le kar chala gaya."
"1122","Ya'la ne bayan kiya, al-Ajlah ne al-Dhayyal ibn Harmalah se, unhon ne Jabir se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath ek safar se wapas aaye yahan tak ke hum Banu al-Najjar ke baghon mein se ek bagh tak pahunche to wahan ek oont tha jis ke paas bagh mein koi dakhil nahi hota tha magar wo us par hamla kar deta tha, logon ne is ka zikr Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se kiya to Aap us ke paas tashreef laye aur use pukara, wo apna hont zameen par rakhte hue aaya yahan tak ke Aap ke samne baith gaya, Aap ne farmaya: Lagam lao, log lagam laye to Aap ne use lagam pehnai aur us ke malik ke hawale kar diya, phir mutawajjeh ho kar farmaya: Aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan koi cheez aisi nahi jo ye na janti ho ke main Allah ka Rasul hun, siwaye jinn aur insanon mein se sarkashon ke."
"1123","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Mushir ne al-Ajlah se, unhon ne al-Dhayyal ibn Harmalah al-Asadi se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Quraysh ek din jama hue aur kehne lage: Apne sab se zyada jadu, kahaanat aur shayari janne wale ko talash karo, use is shakhs ke paas bhejo jis ne hamari jamaat ko muntashir kar diya, hamare muamle ko bikher diya aur hamare deen mein aib nikala, wo us se baat kare aur dekhe wo kya jawab deta hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Utbah ibn Rabi'ah ke siwa kisi ko nahi jante, unhon ne kaha: Aye Abu al-Walid, aap jaiye, Utbah Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aye Muhammad, kya aap behtar hain ya Abdullah, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam khamosh rahe, phir kaha: Kya aap behtar hain ya Abd al-Muttalib, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam khamosh rahe, us ne kaha: Agar aap ka dawa hai ke wo aap se behtar hain to wo un mabudon ki ibadat karte the jin mein aap aib nikalte hain, aur agar aap ka dawa hai ke aap un se behtar hain to boliye taake hum aap ki baat sunein, Allah ki qasam hum ne aap se zyada apni qaum ke liye manhoos koi bachcha nahi dekha, aap ne hamari jamaat ko tod diya, hamare muamle ko bikher diya, hamare deen mein aib nikala aur humein Arab mein ruswa kar diya yahan tak ke logon mein ye mashhoor ho gaya ke Quraysh mein ek jadugar hai aur Quraysh mein ek kahin hai, Allah ki qasam hum to sirf is baat ka intezar kar rahe hain ke aurat ke dard-e-zeh jaisi cheekh buland ho ke hum mein se baaz talwaron se baaz par toot padein yahan tak ke hum ek dusre ko fana kar dein, aye aadmi agar aap ke paas hajat hai to hum aap ke liye maal jama kar dete hain yahan tak ke aap Quraysh ke sab se zyada maal-dar ban jayen, aur agar aap ko auraton ki khwahish hai to Quraysh ki jin auraton ko chahen pasand kar lijiye hum aap ki shadi das se kara dete hain, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum baat khatam kar chuke, us ne kaha: Ji haan, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim, Ha Mim, ye Rahman o Rahim ki taraf se nazil karda hai, yahan tak ke Aap is ayat tak pahunche: Phir agar ye munh pher lein to keh dijiye, main ne tumhein Aad aur Thamud ki kadak jaisi kadak se khabardar kar diya hai, Utbah ne kaha: Bas bas, kya aap ke paas is ke siwa kuch nahi, Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, to wo Quraysh ke paas wapas gaya, unhon ne kaha: Aap ke peeche kya hua, us ne kaha: Main ne koi baat nahi chhodi jo mera khayal tha ke tum us se kahoge magar main ne us se keh di, unhon ne kaha: Kya us ne tumhein jawab diya, us ne kaha: Haan, us ne kaha: Nahi qasam hai us zaat ki jis ne ise imarat bana kar khada kiya, main us ki kisi baat ko nahi samjha siwaye is ke ke us ne kaha, main ne tumhein Aad aur Thamud ki kadak jaisi kadak se khabardar kar diya hai, unhon ne kaha: Tum par afsos, aadmi tum se Arabi mein baat karta hai aur tum nahi samajhte ke us ne kya kaha, us ne kaha: Nahi Allah ki qasam main us ki kisi baat ko nahi samjha siwaye kadak ke zikr ke."
"1124","Ya'la aur Muhammad ibna Ubayd ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Mis'ar ne Bukayr ibn al-Akhnas se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apni sawari par namaz padhte the jidhar bhi us ka rukh hota."
"1125","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Mis'ar ne Yazid al-Faqir se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rone wali aurtein Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas ayin to Aap ne farmaya: Aye Allah humein rahat-bakhsh, pakeezah, phal dene wali, fori ghair muakhkhar, nafa-bakhsh ghair muzirr barish ata farma, phir un par khoob barish baras padi."
"1126","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, Zakariyya ibn Abi Za'idah ne Sa'd ibn Ibrahim se, unhon ne ek aadmi se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne aap ko aur apne ghar walon ko raat ki ibtida mein gharon mein roke rakho, kyunki jinn us waqt phail jate hain."
"1127","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne khabar di, Abu Bakr al-Madani ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se khabar di: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam raat mein do ya teen martaba miswak karte the, jab bhi sote aur bedar hote to miswak karte, wuzu farmate aur do rak'atein ya rak'atein padhte."
"1128","Ya'la ne khabar di, Abu Bakr ne Jabir se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hum Maghrib ki namaz Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath padhte the jab ke hum shafaq ko dekh rahe hote the."
"1129","Ya'la ne khabar di, Abu Bakr ne Jabir se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Al-Awali ka ek aadmi aaya jab ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam aur Jibril us jagah namaz padh rahe the jahan janaze ki namaz padhi jati hai, jab Aap farigh hue to us aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah, ye kaun hain jinhein main ne Aap ke saath dekha, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne use dekha hai, us ne kaha: Ji haan, Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne badi bhalai dekhi hai, ye Jibril hain, wo musalsal mujhe padosi ke haq ka hukm dete rahe yahan tak ke main samjha ke wo use waris bana denge."
"1130","Ya'la ne bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ne Jabir se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam safar mein Zuhr aur Asr ko jama kar ke padhte the."
"1131","Ya'la ne khabar di, Abu Bakr ne Jabir se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Madinah Makkah ki hurmat ki tarah hurmat wala hai, qasam hai us zaat ki jis ne Muhammad par kitaab nazil farmai, is ke darron par farishte pehra dete hain ke ise shaitan se mehfooz rakhein."
"1132","Ja'far ibn Awn ne khabar di, Musa ibn Ubaydah ne Ibrahim ibn Muhammad ibn Ibrahim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe sawar ke pyale ki tarah na banao, jab sawar apna saman latkata hai to apna pyala le kar use pani se bhar leta hai, agar use wuzu ki hajat ho to wuzu kar leta hai, agar peene ki hajat ho to pee leta hai, warna jo kuch us mein hai use baha deta hai, mujhe dua ke shuru mein, dua ke darmiyan mein aur dua ke aakhir mein rakho."
"1133","Muhammad ibn Bakr al-Bursani ne khabar di, Ibn Jurayj ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne apne walid ko ye riwayat bayan karte hue suna ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apne Hajj mein qurbani ke janwar saath laye, tehsath oonton ko apne haath se zibah kiya, Ali ibn Abi Talib ko hukm diya to unhon ne baqi ko zibah kiya, Ali un ke liye qurbani ke janwar hank kar laye the, kul mila kar ye sau oont the."
"1134","Muhammad ibn Bakr ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ja'far ibn Muhammad ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se sun kar ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ko bayan karte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne Hajj mein sau oont hadi ke taur par pesh kiye, har oont se ek tukda lene ka hukm diya to wo degchi mein rakhe gaye, aur Aap ne us ke gosht mein se khaya aur us ke shorbe mein se piya, main ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath khane aur shorba peene wala kaun tha, unhon ne kaha: Ali, Ja'far ye kehte hain."
"1135","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hatim ibn Isma'il al-Madani ne Ja'far ibn Muhammad se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Hum Jabir ibn Abdullah ke paas dakhil hue aur unhon ne logon ke bare mein pucha yahan tak ke mujh tak pahunche, main ne kaha: Main Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Husayn hun, unhon ne apna haath mere sar ki taraf badhaya, mera upar ka button khola, phir mera neeche ka button khola, phir apni hatheliyan mere seene ke darmiyan rakhin jab ke main us waqt kam-umr ladka tha, unhon ne kaha: Aye mere bhai ke bete tumhein khush amdeed, jo chaho puch lo, to main ne un se sawal kiye jab ke wo nabina the aur namaz ka waqt aa gaya, wo ek buni hui chadar mein khade hue use lapete hue, jab kabhi use kandhon par dalte to chhota hone ki wajah se us ke kinare un ki taraf laut aate jab ke un ki chadar kapdon ke changhe par un ke paas rakhi thi, unhon ne humein namaz padhai, main ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke Hajj ke bare mein khabar dijiye, unhon ne haath se ishara kiya aur nau gina aur kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam nau saal tak Hajj kiye baghair rahe, phir daswen saal logon mein elan kiya gaya ke Rasulullah Hajj karenge, Madinah mein bahut se log aaye sab is liye ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki pairwi karein aur Aap ke amal ki tarah amal karein, hum Aap ke saath nikle yahan tak ke Dhu al-Hulayfah pahunche jahan Asma bint Umays ne Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ko janam diya, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko paigham bheja: Main kya karun, Aap ne farmaya: Ghusl karo, kapda bandh lo aur ihram bandh lo, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne masjid mein namaz padhi phir al-Qaswa par sawar hue hatta ke jab Aap ki oontni al-Bayda par Aap ko le kar seedhi khadi hui main ne jahan tak nazar jati thi Aap ke aage sawar aur paidal dekhe isi tarah Aap ke dayen isi tarah bayen aur isi tarah peeche, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam hamare darmiyan the, Aap par Qur'an nazil hota tha, Aap us ki tafsir jante the aur Aap jo amal karte hum bhi wahi karte, Aap ne tauheed ke saath ihram bandha: Labbayk Allahumma labbayk, labbayk la sharika laka labbayk, innal hamda wan ni'mata laka wal mulk, la sharika lak, log isi ke saath ihram bandhte the jis ke saath wo ihram bandhte the aur Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne un mein se kisi cheez ko radd nahi farmaya, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apni talbiyah par qayam rahe, Jabir ne kaha: Hum ne sirf Hajj ka irada kiya tha, hum Umrah ko nahi jante the yahan tak ke hum Aap ke saath Baitullah pahunche, Aap ne Hajr ko chua, teen chakron mein ramal kiya aur chaar mein aam chal chale, phir Maqam-e-Ibrahim ki taraf badhe aur ye ayat tilawat farmai: Aur Maqam-e-Ibrahim ko namaz ki jagah banao, Aap ne Maqam ko apne aur Baitullah ke darmiyan rakha - mere walid kehte the aur mujhe malum nahi ke unhon ne ise Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se naqal kiya: Aap ne do rak'aton mein Qul huwa Allahu ahad aur Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun padhi, phir Aap Hajr ki taraf laute aur use chua, phir darwaze se al-Safa ki taraf nikle, jab Aap al-Safa ke qareeb hue to ye ayat padhi: Beshak al-Safa aur al-Marwah Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain, main usi se ibtida karta hun jis se Allah ne ibtida ki, Aap ne al-Safa se ibtida ki, us par chadhe yahan tak ke Baitullah ko dekha, qiblah rukh hue, Allah azza wa jalla ki wahdaniyat aur takbeer bayan ki aur farmaya: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi, wo akela hai us ka koi shareek nahi, usi ki badshahat hai aur usi ki hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahi akela, us ne apna wada pura kiya, apne bande ki madad ki aur tanha ahzab ko shikast di, phir Aap ne is ke darmiyan dua farmai isi tarah teen martaba kaha, phir Aap al-Marwah ki taraf utre yahan tak ke Aap ke qadam wadi ke nichle hisse mein tez chale, jab hum upar chadhte to chalte yahan tak ke Aap al-Marwah pahunche aur al-Marwah par waisa hi kiya jaisa al-Safa par kiya, yahan tak ke jab al-Marwah par aakhiri chakar tha to farmaya: Agar mujhe pehle wo malum hota jo ab malum hua hai to main qurbani ka janwar saath na lata aur ise Umrah bana deta, tum mein se jis ke paas qurbani ka janwar nahi hai wo ihram khol de aur ise Umrah bana le, Suraqah ibn Ju'shum khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulallah kya ye hamare is saal ke liye hai ya hamesha ke liye, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ek haath ki ungliyan dusre haath mein dakhil farma kar kaha: Umrah Hajj mein dakhil ho gaya - do martaba - nahi balke hamesha hamesha ke liye, Ali Yaman se Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke qurbani ke oonton ke saath aaye aur Fatimah ko un logon mein paya jo ihram khol chuki theen, unhon ne rangeen kapde pehne hue the aur surma lagaya hua tha to Ali ne is par un par nakhushi zahir ki, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe is ka hukm diya hai, Ali Iraq mein kehte the: To main Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas Fatimah ke kiye par shikayat le kar gaya, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se is bare mein hukm lene ke liye jo unhon ne Aap se naqal kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko khabar di ke main ne is par un mein nakhushi zahir ki hai to Aap ne farmaya: Unhon ne sach kaha, unhon ne sach kaha, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum ne Hajj ka ihram bandha to kya kaha tha, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aye Allah main usi cheez ka ihram bandhta hun jis ka Aap ke Rasul ihram bandhte hain, sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, Aap ne farmaya: Mere paas qurbani ka janwar hai to tum ihram na kholo, kul qurbani ke janwar jo Ali Yaman se laye aur jo Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam laye wo sau the, tamam logon ne ihram khol diya aur baal katraye siwaye Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam aur un ke jin ke paas qurbani ka janwar tha, jab Tarwiyah ka din hua to wo Mina ki taraf rawana hue aur Hajj ka ihram bandha, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam sawar hue aur wahan Zuhr, Asr, Maghrib, Isha aur Fajr padhi, phir thodi der thahre yahan tak ke suraj tulu hua aur Aap ne Namirah mein baal ka khaima lagane ka hukm diya, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam rawana hue jab ke Quraysh ko shak nahi tha magar ye ke Aap Mash'ar al-Haram par waquf karenge jaisa ke Quraysh zamana-e-jahiliyat mein karte the, lekin Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam guzar gaye yahan tak ke Arafah pahunche, Namirah mein apne liye laga hua khaima paya aur wahan thahre yahan tak ke jab suraj dhal gaya to Aap ne al-Qaswa ko lane ka hukm diya jo Aap ke liye kasi hui thi, Aap wadi ke nichle hisse mein tashreef laye aur logon ko khutba diya, farmaya: Tumhara khoon aur tumhara maal tum par is tarah hurmat wala hai jaise tumhare is din ki hurmat, tumhare is maheene mein, tumhari is zameen mein, jahiliyat ka har muamla mere qadmon tale raund diya gaya hai, jahiliyat ke khoon khatam kiye gaye aur pehla khoon jo main khatam karta hun wo aulaad-e-Adam ke khoon mein se Rabi'ah ibn al-Harith ka khoon hai jo Banu Sa'd mein doodh piya karta tha aur Hudhayl ne use qatl kar diya tha, jahiliyat ka sood khatam kiya gaya aur pehla sood jo main khatam karta hun wo hamara sood hai, Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib ka sood, pas wo sab khatam hai, auraton ke bare mein Allah se daro kyunki tum ne unhein Allah ki amanat se liya hai aur Allah ke kalime se un ki sharmgahon ko halal kiya hai, tumhara haq un par ye hai ke wo tumhare bistaron par kisi aise shakhs ko na aane dein jise tum na pasand karte ho, agar wo aisa karein to unhein halki maar maro, aur un ka haq tum par ye hai ke dastoor ke mutabiq un ka rizq aur libas tumhare zimme hai, main ne tumhare darmiyan aisi cheez chhodi hai ke agar tum use thaame rahoge to us ke baad kabhi gumrah na hoge, Allah ki Kitab, tum se mere bare mein pucha jayega to tum kya kahoge, unhon ne kaha: Hum gawahi dete hain ke Aap ne paigham pahuncha diya, ada kar diya aur nasihat kar di, Aap ne apni shahadat ki ungli se aasman ki taraf uthate hue aur logon ki taraf ishara karte hue farmaya: Aye Allah gawah reh, teen martaba, phir Aap ne azan kahlwai, phir iqamat kahlwai aur Zuhr padhi, phir iqamat kahlwai aur Asr padhi, in dono ke darmiyan kuch na padha, phir Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam sawar hue yahan tak ke mauqif par pahunche, Aap ne apni oontni al-Qaswa ka pet patharon ki taraf kiya, paidal chalne walon ki rassi apne samne rakhi aur qiblah rukh hue, Aap waquf mein khade rahe yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho gaya aur zardi thodi chali gayi jab suraj ki tikki ghaib ho gayi, Aap ne Usamah ko apne peeche sawar kiya, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam rawana hue, al-Qaswa ki lagam ko is qadar kheenchte hue ke us ka sar kathi ke agle hisse ko chu raha tha, apne dayen haath se farmate hue: Aye logo sukoon ikhtiyar karo, sukoon ikhtiyar karo, jab kabhi kisi teele par aate to use thoda dheela chhod dete yahan tak ke wo upar chadh jati, jab Muzdalifah pahunche to wahan Maghrib aur Isha ek azan aur do iqamaton ke saath padhi, in dono ke darmiyan koi tasbeeh na ki, phir Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam lete rahe yahan tak ke fajr phoot padi, Aap ne fajr roshni wazeh hone par azan aur iqamat ke saath padhi, phir Aap al-Qaswa par sawar hue yahan tak ke Mash'ar al-Haram pahunche, qiblah rukh hue, Allah se dua ki, us ki takbeer aur us ki wahdaniyat aur us ki yagangat bayan ki, khade rahe yahan tak ke khoob roshni ho gayi, Aap suraj nikalne se pehle rawana hue, al-Fadl ibn Abbas ko peeche sawar kiya jo khoobsurat baalon wale gora rang aur haseen aadmi the, jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam rawana hue to hawdajon mein baithi aurtein tezi se guzrein aur al-Fadl unhein dekhne lage, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apna haath un ke chehre par rakh diya to al-Fadl ne dusri taraf munh pher kar dekhna shuru kiya aur Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne dusri taraf se apna haath al-Fadl ke chehre par pher kar un ka chehra dusri taraf se pher diya, yahan tak ke Aap Muhassir pahunche wahan thoda tez chale, phir Aap darmiyani rasta liya jo Jamrat al-Kubra tak le jata hai yahan tak ke darakht ke paas wale jamre tak pahunche, use saat kankariyan marein har kankari ke saath takbeer kehte hue jaise chane ke barabar kankariyan, wadi ke neeche se kankariyan marein, phir Aap qurbangah ki taraf gaye aur tehsath oont zibah kiye, phir Ali ko diye to unhon ne baqi zibah kiye, unhein apni qurbani mein shareek kiya, phir Aap ne har oont se ek tukda lene ka hukm diya to wo degchi mein rakhe gaye, pakaye gaye aur Aap ne us ke gosht mein se khaya aur us ke shorbe mein se piya, phir Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam sawar hue aur tezi se Baitullah ki taraf gaye, Makkah mein Zuhr padhi aur Banu Abd al-Muttalib ke paas aaye jo Zamzam par pani pila rahe the aur farmaya: Pani pilao aye Banu Abd al-Muttalib, agar ye na hota ke log tum par tumhare saqaye par ghalib aa jayenge to main bhi tumhare saath pani kheenchta, unhon ne Aap ke liye dal mangwaya to Aap ne us mein se piya."
"1136","Ibrahim ibn Isa al-Talqani ne bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ibn al-Walid ne Hamzah ibn Hassan se, unhon ne Ali ibn Zayd se, unhon ne Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne minbar par hote hue farmaya: Aye logo marne se pehle apne Rab ki taraf tauba karo, nek aamal ke saath us ki taraf jaldi karo, us ke aur apne darmiyan talluq ko kasrat se us ke zikr aur posheeda wa elaniya kasrat se sadqa ke zariye jodo taake tumhein ajr diya jaye, madad di jaye aur rizq diya jaye, jaan lo ke Allah azza wa jalla ne is saal mein, is maheene mein, is ghadi mein Jum'ah ko tum par farz kiya hai ek likhi hui farziyat ke taur par, jo shakhs meri zindagi mein ya meri wafaat ke baad Qayamat tak ise chhod de, is ka inkar karte hue aur is ke haq ko halka samajhte hue, jab ke us ka imam adil ho ya zalim, Allah us ke kaam ko jama na karega, na us ke muamle mein barkat dega, khabardar us ki koi namaz nahi, khabardar us ka koi Hajj nahi, khabardar us ka koi sadqa nahi, khabardar us ki koi zakat nahi, khabardar us ki koi neki nahi, jo tauba kare Allah us ki taraf mutawajjeh hota hai, khabardar koi dehati kisi muhajir ki imamat na karaye, khabardar koi aurat kisi mard ki imamat na karaye, khabardar koi fajir kisi nek ki imamat na karaye magar ye ke wo hukmaran ho."
"1137","Abu Nu'aym ne bayan kiya, Isra'il ne Abdullah ibn Muslim ibn Hurmuz se, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Sabit se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se mila aur kaha: Ya Rasulallah Aap ne is subah kis haal mein kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Khairiyat se, us shakhs se behtar jis ne roza na rakha ho aur mareez ki iyadat na ki ho."
"1138","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar ne Ibn Khuthaym se, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Sabit se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se khabar di ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Ka'b ibn Ujrah se farmaya: Aye Ka'b ibn Ujrah Allah tumhein bewaquf hukmaranon ki hukumat se mehfooz rakhe, unhon ne kaha: Bewaquf hukmaranon ki hukumat kya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Mere baad aise hukmaran jo jhoot bolenge, wo na meri hidayat par chalenge na mere tareeqe ki pairwi karenge, jo un ke jhoot mein un ki tasdeeq kare aur un ke zulm mein un ki madad kare, wo mujh se nahi aur main un se nahi, na wo mere Hawz par ayenge, aur jo un ke jhoot mein un ki tasdeeq na kare aur na un ke zulm mein un ki madad kare, wo mujh se hain aur main un se hun aur wo mere Hawz par ayenge, aye Ka'b ibn Ujrah roza dhaal hai, sadqa gunah ko bujha deta hai aur namaz qurbat ka zariya hai - ya farmaya: daleel hai, aye Ka'b ibn Ujrah haram kamai se parwarish pane wala gosht Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga, Jahannam us ka zyada haqdar hai, aye Ka'b ibn Ujrah log do musafiron ki tarah hain, ek jo apne aap ko khareed kar azad kara leta hai aur ek jo use bech kar halak kar deta hai."
"1139","Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, Ma'mar ne Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Thawban se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Tabuk mein bees din thahre namaz qasr karte hue."
"1140","Yahya ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Layth ibn Sa'd ne Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Usamah ibn al-Had se, unhon ne Yahya ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Ja'far ibn al-Hakam se, unhon ne al-Qa'qa' ibn Hakim se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Bartan ko dhaanp do aur mashkeeze ka munh bandh do, kyunki Allah azza wa jalla ki ek bimari hai jo saal mein ek raat utarti hai, wo kisi khule bartan ya khuli mashkeeze par se nahi guzarti magar us bimari mein se kuch us mein gir jata hai, [matbua nuskhe ki hashiya mein mutabadil naam Ja'far ibn Abdullah ibn al-Hakam ka zikr hai, sanad waisa hi naqal ki gayi jaisa matbua mein hai]."
"1141","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar Sulayman ibn Hayyan ne Mujalid se, unhon ne al-Shabi se, unhon ne Jabir se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas baithe hue thay jab Aap ne apne samne is tarah ek khat khincha aur farmaya: Ye Allah ka rasta hai. Phir Aap ne apne dayen do khat aur apne bayen do khat khinche aur farmaya: Ye Shaytan ke raste hain. Phir Aap ne darmiyani khat par apna haath rakha aur ye ayat tilawat farmayi: Aur ye ke ye Mera seedha rasta hai, pas is ki pairvi karo, aur doosre raston ki pairvi na karo, kahin wo tumhein Us ke raste se juda na kar den."
"1142","Hamein Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Usamah ne Mujalid se, unhon ne Amir se, unhon ne Jabir se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sad ibn Abi Waqqas ne Jumuah ke din ek shakhs se kaha: Tumhara koi Jumuah nahin. Us shakhs ka zikr Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se kiya gaya, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Sad ne mujh se kaha: Tumhara koi Jumuah nahin. Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kyun, Ae Sad? Unhon ne kaha: Us ne baat ki jabke Aap khutba de rahe thay. Aap ne farmaya: Sad ne sach kaha."
"1143","Hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, hamein Dawud ibn Qays ne Ubaydullah ibn Miqsam se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se bayan kiya, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho, kyunki wo Qayamat ke Din andhere honge, aur bakhl se bacho, kyunki us ne tum se pehle logon ko halak kiya; us ne unhein un ka khoon bahane aur un ki hurmat wali cheezon ko halal kar lene par uksaya."
"1144","Hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, hamein Zamah ibn Salih ne Muhammad ibn Abi Sulayman se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ke khandan ke ek fard se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se bayan kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah, Ansar ko aur un ki awlad ko aur un ki awlad ki awlad ko aur un ke zer-e-kafalah logon ko bakhsh de. Unhon ne kaha: Jab taza khajooron ka mausam hota, to Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam taza khajooron ke siwa kisi cheez se iftar na farmate, aur jab taza khajooren na hotin, to khushk khajooron ke siwa kisi cheez se iftar na farmate."
"1145","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Ibn Abi Dhib se, unhon ne Shurahbil se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabir ibn Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Tum mein se kisi ka kankariyon se apna haath rok lena us ke liye sau siyah aankhon wali oontniyon se behtar hai; lekin agar Shaytan tum mein se kisi par ghalib aa jaye, to wo sirf ek martaba masah kare."
"1146","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ibn Salamah ne Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil se, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Jabir al-Ansari se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan kiya, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas do bare seengon wale siyah-o-safed khassi mendhe laye gaye. Aap ne un mein se ek ko litaya aur farmaya: Allah ke naam se, aur Allah sab se bara hai; Ae Allah, Muhammad aur Muhammad ke gharane ki taraf se. Phir Aap ne doosre ko qareeb kiya, use litaya, aur farmaya: Allah ke naam se, aur Allah sab se bara hai; Muhammad aur un ki ummat ki taraf se, un mein se jo Teri wahdaniyat ki gawahi de aur mere tabligh-e-risalat ki gawahi de."
"1147","Hamein Yahya ibn Ishaq al-Saylahini ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Yahya ibn Ayyub ne Umarah ibn Ghaziyyah se, unhon ne Shurahbil al-Ansari se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise koi cheez di jaye aur wo istitaat paye, to use us ka badla de; aur jo istitaat na paye, to us par us ki tarif kare, kyunki agar us ne us par us ki tarif ki to us ne us ka shukr ada kiya, aur agar us ne use chhupaya to us ne us ki nashukri ki. Aur jo shakhs us cheez se zeenat ikhtiyar kare jo use di nahin gayi, wo jhooth ke do kapre pehenne wale ki tarah hai."
"1148","Hamein Umar ibn Sad ne Yaqub al-Qummi se, unhon ne Isa se, unhon ne Jabir se bayan kiya, ke Ibn Umm Maktum Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, main nabina hun aur azan sunta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum azan suno, to us ki taraf aao, agarche ghisat kar, agarche reng kar."
"1149","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Musa ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hamare makanaat door thay, pas hum ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki masjid ke qareeb muntaqil hona chaha, aur hum ne Aap se mashwara kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Apne makanaat mein hi raho; koi momin aisa nahin jo wuzu kare aur use khoob achhi tarah kare, phir masjid ki taraf rawana ho, magar Allah us ke har qadam par us ke liye ek neki likhta hai aur us se ek gunah mita deta hai."
"1150","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Musa ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne hajj ke manasik mukammal kare, aur Musalman us ki zaban aur us ke haath se mahfooz rahen, us ke pichhle gunah bakhsh diye jayenge."
"1151","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne Musa ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne Zayd ibn Aslam se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne hum se farmaya: Kya main tumhein us cheez ki khabar na dun jis ki Nuh ne apne bete ko wasiyyat ki? Nuh ne apne bete se kaha: Ae mere bete, main tumhein do cheezon ki wasiyyat karta hun aur do cheezon se mana karta hun. Ae mere bete, main tumhein wasiyyat karta hun ke kaho: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin, wo akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahin, kyunki agar aasman aur zameen ek palre mein rakhe jayen to ye un par bhari hoga, aur agar wo halqa bana diye jayen to ye use tor dega. Aur main tumhein wasiyyat karta hun ke kaho: Allah paak hai aur Us ki hamd ke saath, kyunki ye makhlooq ki namaz hai aur makhlooq ki tasbeeh hai, aur isi ke zariye makhlooq ko rizq diya jata hai. Aur Ae mere bete, main tumhein Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek thehrane se mana karta hun, kyunki jo Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek thehrata hai, Allah ne us par Jannat haram kar di hai. Aur Ae mere bete, main tumhein takabbur se mana karta hun, kyunki koi shakhs Jannat mein dakhil na hoga jabke us ke dil mein rai ke dane ke barabar bhi takabbur hoga. Phir Muadh ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kya takabbur ye hai ke hum mein se kisi ke paas sawari ho jis par wo sawar ho, ya jootiyan hon jinhein wo pehne, ya kapre hon jinhein wo pehne, ya khana ho jis par wo apne sathiyon ko jama kare? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin; balke takabbur haq ko haqeer janna aur momin ko zaleel samajhna hai. Aur main tumhein khaslaton ki khabar dunga: jis mein wo hon wo mutakabbir nahin: bakri bandhna, gadhe par sawari karna, mominon mein se fuqara ke saath baithna, tum mein se ek ka apne ghar walon ke saath khana, aur oon ka libas pehenna."
"1152","Hamein Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, hamein Khalid ibn Ilyas ne Ibrahim ibn Ubayd ibn Rifah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Makkah mein Jabir ibn Abdullah ke paas aaya aur unhein paya ke wo baithe hue apne sathiyon ko Asr parha rahe thay. Unhon ne kaha: Main ruka yahan tak ke unhon ne salam phera, phir main ne kaha: Allah aap ko bakhshe, aap Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke Sahabi hain, phir bhi aap unhein baithe hue namaz parhate hain? Unhon ne kaha: Main beemar hun, pas main baith gaya aur unhein hukm diya ke baith kar mere saath namaz parhen. Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Koi shakhs Isha ba-jamaat nahin parhta, phir us ke bad jo chahe parhta hai, phir rawana hone se pehle witr parhta hai, magar wo raat us ke liye aisi hogi goya us ne Shab-e-Qadr ko qubooliyat-e-dua ke saath paya. Aur main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Imam dhaal hai; agar wo khare ho kar namaz parhe, to khare ho kar namaz parho, aur agar wo baithe hue namaz parhe, to baithe hue namaz parho. Unhon ne kaha: Hum apne gharon mein namaz ke liye awaz dete thay aur apne ghar walon ko jama karte thay."
"1153","Hamein Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein Aban ibn Yazid al-Attar ne Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne Ubaydullah ibn Miqsam se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah al-Ansari se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jabke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apne Sahaba mein thay, Aap ke paas se ek janaza guzra, pas hum use uthane ke liye khare hue, aur dekha to wo kisi Yahudi ya Yahudiyah ka janaza tha. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, ye kisi Yahudi ya Yahudiyah ka janaza tha. Aap ne farmaya: Maut ghabrahat hai, pas jab tum janaza dekho, to khare ho jao."
"1154","Mujhe Muhammad ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Sayyar ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid al-Faqir ne bayan kiya, hamein Jabir ibn Abdullah ne bayan kiya, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe paanch cheezen di gayi hain jo mujh se pehle kisi ko nahin di gayin: ek mahine ki musafat par rob se meri madad ki gayi hai; zameen mere liye paaki ka zariya aur masjid bana di gayi hai, pas meri ummat ka jo shakhs jahan namaz ke waqt ko pa le, use namaz parhni chahiye; mere liye ghanimaten halal ki gayi hain halanke wo mujh se pehle kisi ke liye halal nahin thin; mujhe shafaat di gayi hai; aur har nabi apni qaum ki taraf khaas taur par bheja jata tha, jabke main tamam insano ki taraf bheja gaya hun."
"1155","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne Kathir ibn Zayd se, unhon ne Salamah ibn Abi Yazid se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maut ki tamanna na karo, kyunki chadhai ki ghabrahat sakht hai, aur aadmi ki khush-bakhti is mein hai ke us ki umar lambi ho aur Allah use tauba ata farmaye."
"1156","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne al-Rabi ibn Sad se, unhon ne Ibn Sabit se, unhon ne Jabir se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bani Israil se riwayat karo, kyunki un mein ajeeb-o-ghareeb waqiat thay. Phir Aap bayan farmane lage, farmate hue: Un mein se ek jamaat nikli aur un ke qabristanon mein se ek qabristan par aayi aur kaha: Kash hum do rakaten parhen aur Allah Azzawajal se dua karen ke wo hamare liye murdon mein se ek ko nikal laye jo hamein maut ke bare mein khabar de. Unhon ne kaha: Pas unhon ne aisa kiya, aur wo isi haal mein thay ke ek shakhs ne qabr se apna sar uthaya, us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan sajde ka nishan tha, aur kaha: Ae logo, tum ne mujh se kya chaha tha? Allah ki qasam, main sau saal pehle mara tha, aur maut ki tapish mujh se abhi tak khatm nahin hui, pas Allah se dua karo ke mujhe waisa hi lota de jaisa main tha."
"1157","Mujhe Ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd al-Ala ibn Abd al-Ala ne Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne Ata ibn Yasar se, unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdullah se bayan kiya: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jab tum raat mein kutton ke bhonkne ya gadhon ke reenkne ki awaz suno, to Allah ki panah mango, kyunki wo wo dekhte hain jo tum nahin dekhte. Aur jab halchal tham jaye to bahar nikalna kam kar do, kyunki Allah Azzawajal apni makhlooq mein se jise chahta hai phailata hai. Aur darwaze band karo aur un par Allah ka naam lo, kyunki Shaytan band darwaza nahin kholta - aur us par Allah ka naam lo - aur bare bartanon ko dhaanpo, aur bartanon ko aundha kar do, aur mashkizon ke munh bandh do."
"1158","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Anas ibn Malik ne khabar di ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam par us raat jab unhein raat mein le jaya gaya pachaas namazen farz ki gayin, phir unhein ghata kar paanch kar diya gaya. Phir nida di gayi: Ae Muhammad, Mere haan baat badli nahin jati, aur beshak aap ke liye in paanch ke saath pachaas hain."
"1159","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne al-Zuhri se khabar di, ke unhein Anas ibn Malik ne khabar di, kehte hue: Ek din hum Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas baithe thay jab Aap ne farmaya: Abhi tumhare paas is ghati se Jannat walon mein se ek shakhs namudar hoga. Phir Ansar mein se ek shakhs namudar hua, us ki dadhi wuzu ke pani se tapak rahi thi, us ne apne jootay apne haath mein apne bayen taraf latkaye hue thay. Us ne hamein salam kiya. Agle din Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne isi jaisa farmaya, aur wo shakhs pehli martaba jaisi halat mein namudar hua. Teesre din, Aap sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne apne qaul jaisa farmaya, aur wo shakhs pehli martaba jaisi halat mein namudar hua. Jab Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam khare hue, to Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As un ke peeche gaye aur kaha: Main ne apne walid se jhagra kiya aur qasam khayi ke teen din tak un ke paas nahin jaunga, pas agar aap munasib samjhen ke teen din tak mujhe apne paas thahrayen yahan tak ke teen din guzar jayen, to aisa karen. Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Anas ne kaha: Abdullah bayan kiya karte thay ke wo un ke paas teen raaten thahre aur unhein raat mein hargiz namaz ke liye khare hote hue nahin dekha, siwa is ke ke jab wo apne bistar par karwat badalte - ya unhon ne kaha: palt-te - to Allah Azzawajal ko yaad karte aur takbeer kehte yahan tak ke fajr ki namaz ke liye uthte. Abdullah ibn Amr ne kaha: Siwa is ke ke main ne un se bhalayi ke siwa kuch nahin suna. Jab teen raaten guzar gayin, to main ne un ke amal ko taqreeban haqeer samjha. Main ne kaha: Ae Abdullah, mere aur mere walid ke darmiyan na koi gussa tha na koi judayi, lekin main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko tumhare bare mein teen martaba farmate hue suna: Abhi tumhare paas Jannat walon mein se ek shakhs namudar hoga, aur tum teeno martaba namudar hue. Pas main ne chaha ke tumhare paas thahrun taake dekhun ke tumhare amal kya hain taake main tumhari pairvi karun, lekin main ne tumhein zyada amal karte hue nahin dekha. To wo kya cheez hai jis ne tumhein us maqam tak pahunchaya jo Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Ye us ke siwa kuch nahin jo tum ne dekha. Jab main wapas palta, to unhon ne mujhe pukara aur kaha: Ye us ke siwa kuch nahin jo tum ne dekha, siwa is ke ke main apne dil mein kisi Musalman ke liye koi dhoka nahin pata, aur na hi main kisi par us bhalayi par hasad karta hun jo Allah Azzawajal ne use ata ki hai. Abdullah ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Yehi cheez hai jis ne tumhein buland kiya, aur yehi hai jis ki hum taqat nahin rakhte."
"1160","Hamein Abd al-Razzaq ne khabar di, hamein Mamar ne al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Anas ibn Malik ne khabar di, kehte hue: Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se sab se zyada mushabeh koi shakhs al-Hasan ibn Ali radiyallahu anhuma se barh kar nahin tha."
"1161","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam apne ghore se gir pare aur un ka dahina pehlu chhil gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir log un ke pas aaye to unhon ne baithe hue un ke saath namaz parhayi aur un ki taraf ishara kiya ke baith jao. Jab unhon ne salam phera to farmaya: Imam sirf is liye muqarrar kiya gaya hai ke us ki iqtida ki jaye; jab woh takbir kahe to tum takbir kaho, aur jab woh ruku kare to tum ruku karo, aur jab woh kahe: sami'Allahu liman hamidah to tum kaho: rabbana wa laka al-hamd, aur jab woh sajda kare to tum sajda karo, aur jab woh baith kar namaz parhaye to tum sab mil kar baith kar namaz parho."
"1162","Aur isi sanad ke saath, Anas se riwayat hai: ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam namaz ke dauran ishara farmaya karte the."
"1163","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Peer ke din Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne hujre ka parda uthaya aur Abu Bakr ko logon ko namaz parhate hue dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Maine un ke chehre ko dekha goya woh mushaf ka warq ho is haal mein ke woh muskur rahe the. Hum qareeb the ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko dekhne ki khushi se apni namaz mein phir jayen. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abu Bakr peeche hatna chahe to unhon ne un ki taraf ishara kiya ke jaise ho waise hi raho. Phir unhon ne parda gira diya aur usi din wafaat pa gaye. Phir Umar khare hue aur kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne wafaat nahi payi, balke un ke Rabb ne unhein bulaya hai jaise Musa ko bulaya tha jo apni qaum se chalis raatein door rahe. Allah ki qasam, mujhe umeed hai ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam zinda rahenge yahan tak ke munafiqeen mein se un logon ke haath aur zubanein kaat denge jo da'wa karte hain - ya unhon ne kaha: jo kehte hain - ke Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam wafaat pa gaye hain."
"1164","Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Usamah ibn Zayd ne hamein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Uhud ke din Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Hamzah ke pas se guzre ba'd is ke ke un ka musla kiya gaya tha aur unhein bigada gaya tha, to farmaya: Agar Safiyyah ko apne dil mein ranj hone ka andesha na hota to main unhein chhor deta yahan tak ke Allah unhein darindon aur parindon ke peton se jama kare. Unhein ek dhari daar chadar mein kafnaya gaya: jab un ka sar dhaka jata to paon khul jate aur jab paon dhake jate to sar khul jata, pas un ka sar dhaka gaya. Unhon ne kisi shaheed par janaze ki namaz nahi parhayi aur farmaya: Main aaj tum par gawah hun. Woh ek qabr mein do ya teen ko jama karte, phir puchte: In mein Quran sab se zyada kis ko yaad hai? Aur us ko lahd mein aage rakhte. Aur ek kapre mein do ya teen aadmiyon ko kafn dete."
"1165","Yahya ibn Ghaylan ne mujhe bayan kiya, al-Mufaddal ibn Fudalah ne hamein bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uqayl ibn Khalid al-Ayli ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, ke unhon ne un se bayan kiya, Anas se, Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam suraj dhalne se pehle rawana hote to Zuhr ko Asr ke waqt tak muakkhar karte, phir utar kar dono namazon ko jama karte; aur agar suraj dhalne se pehle rawana hone se qabl suraj dhal jata to Zuhr parh kar phir sawari par sawar hote."
"1166","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ibn al-Hajjaj ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Main aur Qayamat is tarah bheje gaye hain jaise ye do - aur unhon ne darmiyani ungli aur shahadat ki ungli se ishara kiya."
"1167","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jannat mein dakhil hone wala koi shakhs ye nahi chahta ke woh duniya ki taraf laut jaye agarche us ke pas zameen ki pusht par jo kuch hai sab ho, siwaye shaheed ke, pas woh chahta hai ke woh duniya mein laut kar das martaba qatl kiya jaye, us izzat ki wajah se jo woh dekhta hai."
"1168","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara Rabb Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Agar mera banda mujh se ek balisht qareeb aata hai to main us se ek haath qareeb aata hun; aur agar woh mujh se ek haath qareeb aata hai to main us se ek ba' qareeb aata hun; aur agar woh mere pas chal kar aata hai to main us ke pas daud kar aata hun."
"1169","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Ai ibn-e-Adam, agar tu mujhe apne dil mein yaad kare to main tujhe apne dil mein yaad karta hun; aur agar tu mujhe kisi majlis mein yaad kare to main tujhe farishton ki majlis mein - ya unhon ne kaha: un se behtar majlis mein - yaad karta hun; aur agar tu mujh se ek balisht qareeb aaye to main tujh se ek haath qareeb aata hun, aur agar tu mujh se ek haath qareeb aaye to main tujh se ek ba' qareeb aata hun, aur agar tu mere pas chal kar aaye to main tere pas daud kar aata hun. Ma'mar ne kaha: Qatadah ne kaha: Aur Allah Azza wa Jalla bakhshish mein zyada tez hai."
"1170","Yazid ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ruku aur sajda mukammal karo, pas main tumhein apni peeth ke peeche se dekhta hun - aur shayad unhon ne kaha: apne peeche se - jab tum ruku aur sajda karte ho."
"1171","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar ye andesha na hota ke tum ek dusre ko dafan karna chhor doge to main Allah se dua karta ke woh tumhein qabr ka azab suna de."
"1172","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Aag se us shakhs ko nikal do jis ne la ilaha illAllah kaha aur us ke dil mein zarra barabar khair thi; Aag se us shakhs ko nikal do jis ne la ilaha illAllah kaha aur us ke dil mein jau ke dane barabar khair thi; Aag se us shakhs ko nikal do jis ne la ilaha illAllah kaha aur us ke dil mein chhote keere barabar khair thi."
"1173","Yazid ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne ahl-e-Rum ko khat likha lekin unhein jawab nahi diya gaya. Un se kaha gaya: Ye parha nahi jata jab tak is par muhr na lagayi jaye. Unhon ne kaha: Pas Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne chandi ki ek anguthi li aur us par naqsh karwaya: Muhammad Rasul Allah. Anas ne kaha: Goya main ab bhi us ki safedi un ke haath par dekh raha hun."
"1174","Yazid ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi momin nahi hota yahan tak ke woh apne bhai - ya apne parosi - ke liye wohi pasand kare jo apne liye pasand karta hai."
"1175","Yazid ne hamein khabar di, Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam se, ke unhon ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi momin nahi hota yahan tak ke main us ke nazdeek us ki aulaad aur us ke walid aur tamaam logon se zyada mehboob na ho jaun."
"1176","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hammam ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki na'lain par do tasme the."
"1177","Yazid ibn Harun ne hamein khabar di, Hammam ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas ibn Malik se pucha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko kaun sa libas sab se zyada pasand - ya azeez - tha? Unhon ne kaha: Hibarah (dhari daar Yamani chadar)."
"1178","Yazid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hamein khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla momin par us ki kisi ek neki ko zaya nahi karta; use us ka badla is duniya mein diya jata hai aur aakhirat mein bhi us ka ajr diya jata hai. Raha kafir, to use is duniya mein us ki nekiyon ka badla de diya jata hai jo us ne Allah Azza wa Jalla ke liye ki thin, yahan tak ke jab woh aakhirat mein pahunchega to Allah ke han us ki koi neki baqi nahi hogi jis par use jaza di jaye."
"1179","Rawh ibn Ubadah al-Qaysi ne hamein bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah ne hamein bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, ke Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam farmaya karte the: Kafir ko Qayamat ke din laya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Tera kya khayal hai, agar tere pas zameen bhar sona ho to kya tu us ke badle apna fidya dega? Woh kahega: Haan. Phir us se kaha jayega: Tune jhoot bola; tujh se is se zyada aasan cheez ka mutalaba kiya gaya tha."
"1180","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hamein bayan kiya, Shayban ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hamein bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne hamein khabar di, kehte hue: Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab bande ko us ki qabr mein rakha jata hai aur us ke saathi peeth pher kar laut jate hain to woh un ke jooton ki aahat sunta hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Do farishte us ke pas aate hain aur use bithate hain, aur us se kehte hain: Tum is aadmi ke baare mein kya kehte the? Unhon ne farmaya: Raha momin, to woh kehta hai: Main gawahi deta hun ke ye Allah ke bande aur us ke Rasul hain. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir us se kaha jata hai: Apna Jahannum wala thikana dekho; Allah ne us ke badle tumhein Jannat mein thikana de diya hai. Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aur woh dono ko dekhta hai. Qatadah ne kaha: Aur hamein bataya gaya ke us ki qabr us ke liye sattar haath wasee kar di jati hai, aur Qayamat tak us ke liye sabza zaar se bhar di jati hai."
"1181","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se riwayat ki, Shayban ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne hum se riwayat ki ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, kafir Qayamat ke din apne chehre ke bal kis tarah jama kiya jayega? Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Woh Zat jis ne use us ke paon par chalaya is par qadir hai ke use Aag mein us ke chehre ke bal chalaye."
"1182","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se riwayat ki, Shayban ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, Anas ibn Malik ne hum se riwayat ki ke Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahannam kehti rahegi: Kya kuch aur hai, yahan tak ke Rabb-ul-Izzat us mein Apna qadam rakhega, to woh kahegi: Bas bas, Aap ki izzat ki qasam, aur woh simat jayegi, us ka ek hissa dusre hisse se mil jayega."
"1183","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke saye mein sawar sau baras tak safar karta rahega aur use ubur na kar sakega."
"1184","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Ahl-e-Makkah ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se ek nishani mangi, to Makkah mein chand do martaba phat gaya. Phir nazil hua: Qayamat qareeb aa gayi aur chand phat gaya, Us ke qaul tak: Mustamirr jadu - yani jata hua."
"1185","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke pas us raat jab unhen raat ki sair karayi gayi al-Buraq laya gaya, zin-posh aur lagam-dar haalat mein, lekin woh Aap par mushkil hua. Jibril ne us se kaha: Kya tu Muhammad ke sath aisa karta hai? Tujh par un se zyada Allah ke nazdik muazzaz koi sawar nahin hua. Unhon ne kaha: To woh paseene se sharabor ho gaya."
"1186","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se riwayat ki, Hisham al-Dastuwai ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah ne hum se riwayat ki, Anas ibn Malik se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Momin Qayamat ke din jama honge aur us Din ke bare mein fikrmand honge, aur kahenge: Kash hum apne Rabb ke huzur shafaat talab karen yahan tak ke woh hamen hamari is jagah se nijaat de. To woh Adam ke pas ayenge aur un se kahenge: Ae Adam, aap bashariyat ke walid hain; Allah ne aap ko Apne dast-e-qudrat se paida kiya, Apne farishton se aap ko sajda karwaya, aur aap ko tamam cheezon ke naam sikhaye, to hamare liye hamare Rabb ke huzur shafaat kijiye yahan tak ke woh hamen hamari is jagah se nijaat de. Woh un se kahenge: Main is ke liye nahin hun, aur woh apna gunah jo un se sarzad hua zikr karenge; lekin Nuh ke pas jao, woh pehle rasul hain jinhen Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ahl-e-zamin ki taraf bheja. To woh Nuh ke pas ayenge, to woh un se kahenge: Main is ke liye nahin hun, aur woh un se apna gunah jo un se sarzad hua zikr karenge; lekin Ibrahim ke pas jao jo Rahman ke khalil hain. To woh Ibrahim ke pas ayenge, to woh un se kahenge: Main is ke liye nahin hun, aur woh un se apni khataen jo un se sarzad huin zikr karenge; lekin Musa ke pas jao, woh bande jinhen Allah ne Taurat di aur un se kalaam farmaya. To woh Musa ke pas ayenge, to woh un se kahenge: Main is ke liye nahin hun, aur woh un se apna gunah jo un se sarzad hua zikr karenge; lekin Isa ke pas jao jo Allah ke Rasul aur Us ki ruh aur Us ka kalima hain. To woh Isa ke pas ayenge, to woh kahenge: Main is ke liye nahin hun, lekin Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke pas jao, woh bande jin ke agle pichhle gunah bakhsh diye gaye hain. Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya - aur tamam anbiya par salam ho: To woh mere pas ayenge, aur main un ke sath chalunga aur apne Rabb se ijazat talab karunga, aur mujhe ijazat di jayegi. Jab main apne Rabb ko dekhunga to Us ke huzur sajde mein gir jaunga, aur woh mujhe der tak chhore rakhega jitni der Allah chhore rakhna chahega. Phir woh farmayega: Ae Muhammad, apna sar uthao; mango, diya jayega, aur shafaat karo, tumhari shafaat qubul ki jayegi. To main apne Rabb ki aisi hamd-o-sana karunga jo Us ne mujhe sikhayi hai. Phir main un ke liye ek hadd muqarrar karunga aur unhen Jannat mein dakhil karunga. Phir main dusri martaba lautunga aur apne Rabb se ijazat talab karunga, aur mujhe ijazat di jayegi. Jab main apne Rabb ko dekhunga to Us ke huzur sajde mein gir jaunga, aur woh mujhe der tak chhore rakhega jitni der Allah chhore rakhna chahega. Phir woh farmayega: Ae Muhammad, apna sar uthao; mango, diya jayega, aur shafaat karo, tumhari shafaat qubul ki jayegi. To main apne Rabb ki aisi hamd-o-sana karunga jo Us ne mujhe sikhayi hai. Phir main un ke liye dusri hadd muqarrar karunga aur unhen Jannat mein dakhil karunga. Phir main teesri martaba lautunga aur apne Rabb se ijazat talab karunga, aur mujhe ijazat di jayegi. Jab main apne Rabb ko dekhunga to Us ke huzur sajde mein gir jaunga, aur woh mujhe der tak chhore rakhega jitni der Allah chhore rakhna chahega. Phir woh farmayega: Ae Muhammad, apna sar uthao; mango, diya jayega, aur shafaat karo, tumhari shafaat qubul ki jayegi. To main apne Rabb ki aisi hamd-o-sana karunga jo Us ne mujhe sikhayi hai. Phir main un ke liye teesri hadd muqarrar karunga aur unhen Jannat mein dakhil karunga, yahan tak ke main laut kar kahunga: Ae mere Rabb, Aag mein koi baqi nahin raha siwaye us ke jis par hamesha rehna wajib ho gaya ya jise Quran ne rok liya."
"1187","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah aur Aban se, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Ae logo, apne Rabb se daro; beshak Qayamat ka zalzala bahut badi cheez hai, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par nazil hui jab Aap apne asfaar mein se ek safar mein the, to Aap ne use buland awaz se parha yahan tak ke Aap ke Sahaba Aap ke gird jama ho gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho ye kaun sa din hai? Woh din jab Allah Azza wa Jalla Adam alaihis salam se farmayega: Ae Adam, utho aur Jahannam ka lashkar bhejo: har hazar mein se nau sau ninyanwe Jahannam ki taraf, aur ek Jannat ki taraf. Ye Musalmanon par bhari guzri, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Durust amal karo, qurb hasil karo, aur khushkhabri pao; Us Zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jan hai, tum insanon mein magar unt ke pehlu par til ki tarah ho, ya janwar ke agle paon par nishan ki tarah. Aur tumhare sath do makhluq hain: jab bhi woh kisi ke sath huin use barha diya: Ya'juj aur Ma'juj, aur insanon aur jinnon mein se jo kafir halak hue."
"1188","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se riwayat ki, Shayban ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne hum se riwayat ki ke Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam par al-Hudaybiyyah se wapsi par wahi nazil hui, jabke Aap ke Sahaba gham aur ranj mein ghule hue the, kyunke unhen apne manasik se rok diya gaya tha aur unhon ne al-Hudaybiyyah mein qurbani ke janwar zibah kiye the. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh par ek aisi ayat nazil hui hai jo mujhe tamam duniya se zyada mahbub hai. Phir Aap ne use apne Sahaba ko parh kar sunaya, to unhon ne kaha: Mubarak ho Ae Allah ke Nabi; Allah ne wazeh kar diya ke woh Aap ke sath kya karega, to woh hamare sath kya karega? Phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne us bare mein nazil farmaya: Taake woh momin mardon aur momin aurton ko baghat mein dakhil kare, tak: Bahut badi kamyabi."
"1189","Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se riwayat ki, Ma'mar se, Qatadah se, Anas se, Us ke farman ke bare mein: Beshak Hum ne aap ko al-Kawthar ata kiya, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Woh Jannat mein ek nahr hai - ya Nabi ne farmaya: Main ne Jannat mein ek nahr dekhi jis ke kinare moti ke gumbad the. Main ne kaha: Ye kya hai Ae Jibril? Unhon ne kaha: Ye al-Kawthar hai jo Allah ne aap ko ata farmayi hai."
"1190","Muhammad ibn Bishr al-Abdi ne hum se riwayat ki, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah ne hum se riwayat ki, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke pas Zayd ibn Thabit ke humrah sehri layi gayi. Jab Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sehri se farigh hue to fajr ki namaz ke liye khare hue. To hum ne Anas se kaha: Aap ki sehri se faraghat aur Aap ke namaz mein dakhil hone ke darmiyan kitna waqfa tha? Unhon ne kaha: Jitni der mein admi pachaas ayaten tilawat kare."
"1191","Ya'la ibn Ubayd ne hum se riwayat ki, Muhammad ibn Ubaydullah al-Arzami ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, Anas se: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aur Abu Bakr aur Umar ke peeche namaz parhi, aur main ne un mein se kisi ko buland awaz se Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim parhte hue nahin suna."
"1192","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne hum se kaha: Main tumhen ek hadith bayan karunga jo mere bad tumhen koi bayan nahin karega: Main ne Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Qayamat ki nishaniyon mein se hai ke ilm uth jayega, jahalat zahir hogi, sharab pi jayegi, zina phail jayega, mard kam ho jayenge, aur aurten barh jayengi, yahan tak ke pachaas aurton ka nigran ek mard hoga."
"1193","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Ubayy ibn Ka'b se farmaya: Mere Rabb ne mujhe hukm diya hai ke main tumhen Quran parh kar sunaun. Ubayy ne kaha: Kya Us ne Aap se mera naam liya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aur Us ne tumhara naam lekar mujh se kaha hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Ubayy ro pare."
"1194","Abd al-Razzaq ne hamen khabar di, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Sa'd ibn Mu'adh ka janaza uthaya gaya to munafiqon ne kaha: Us ka janaza kitna halka hai - aur ye Banu Qurayzah ke bare mein un ke faisle ki wajah se tha. Ye bat Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tak pahunchi, to Aap ne farmaya: Farishte use uthaye hue the."
"1195","Abu al-Walid ne mujh se riwayat ki, Hammam ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah ne hum se riwayat ki, Anas se ke ek shakhs masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz mein the, aur us ne kaha: Alhamdulillah hamdan kathiran tayyiban mubarakan. Jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: Tum mein se kis ne aise aise alfaz kahe? Log khamosh ho gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kis ne use kaha - tin martaba? Us shakhs ne kaha: Main ne kaha, aur mera irada us se siwaye bhalayi ke kuch na tha. Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Barah farishte use pehle lene ke liye daude, woh na jante the ke use kis tarah likhen, to tumhare Rabb Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Use likh do jaisa Mere bande ne kaha hai."
"1196","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Muhammad ibn Bishr ne hum se riwayat ki, Sa'id ibn Abi Arubah se - yani Qatadah se - Anas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se, ke Aap ne farmaya: Logon ko kya hua hai ke woh apni namaz ke dauran apni ankhen asman ki taraf uthate hain? Aap ki guftagu us bare mein sakht ho gayi, yahan tak ke Aap ne farmaya: Woh is se zaroor baz ayenge, warna un ki basarat cheen li jayegi."
"1197","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Zayd ibn Hubab al-Ukli ne mujh se riwayat ki, Ali ibn Mas'adah se, Qatadah ne hum se riwayat ki, Anas ibn Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasul Allah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har ibn-e-Adam khata karta hai, aur khata karne walon mein behtarin tauba karne wale hain."
"1198","Ibn Abi Shaybah ne mujh se riwayat ki, Mus'ab ibn al-Miqdam ne hum se riwayat ki, Abu Hilal ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kabhi khutba nahin diya magar Aap ne farmaya: Us ka iman nahin jo amanatdar nahin."
"1199","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne hum se riwayat ki, Shayban ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, Anas ne hum se riwayat ki ke Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apne asfaar mein se ek safar mein the, aur Mu'adh ibn Jabal Aap ke peeche sawar the, un ke aur Aap ke darmiyan pallan ke pichhle hisse ke siwa kuch na tha. Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ae Mu'adh. Unhon ne kaha: Hazir hun Ae Allah ke Rasul, aur madad ke liye tayyar hun. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho bandon par Allah Azza wa Jalla ka kya haq hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Bandon par Allah Azza wa Jalla ka haq ye hai ke woh Us ki ibadat karen aur Us ke sath kisi ko sharik na thahrayen. Aap ne farmaya: Phir kya tum jante ho jab woh aisa karen to Allah Azza wa Jalla par bandon ka kya haq hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasul zyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Allah par un ka haq ye hai ke woh unhen azab na de."
"1200","Yunus ibn Muhammad ne mujh se riwayat ki, Shayban ne hum se riwayat ki, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ibn Malik ne hum se riwayat ki ke Allah ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko resham ki ek umda chadar tohfe mein di gayi, halanke woh resham se mana karte the. Log us par mutaajjib hue, to Aap ne farmaya: Us Zat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jan hai, Jannat mein Sa'd ibn Mu'adh ke rumal is se behtar hain."
